window.__BOOK__={"meta": {"title_en": "The Little Prince", "title_zh": "小王子", "author_en": "Antoine de Saint-Exupéry", "author_zh": "安托万·德·圣埃克苏佩里", "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural (edge-tts)", "ipa_note": "音标为宽式音位转写（英语近似发音，不标重音），仅供参考。", "n_chapters": 28, "n_paras": 762, "n_sents": 1635, "audio_paras": 762}, "chapters": [{"id": "ch00", "title_en": "To Leon Werth", "title_zh": "献词", "paras": [{"id": "ch00p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I ask the indulgence of the children who may read this book for dedicating it to a grown-up.", "zh": "请孩子们原谅我把这本书献给一位大人。", "t": [138, 5575]}, {"en": "I have a serious reason: he is the best friend I have in the world.", "zh": "他是我世间最好的朋友。", "t": [5575, 9762]}, {"en": "I have another reason: this grown-up understands everything, even books about children.", "zh": "这位大人洞察一切，即便是对孩子的书也能心领神会。", "t": [9762, 15150]}, {"en": "I have a third reason: he lives in France where he is hungry and cold.", "zh": "他住在法国，忍饥受寒。", "t": [15150, 19675]}, {"en": "He needs cheering up.", "zh": "他亟需慰藉。", "t": [19675, 21462]}, {"en": "If all these reasons are not enough, I will dedicate the book to the child from whom this grown-up grew.", "zh": "若这些理由仍不足够，我便将此书献予那位成人曾是的孩童。", "t": [21462, 27300]}, {"en": "All grown-ups were once children—although few of them remember it.", "zh": "所有大人曾经都是孩子——尽管他们中的许多人已不记得。", "t": [27300, 31388]}, {"en": "And so I correct my dedication: To Leon Werth, when he was a little boy.", "zh": "因此，我将献词更正：献予列翁·维尔特，他曾是孩童时。", "t": [31388, 36000]}]}]}, {"id": "ch01", "title_en": "Chapter I", "title_zh": "第 1 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch01p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Once when I was six years old I saw a magnificent picture in a book, called True Stories from Nature, about the primeval forest.", "zh": "六岁那年，我在一本名为《自然奇观》的书里，瞥见了一幅描绘原始森林的壮丽图画。", "t": [138, 8012]}, {"en": "It was a picture of a boa constrictor in the act of swallowing an animal.", "zh": "这是一幅蟒蛇正在吞食动物的图画。", "t": [8012, 12450]}, {"en": "Here is a copy of the drawing.", "zh": "这是这幅画的复印件。", "t": [12450, 14112]}]}, {"id": "ch01p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In the book it said: \"Boa constrictors swallow their prey whole, without chewing it.", "zh": "书中记载：“蟒蛇将猎物整个吞下，不嚼就吞。”", "t": [112, 5262]}, {"en": "After that they are not able to move, and they sleep through the six months that they need for digestion.\"", "zh": "它们便无法动弹，需在消化过程中沉睡六个月。", "t": [5262, 10512]}]}, {"id": "ch01p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I pondered deeply, then, over the adventures of the jungle.", "zh": "我沉思良久，对丛林奇遇心生遐想。", "t": [138, 4212]}, {"en": "And after some work with a coloured pencil I succeeded in making my first drawing.", "zh": "经过一番用彩色铅笔的练习，我终于完成了我的第一幅画。", "t": [4212, 9150]}, {"en": "My Drawing Number One.", "zh": "我的第一幅画。", "t": [9150, 11000]}, {"en": "It looked like this:", "zh": "它看起来是这样的：", "t": [11000, 12188]}]}, {"id": "ch01p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I showed my masterpiece to the grown-ups, and asked them whether the drawing frightened them.", "zh": "我把我的杰作展示给大人看，问他们这幅画是否吓到了他们。", "t": [138, 4900]}]}, {"id": "ch01p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But they answered: \"Frighten?", "zh": "吓什么？", "t": [100, 2362]}, {"en": "Why should any one be frightened by a hat?\"", "zh": "帽子有什么好怕的？", "t": [2362, 4813]}]}, {"id": "ch01p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "My drawing was not a picture of a hat.", "zh": "我的画作并非帽子图。", "t": [112, 2850]}, {"en": "It was a picture of a boa constrictor digesting an elephant.", "zh": "这是一幅蟒蛇消化大象的图画。", "t": [2850, 6838]}, {"en": "But since the grown-ups were not able to understand it, I made another drawing: I drew the inside of the boa constrictor, so that the grown-ups could see it clearly.", "zh": "但既然大人们无法理解，我便又画了一张：我画了蟒蛇的内部，好让大人们能看得一清二楚。", "t": [6838, 15700]}, {"en": "They always need to have things explained.", "zh": "他们总需要有人给他们解释。", "t": [15700, 18275]}, {"en": "My Drawing Number Two looked like this:", "zh": "我的第二号画看起来是这样的：", "t": [18275, 20525]}]}, {"id": "ch01p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The grown-ups' response, this time, was to advise me to lay aside my drawings of boa constrictors, whether from the inside or the outside, and devote myself instead to geography, history, arithmetic and grammar.", "zh": "大人们这次则劝我放下对蟒蛇的描绘，无论是从内部还是外部，转而投身于地理、历史、算术和语法的学习。", "t": [138, 12875]}, {"en": "That is why, at the age of six, I gave up what might have been a magnificent career as a painter.", "zh": "六岁那年，我便放弃了可能成为辉煌画家的生涯。", "t": [12875, 18888]}, {"en": "I had been disheartened by the failure of my Drawing Number One and my Drawing Number Two.", "zh": "我的第一幅画和第二幅画均以失败告终，令我心灰意冷。", "t": [18888, 24188]}, {"en": "Grown-ups never understand anything by themselves, and it is tiresome for children to be always and forever explaining things to them.", "zh": "大人自己永远不懂，孩子们总是不断地向他们解释，这实在令人厌烦。", "t": [24188, 31500]}]}, {"id": "ch01p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then I chose another profession, and learned to pilot airplanes.", "zh": "于是，我选择了另一门职业，学会了驾驶飞机。", "t": [125, 4388]}, {"en": "I have flown a little over all parts of the world; and it is true that geography has been very useful to me.", "zh": "我驾驶飞机飞越了世界的各个角落；确实，地理学对我帮助极大。", "t": [4388, 10600]}, {"en": "At a glance I can distinguish China from Arizona.", "zh": "一目了然，便能分辨出中国与亚利桑那。", "t": [10600, 14238]}, {"en": "If one gets lost in the night, such knowledge is valuable.", "zh": "若夜航迷失，此等知识便显宝贵。", "t": [14238, 17650]}]}, {"id": "ch01p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In the course of this life I have had a great many encounters with a great many people who have been concerned with matters of consequence.", "zh": "在这漫长的人生旅程中，我与众多关注重大事务的人们有过无数次的相遇。", "t": [112, 7388]}, {"en": "I have lived a great deal among grown-ups.", "zh": "我在成人世界中度过许多时光。", "t": [7388, 10212]}, {"en": "I have seen them intimately, close at hand.", "zh": "我近距离地与他们亲密接触。", "t": [10212, 13400]}, {"en": "And that hasn't much improved my opinion of them.", "zh": "我对他们的看法并未有多大改观。", "t": [13400, 16113]}]}, {"id": "ch01p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Whenever I met one of them who seemed to me at all clear-sighted, I tried the experiment of showing him my Drawing Number One, which I have always kept.", "zh": "每当我遇到一个在我看来还算有洞察力的大人，我便尝试向他展示我始终保留的那幅《第一号画》。", "t": [138, 8312]}, {"en": "I would try to find out, so, if this was a person of true understanding.", "zh": "我试图探查，看这究竟是否是一个真正懂得理解的人。", "t": [8312, 13062]}, {"en": "But, whoever it was, he, or she, would always say: \"That is a hat.\"", "zh": "但无论他是谁，他或她总是会说：“那是一顶帽子。”", "t": [13062, 17774]}]}, {"id": "ch01p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then I would never talk to that person about boa constrictors, or primeval forests, or stars.", "zh": "于是，我便不再与那个人谈论蟒蛇、原始森林或星星。", "t": [138, 6188]}, {"en": "I would bring myself down to his level.", "zh": "我降低自己的身份以适应他。", "t": [6188, 8800]}, {"en": "I would talk to him about bridge, and golf, and politics, and neckties.", "zh": "我与他说起桥牌、高尔夫、政治和领带。", "t": [8800, 13750]}, {"en": "And the grown-up would be greatly pleased to have met such a sensible man.", "zh": "这位大人对结识如此明理的人感到非常满意。", "t": [13750, 17624]}]}]}, {"id": "ch02", "title_en": "Chapter II", "title_zh": "第 2 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch02p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So I lived my life alone, without anyone that I could really talk to, until I had an accident with my plane in the Desert of Sahara, six years ago.", "zh": "于是，我独自一人生活，无人可倾诉衷肠，直至六年前，我的飞机在撒哈拉沙漠遭遇事故。", "t": [138, 8812]}, {"en": "Something was broken in my engine.", "zh": "发动机里出了故障。", "t": [8812, 11175]}, {"en": "And as I had with me neither a mechanic nor any passengers, I set myself to attempt the difficult repairs all alone.", "zh": "于是，身边既无机械师，又无乘客相伴，我便孤身一人尝试着艰难地修理。", "t": [11175, 18238]}, {"en": "It was a question of life or death for me: I had scarcely enough drinking water to last a week.", "zh": "生死攸关，我仅有的饮用水只够维持一周。", "t": [18238, 23888]}, {"en": "The first night, then, I went to sleep on the sand, a thousand miles from any human habitation.", "zh": "那第一夜，我便在千里之外、人迹罕至的沙地上安睡。", "t": [23888, 30138]}, {"en": "I was more isolated than a shipwrecked sailor on a raft in the middle of the ocean.", "zh": "我比孤舟在茫茫大海中的遇险者还要孤独。", "t": [30138, 35088]}, {"en": "Thus you can imagine my amazement, at sunrise, when I was awakened by an odd little voice.", "zh": "晨曦初露，那奇异的细小声音将我惊醒，我惊愕不已。", "t": [35088, 40950]}, {"en": "It said:", "zh": "它说：", "t": [40950, 41626]}]}, {"id": "ch02p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If you please-- draw me a sheep!\"", "zh": "请给我画一只绵羊吧！", "t": [112, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch02p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What!\"", "zh": "什么！", "t": [112, 500]}]}, {"id": "ch02p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Draw me a sheep!\"", "zh": "画只绵羊吧！", "t": [112, 1100]}]}, {"id": "ch02p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I jumped to my feet, completely thunderstruck.", "zh": "我惊得跳了起来，如遭雷击。", "t": [138, 3462]}, {"en": "I blinked my eyes hard.", "zh": "我紧闭双眼，用力眨动。", "t": [3462, 5400]}, {"en": "I looked carefully all around me.", "zh": "我环顾四周，仔细打量。", "t": [5400, 7738]}, {"en": "And I saw a most extraordinary small person, who stood there examining me with great seriousness.", "zh": "我瞥见一个极为奇特的小人儿，他正一本正经地打量着我。", "t": [7738, 13662]}, {"en": "Here you may see the best portrait that, later, I was able to make of him.", "zh": "这里可见我后来为他画的最成功的肖像。", "t": [13662, 18312]}, {"en": "But my drawing is certainly very much less charming than its model.", "zh": "但我的画作显然远不及它的原型迷人。", "t": [18312, 22050]}]}, {"id": "ch02p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "That, however, is not my fault.", "zh": "这并非我的过错。", "t": [138, 3025]}, {"en": "The grown-ups discouraged me in my painter's career when I was six years old, and I never learned to draw anything, except boas from the outside and boas from the inside.", "zh": "六岁那年，大人们便扼杀了我的画家梦想，我从未学会画任何东西，除了从外面看的蟒蛇和从里面看的蟒蛇。", "t": [3025, 12125]}]}, {"id": "ch02p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Now I stared at this sudden apparition with my eyes fairly starting out of my head in astonishment.", "zh": "我惊愕地瞪大了眼睛，几乎要目不转睛地凝视着这个突如其来的身影。", "t": [112, 5938]}, {"en": "Remember, I had crashed in the desert a thousand miles from any inhabited region.", "zh": "记得，我在人烟稀少的沙漠中，千里之外遭遇了坠机。", "t": [5938, 11150]}, {"en": "And yet my little man seemed neither to be straying uncertainly among the sands, nor to be fainting from fatigue or hunger or thirst or fear.", "zh": "他似乎既不是在沙中迷失方向，也不是因疲惫、饥饿、口渴或恐惧而昏倒。", "t": [11150, 19350]}, {"en": "Nothing about him gave any suggestion of a child lost in the middle of the desert, a thousand miles from any human habitation.", "zh": "他身上丝毫没有在沙漠中迷失方向、远离人烟千里的孩子的痕迹。", "t": [19350, 26862]}, {"en": "When at last I was able to speak, I said to him:", "zh": "终于开口说话，我对他说：", "t": [26862, 29863]}]}, {"id": "ch02p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But-- what are you doing here?\"", "zh": "但——你在此做什么？", "t": [100, 1574]}]}, {"id": "ch02p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And in answer he repeated, very slowly, as if he were speaking of a matter of great consequence:", "zh": "他缓缓地回答，仿佛在谈论一件极重要的事情：", "t": [138, 5788]}]}, {"id": "ch02p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If you please-- draw me a sheep...\"", "zh": "请给我画一只羊吧……", "t": [112, 1887]}]}, {"id": "ch02p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When a mystery is too overpowering, one dare not disobey.", "zh": "当神秘的力量压倒一切，人不敢违抗。", "t": [138, 4225]}, {"en": "Absurd as it might seem to me, a thousand miles from any human habitation and in danger of death, I took out of my pocket a sheet of paper and my fountain pen.", "zh": "荒诞至极，远离人烟千里，生死攸关之际，我还是从口袋里掏出了一张纸和一支钢笔。", "t": [4225, 13550]}, {"en": "But then I remembered how my studies had been concentrated on geography, history, arithmetic, and grammar, and I told the little chap (a little crossly, too) that I did not know how to draw.", "zh": "然而，我回想起我的学业专注于地理、历史、算术和语法，便有些不悦地对那个小家伙说，我不会画画。", "t": [13550, 24838]}, {"en": "He answered me:", "zh": "他回答道：", "t": [24838, 25800]}]}, {"id": "ch02p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That doesn't matter.", "zh": "这无妨。", "t": [138, 1688]}, {"en": "Draw me a sheep...\"", "zh": "画一只羊吧……", "t": [1688, 2787]}]}, {"id": "ch02p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But I had never drawn a sheep.", "zh": "但我从未画过羊。", "t": [100, 2288]}, {"en": "So I drew for him one of the two pictures I had drawn so often.", "zh": "于是，我为他画出了我常画的其中一幅。", "t": [2288, 6375]}, {"en": "It was that of the boa constrictor from the outside.", "zh": "这是从外面看的蟒蛇。", "t": [6375, 9738]}, {"en": "And I was astounded to hear the little fellow greet it with,", "zh": "我惊愕地听见那小家伙对它说：", "t": [9738, 12887]}]}, {"id": "ch02p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No, no, no!", "zh": "不！不！不！", "t": [112, 1988]}, {"en": "I do not want an elephant inside a boa constrictor.", "zh": "我不想在蟒蛇肚子里有一只大象。", "t": [1988, 5488]}, {"en": "A boa constrictor is a very dangerous creature, and an elephant is very cumbersome.", "zh": "蟒蛇极为危险，而大象又非常笨重。", "t": [5488, 10800]}, {"en": "Where I live, everything is very small.", "zh": "在我居住的地方，一切都极小。", "t": [10800, 13738]}, {"en": "What I need is a sheep.", "zh": "我需要的是一只羊。", "t": [13738, 15500]}, {"en": "Draw me a sheep.\"", "zh": "画一只羊吧。", "t": [15500, 16550]}]}, {"id": "ch02p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then I made a drawing.", "zh": "于是，我画了一幅画。", "t": [125, 1563]}]}, {"id": "ch02p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He looked at it carefully, then he said:", "zh": "他仔细端详着，然后说道：", "t": [138, 2438]}]}, {"id": "ch02p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.", "zh": "不！", "t": [100, 1000]}, {"en": "This sheep is already very sickly.", "zh": "这羊已经病得很重了。", "t": [1000, 3450]}, {"en": "Make me another.\"", "zh": "再给我画一个。", "t": [3450, 4475]}]}, {"id": "ch02p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So I made another drawing.", "zh": "于是，我又画了一张。", "t": [112, 1700]}]}, {"id": "ch02p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "My friend smiled gently and indulgently.", "zh": "我的朋友微笑着，既温柔又宽容。", "t": [125, 2888]}]}, {"id": "ch02p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You see yourself,\" he said, \"that this is not a sheep.", "zh": "这显然不是一只羊。", "t": [138, 3750]}, {"en": "This is a ram.", "zh": "这是一只公羊。", "t": [3750, 5100]}, {"en": "It has horns.\"", "zh": "它长着角哩。", "t": [5100, 6050]}]}, {"id": "ch02p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then I did my drawing over once more.", "zh": "于是，我又重新画了一次。", "t": [125, 2525]}]}, {"id": "ch02p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But it was rejected too, just like the others.", "zh": "但这幅画也被拒绝了，就像其他那些一样。", "t": [100, 2937]}]}, {"id": "ch02p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This one is too old.", "zh": "这只太老了。", "t": [138, 1912]}, {"en": "I want a sheep that will live a long time.\"", "zh": "我要一只能活很久的羊。", "t": [1912, 4088]}]}, {"id": "ch02p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "By this time my patience was exhausted, because I was in a hurry to start taking my engine apart.", "zh": "我的耐心已耗尽，急于开始拆卸我的发动机。", "t": [100, 5775]}]}, {"id": "ch02p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So I tossed off this drawing.", "zh": "于是，我草草地画了这幅画。", "t": [112, 2225]}, {"en": "And I threw out an explanation with it.", "zh": "于是，我随口解释道。", "t": [2225, 4475]}]}, {"id": "ch02p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This is only his box.", "zh": "这不过是他的一只箱子。", "t": [138, 1975]}, {"en": "The sheep you asked for is inside.\"", "zh": "那你要的绵羊就在里面。", "t": [1975, 4088]}]}, {"id": "ch02p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I was very surprised to see a light break over the face of my young judge:", "zh": "我惊讶地看到，我的这位小法官脸上露出了光芒：", "t": [138, 4263]}]}, {"id": "ch02p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is exactly the way I wanted it!", "zh": "这正是我想要的！", "t": [138, 2688]}, {"en": "Do you think that this sheep will have to have a great deal of grass?\"", "zh": "这只绵羊需要很多草吗？", "t": [2688, 6025]}]}, {"id": "ch02p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why?\"", "zh": "为什么？", "t": [125, 625]}]}, {"id": "ch02p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because where I live everything is very small...\"", "zh": "因为在我住的地方，一切都极小。", "t": [138, 2763]}]}, {"id": "ch02p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"There will surely be enough grass for him,\" I said.", "zh": "我说：“肯定够了。”", "t": [138, 3262]}, {"en": "\"It is a very small sheep that I have given you.\"", "zh": "我给你的是一只很小很小的绵羊。", "t": [3262, 5862]}]}, {"id": "ch02p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He bent his head over the drawing:", "zh": "他俯身细看那幅画。", "t": [138, 2000]}]}, {"id": "ch02p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Not so small that-- Look!", "zh": "如此小巧，看哪！", "t": [112, 2000]}, {"en": "He has gone to sleep...\"", "zh": "它已经入睡……", "t": [2000, 3275]}]}, {"id": "ch02p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And that is how I made the acquaintance of the little prince.", "zh": "就这样，我结识了小王子。", "t": [112, 3200]}]}]}, {"id": "ch03", "title_en": "Chapter III", "title_zh": "第 3 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch03p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It took me a long time to learn where he came from.", "zh": "我费了好长时间才弄清他来自何方。", "t": [138, 3225]}, {"en": "The little prince, who asked me so many questions, never seemed to hear the ones I asked him.", "zh": "小王子虽向我提问无数，却似乎对我的问题充耳不闻。", "t": [3225, 8888]}, {"en": "It was from words dropped by chance that, little by little, everything was revealed to me.", "zh": "偶然间的话语，渐渐向我揭示了所有真相。", "t": [8888, 14037]}]}, {"id": "ch03p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The first time he saw my airplane, for instance (I shall not draw my airplane; that would be much too complicated for me), he asked me:", "zh": "例如，他头一回见到我的飞机时（我不愿画飞机，那太复杂了），便问我：", "t": [138, 7738]}]}, {"id": "ch03p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is that object?\"", "zh": "那是什么玩意儿？", "t": [100, 1526]}]}, {"id": "ch03p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is not an object.", "zh": "那不是玩意儿。", "t": [138, 1938]}, {"en": "It flies.", "zh": "它会飞。", "t": [1938, 3125]}, {"en": "It is an airplane.", "zh": "这是飞机。", "t": [3125, 4675]}, {"en": "It is my airplane.\"", "zh": "这是我的飞机。", "t": [4675, 5962]}]}, {"id": "ch03p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And I was proud to have him learn that I could fly.", "zh": "我为他能知道我会飞而自豪。", "t": [138, 2838]}]}, {"id": "ch03p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He cried out, then:", "zh": "他突然喊道：", "t": [112, 1587]}]}, {"id": "ch03p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What!", "zh": "怎么！", "t": [112, 875]}, {"en": "You dropped down from the sky?\"", "zh": "你是从天上掉下来的吗？", "t": [875, 2613]}]}, {"id": "ch03p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes,\" I answered, modestly.", "zh": "是的，我谦逊地回答。", "t": [125, 2475]}]}, {"id": "ch03p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!", "zh": "啊！", "t": [100, 762]}, {"en": "That is funny!\"", "zh": "这倒有趣！", "t": [762, 1675]}]}, {"id": "ch03p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince broke into a lovely peal of laughter, which irritated me very much.", "zh": "那小王子突然发出一阵清脆的笑声，这笑声让我非常恼火。", "t": [138, 5450]}, {"en": "I like my misfortunes to be taken seriously.", "zh": "我愿我的不幸得到认真对待。", "t": [5450, 8288]}]}, {"id": "ch03p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then he added:", "zh": "他接着又说：", "t": [138, 1137]}]}, {"id": "ch03p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"So you, too, come from the sky!", "zh": "你们也是从天上来的！", "t": [112, 2838]}, {"en": "Which is your planet?\"", "zh": "这是你的星球吗？", "t": [2838, 4100]}]}, {"id": "ch03p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "At that moment I caught a gleam of light in the impenetrable mystery of his presence; and I demanded, abruptly:", "zh": "那一刻，我瞥见了他神秘身影中的光芒；于是，我突兀地问道：", "t": [138, 6474]}]}, {"id": "ch03p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do you come from another planet?\"", "zh": "你们也是从另一个星球来的吗？", "t": [100, 1950]}]}, {"id": "ch03p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he did not reply.", "zh": "他并未回答。", "t": [100, 1938]}, {"en": "He tossed his head gently, without taking his eyes from my plane:", "zh": "他轻轻摇晃着头，目光未离我的飞机。", "t": [1938, 5687]}]}, {"id": "ch03p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is true that on that you can't have come from very far away...\"", "zh": "那确实，你不可能从很远处来到这里……", "t": [138, 3600]}]}, {"id": "ch03p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he sank into a reverie, which lasted a long time.", "zh": "他陷入沉思，久久未能自拔。", "t": [138, 3762]}, {"en": "Then, taking my sheep out of his pocket, he buried himself in the contemplation of his treasure.", "zh": "他掏出我的绵羊，便沉浸在心爱宝物的沉思之中。", "t": [3762, 9250]}]}, {"id": "ch03p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "You can imagine how my curiosity was aroused by this half-confidence about the \"other planets.\" I made a great effort, therefore, to find out more on this subject.", "zh": "我好奇之心被他对“其他星球”的这种半信半疑所激起，因此我竭力想了解更多关于这个话题。", "t": [112, 9900]}]}, {"id": "ch03p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My little man, where do you come from?", "zh": "我的小家伙，你从哪里来？", "t": [112, 2775]}, {"en": "What is this 'where I live,' of which you speak?", "zh": "这“我住在哪里”，你所说的那是什么意思？", "t": [2775, 5825]}, {"en": "Where do you want to take your sheep?\"", "zh": "你打算把你的绵羊带到哪里去？", "t": [5825, 7488]}]}, {"id": "ch03p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After a reflective silence he answered:", "zh": "沉思片刻后，他回答道：", "t": [112, 2513]}]}, {"id": "ch03p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The thing that is so good about the box you have given me is that at night he can use it as his house.\"", "zh": "这箱子你送给我真是太好了，夜里他可以用它做屋子。", "t": [138, 5388]}]}, {"id": "ch03p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is so.", "zh": "这倒是。", "t": [125, 1362]}, {"en": "And if you are good I will give you a string, too, so that you can tie him during the day, and a post to tie him to.\"", "zh": "若你听话，我还会给你一根绳子，白天用来拴住它，再给你一个桩子。", "t": [1362, 7575]}]}, {"id": "ch03p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince seemed shocked by this offer:", "zh": "小王子对这个提议似乎感到震惊：", "t": [100, 2750]}]}, {"id": "ch03p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Tie him!", "zh": "拴住他！", "t": [112, 1062]}, {"en": "What a queer idea!\"", "zh": "真是个古怪的主意！", "t": [1062, 2274]}]}, {"id": "ch03p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But if you don't tie him,\" I said, \"he will wander off somewhere, and get lost.\"", "zh": "“可是，如果你不拴住他，”我说，“他会到处乱跑，然后走失的。”", "t": [100, 4663]}]}, {"id": "ch03p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "My friend broke into another peal of laughter:", "zh": "我的朋友又爆发出一阵笑声：", "t": [112, 2787]}]}, {"id": "ch03p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But where do you think he would go?\"", "zh": "他以为它会跑到哪里去呢？", "t": [100, 1863]}]}, {"id": "ch03p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Anywhere.", "zh": "无论哪里。", "t": [112, 1112]}, {"en": "Straight ahead of him.\"", "zh": "前方，就在他面前。", "t": [1112, 2412]}]}, {"id": "ch03p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then the little prince said, earnestly:", "zh": "小王子认真地说：", "t": [138, 2462]}]}, {"id": "ch03p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That doesn't matter.", "zh": "那无关紧要。", "t": [138, 1700]}, {"en": "Where I live, everything is so small!\"", "zh": "我所在之处的万物都如此渺小。", "t": [1700, 4074]}]}, {"id": "ch03p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, with perhaps a hint of sadness, he added:", "zh": "带着一丝忧伤，他补充道：", "t": [138, 3263]}]}, {"id": "ch03p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Straight ahead of him, nobody can go very far...\"", "zh": "前方，无人能走得太远……", "t": [125, 3188]}]}]}, {"id": "ch04", "title_en": "Chapter IV", "title_zh": "第 4 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch04p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I had thus learned a second fact of great importance: this was that the planet the little prince came from was scarcely any larger than a house!", "zh": "我因此得知了第二个重要的事实：小王子来自的星球，其大小不过是一座房子的规模。", "t": [138, 7825]}]}, {"id": "ch04p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But that did not really surprise me much.", "zh": "但这并未真正让我感到惊讶。", "t": [100, 2838]}, {"en": "I knew very well that in addition to the great planets-- such as the Earth, Jupiter, Mars, Venus-- to which we have given names, there are also hundreds of others, some of which are so small that one has a hard time seeing them through the telescope.", "zh": "除了那些被我们命名的巨大行星——如地球、木星、火星、金星——之外，还有数百颗其他行星，其中一些小得连望远镜都难以辨认。", "t": [2838, 15925]}, {"en": "When an astronomer discovers one of these he does not give it a name, but only a number.", "zh": "天文学家发现这类星球时，并不赋予它们名字，而只赋予它们编号。", "t": [15925, 21100]}, {"en": "He might call it, for example, \"Asteroid 325.\"", "zh": "他或许会称之为“小行星325号”。", "t": [21100, 24913]}]}, {"id": "ch04p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I have serious reason to believe that the planet from which the little prince came is the asteroid known as B-612.", "zh": "我有充分的理由相信，小王子来自的星球是B-612号小行星。", "t": [138, 6700]}]}, {"id": "ch04p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "This asteroid has only once been seen through the telescope.", "zh": "这颗小行星仅被望远镜观测过一次。", "t": [125, 4025]}, {"en": "That was by a Turkish astronomer, in 1909.", "zh": "那是一位土耳其天文学家在1909年观测到的。", "t": [4025, 7313]}]}, {"id": "ch04p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On making his discovery, the astronomer had presented it to the International Astronomical Congress, in a great demonstration.", "zh": "天文学家在发现之际，曾于国际天文大会上作了一场盛大的演示。", "t": [138, 7750]}, {"en": "But he was in Turkish costume, and so nobody would believe what he said.", "zh": "但他身着土耳其服装，因此无人相信他的话。", "t": [7750, 11813]}]}, {"id": "ch04p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Grown-ups are like that...", "zh": "大人就是这样……", "t": [100, 1575]}]}, {"id": "ch04p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Fortunately, however, for the reputation of Asteroid B-612, a Turkish dictator made a law that his subjects, under pain of death, should change to European costume.", "zh": "幸而，为了B-612小行星的声誉，土耳其独裁者颁布了一道法令，规定臣民必须改穿欧洲服装，违者处以死刑。", "t": [125, 10700]}, {"en": "So in 1920 the astronomer gave his demonstration all over again, dressed with impressive style and elegance.", "zh": "于是，1920年，这位天文学家再次身着考究的服饰，仪态万方地展示了他的演示。", "t": [10700, 17888]}, {"en": "And this time everybody accepted his report.", "zh": "这一次，众人都接受了他的报告。", "t": [17888, 20725]}]}, {"id": "ch04p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "If I have told you these details about the asteroid, and made a note of its number for you, it is on account of the grown-ups and their ways.", "zh": "若非为了这些大人及其习性，我才不会向你们详述这颗小行星的细节，并记下它的编号。", "t": [138, 7812]}, {"en": "When you tell them that you have made a new friend, they never ask you any questions about essential matters.", "zh": "告诉他们你交了一个新朋友，他们从不询问任何重要的事情。", "t": [7812, 13712]}, {"en": "They never say to you, \"What does his voice sound like?", "zh": "他们从不会问你：“他的嗓音是怎样的？”", "t": [13712, 17088]}, {"en": "What games does he love best?", "zh": "他最喜欢玩什么游戏？", "t": [17088, 19275]}, {"en": "Does he collect butterflies?\" Instead, they demand: \"How old is he?", "zh": "他是否采集蝴蝶标本？", "t": [19275, 24600]}, {"en": "How many brothers has he?", "zh": "他有多少个兄弟？", "t": [24600, 26562]}, {"en": "How much does he weigh?", "zh": "他体重多少？", "t": [26562, 28275]}, {"en": "How much money does his father make?\" Only from these figures do they think they have learned anything about him.", "zh": "他们只从这些数字中认为他们已经了解了他。", "t": [28275, 34362]}]}, {"id": "ch04p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "If you were to say to the grown-ups: \"I saw a beautiful house made of rosy brick, with geraniums in the windows and doves on the roof,\" they would not be able to get any idea of that house at all.", "zh": "若你对大人说：“我看见一幢红砖砌成的美丽房子，窗台上种着天竺葵，屋顶栖息着鸽子，”他们便无法想象这房子的模样。", "t": [138, 10750]}, {"en": "You would have to say to them: \"I saw a house that cost $20,000.\" Then they would exclaim: \"Oh, what a pretty house that is!\"", "zh": "你们得对他们说：“我看见一幢价值两万法郎的房子。”他们就会惊叹：“哦，多美的房子啊！”", "t": [10750, 18713]}]}, {"id": "ch04p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Just so, you might say to them: \"The proof that the little prince existed is that he was charming, that he laughed, and that he was looking for a sheep.", "zh": "小王子存在的证据，便是他风度翩翩、笑声朗朗，且在寻找一只绵羊。", "t": [100, 8188]}, {"en": "If anybody wants a sheep, that is a proof that he exists.\" And what good would it do to tell them that?", "zh": "若有人想要一只绵羊，这便是他存在的证明。告诉他们这些又有什么用呢？", "t": [8188, 14725]}, {"en": "They would shrug their shoulders, and treat you like a child.", "zh": "他们耸耸肩，把你当做个孩子。", "t": [14725, 18212]}, {"en": "But if you said to them: \"The planet he came from is Asteroid B-612,\" then they would be convinced, and leave you in peace from their questions.", "zh": "若你对他们说：“他来自的星球是B-612号小行星，”他们便会信服，不再对你纠缠不休。", "t": [18212, 26100]}]}, {"id": "ch04p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "They are like that.", "zh": "他们就是这样。", "t": [138, 1612]}, {"en": "One must not hold it against them.", "zh": "不可因此而怪罪他们。", "t": [1612, 3875]}, {"en": "Children should always show great forbearance toward grown-up people.", "zh": "孩子们理应对大人怀有极大的宽容。", "t": [3875, 7662]}]}, {"id": "ch04p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But certainly, for us who understand life, figures are a matter of indifference.", "zh": "然而，对于我们这些懂得生活的人来说，数字不过是无关紧要之物。", "t": [100, 5425]}, {"en": "I should have liked to begin this story in the fashion of the fairy-tales.", "zh": "我本想以童话的形式开始这个故事。", "t": [5425, 9562]}, {"en": "I should have like to say: \"Once upon a time there was a little prince who lived on a planet that was scarcely any bigger than himself, and who had need of a sheep...\"", "zh": "从前有个小王子，他住在一颗比他自己大不了多少的星球上，需要一只绵羊。", "t": [9562, 17862]}]}, {"id": "ch04p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "To those who understand life, that would have given a much greater air of truth to my story.", "zh": "这会让我的故事显得更加真实，对于那些懂得生活的人来说。", "t": [100, 5212]}]}, {"id": "ch04p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For I do not want any one to read my book carelessly.", "zh": "我不愿有人漫不经心地读我的书。", "t": [125, 3625]}, {"en": "I have suffered too much grief in setting down these memories.", "zh": "我记录这些回忆，心中满是哀伤。", "t": [3625, 7412]}, {"en": "Six years have already passed since my friend went away from me, with his sheep.", "zh": "六年来，我的朋友带着他的羊离我远去。", "t": [7412, 12325]}, {"en": "If I try to describe him here, it is to make sure that I shall not forget him.", "zh": "若我尝试在此描述他，那是为了确保我不会忘记他。", "t": [12325, 16988]}, {"en": "To forget a friend is sad.", "zh": "遗忘朋友是可悲的。", "t": [16988, 19038]}, {"en": "Not every one has had a friend.", "zh": "并非人人都有过朋友。", "t": [19038, 21275]}, {"en": "And if I forget him, I may become like the grown-ups who are no longer interested in anything but figures...", "zh": "若我忘记了他，我或许会变成那些只对数字感兴趣的成年人……", "t": [21275, 26874]}]}, {"id": "ch04p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It is for that purpose, again, that I have bought a box of paints and some pencils.", "zh": "为此，我又买了一盒颜料和几支铅笔。", "t": [138, 5288]}, {"en": "It is hard to take up drawing again at my age, when I have never made any pictures except those of the boa constrictor from the outside and the boa constrictor from the inside, since I was six.", "zh": "在这个年纪重拾绘画，对我而言实属不易，自从六岁那年画过一条从外面看的蟒蛇和一条从里面看的蟒蛇后，我从未再画过其他图画。", "t": [5288, 15875]}, {"en": "I shall certainly try to make my portraits as true to life as possible.", "zh": "我将尽力让我的肖像画尽可能逼真。", "t": [15875, 20288]}, {"en": "But I am not at all sure of success.", "zh": "但我并不确信能成功。", "t": [20288, 22912]}, {"en": "One drawing goes along all right, and another has no resemblance to its subject.", "zh": "一幅画得还可以，另一幅却与原型相差甚远。", "t": [22912, 27975]}, {"en": "I make some errors, too, in the little prince's height: in one place he is too tall and in another too short.", "zh": "我描绘小王子的身高时，也犯了一些错误：有时他画得太高，有时又太矮。", "t": [27975, 34712]}, {"en": "And I feel some doubts about the colours of his costume.", "zh": "我对他的服装颜色也有些疑虑。", "t": [34712, 38038]}, {"en": "So I fumble along as best I can, now good, now bad, and I hope generally fair-to-middling.", "zh": "我笨拙地摸索前行，时而出色，时而糟糕，但愿总体上还能过得去。", "t": [38038, 43825]}]}, {"id": "ch04p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In certain more important details I shall make mistakes, also.", "zh": "在某些更为重要的细节上，我也难免出错。", "t": [138, 4575]}, {"en": "But that is something that will not be my fault.", "zh": "但这并非是我的过错。", "t": [4575, 7538]}, {"en": "My friend never explained anything to me.", "zh": "我的朋友从不向我解释任何事。", "t": [7538, 10438]}, {"en": "He thought, perhaps, that I was like himself.", "zh": "他或许以为我与他相似。", "t": [10438, 13850]}, {"en": "But I, alas, do not know how to see sheep through the walls of boxes.", "zh": "然而，唉，我不知如何透过箱子的墙壁看到绵羊。", "t": [13850, 18475]}, {"en": "Perhaps I am a little like the grown-ups.", "zh": "或许我也有点像大人了。", "t": [18475, 21125]}, {"en": "I have had to grow old.", "zh": "我不得不变老。", "t": [21125, 22575]}]}]}, {"id": "ch05", "title_en": "Chapter V", "title_zh": "第 5 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch05p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As each day passed I would learn, in our talk, something about the little prince's planet, his departure from it, his journey.", "zh": "随着日复一日，在与他的交谈中，我逐渐了解了小王子的星球、他离开那里的经过以及他的旅行。", "t": [138, 7700]}, {"en": "The information would come very slowly, as it might chance to fall from his thoughts.", "zh": "信息缓缓而来，如同偶然自他思绪中飘落。", "t": [7700, 12675]}, {"en": "It was in this way that I heard, on the third day, about the catastrophe of the baobabs.", "zh": "就这样，第三天，我听说了猴面包树的灾难。", "t": [12675, 17687]}]}, {"id": "ch05p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "This time, once more, I had the sheep to thank for it.", "zh": "这次，又是绵羊让我得以知晓。", "t": [125, 4012]}, {"en": "For the little prince asked me abruptly-- as if seized by a grave doubt-- \"It is true, isn't it, that sheep eat little bushes?\"", "zh": "小王子突然严肃地问我：“羊真的会吃小灌木吗？”", "t": [4012, 10862]}]}, {"id": "ch05p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is true.\"", "zh": "是的，千真万确。", "t": [112, 1663]}]}, {"id": "ch05p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "啊！", "t": [100, 850]}, {"en": "I am glad!\"", "zh": "啊，太好了！", "t": [850, 1675]}]}, {"id": "ch05p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not understand why it was so important that sheep should eat little bushes.", "zh": "我不懂羊儿为何要吃那些小灌木如此重要。", "t": [138, 4850]}, {"en": "But the little prince added:", "zh": "小王子接着说：", "t": [4850, 6525]}]}, {"id": "ch05p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then it follows that they also eat baobabs?\"", "zh": "那么，它们也会吃猴面包树吗？", "t": [125, 2787]}]}, {"id": "ch05p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I pointed out to the little prince that baobabs were not little bushes, but, on the contrary, trees as big as castles; and that even if he took a whole herd of elephants away with him, the herd would not eat up one single baobab.", "zh": "我向小王子指出，猴面包树并非小灌木，相反，它们是像城堡一般巨大的树木；即便他带上一群大象，那群大象也无法吃掉一棵猴面包树。", "t": [138, 12250]}]}, {"id": "ch05p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The idea of the herd of elephants made the little prince laugh.", "zh": "那群大象的念头让小王子忍不住笑了。", "t": [138, 3726]}]}, {"id": "ch05p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We would have to put them one on top of the other,\" he said.", "zh": "它们必须得一个挨一个地叠上去。", "t": [138, 3187]}]}, {"id": "ch05p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he made a wise comment:", "zh": "但他却说了句明智的话：", "t": [112, 1738]}]}, {"id": "ch05p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Before they grow so big, the baobabs start out by being little.\"", "zh": "在它们长得太大之前，猴面包树起初只是小小的。", "t": [112, 3962]}]}, {"id": "ch05p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is strictly correct,\" I said.", "zh": "那完全正确。", "t": [138, 2712]}, {"en": "\"But why do you want the sheep to eat the little baobabs?\"", "zh": "可你为何要让羊儿吃掉那些小猴面包树苗呢？", "t": [2712, 5725]}]}, {"id": "ch05p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He answered me at once, \"Oh, come, come!\", as if he were speaking of something that was self-evident.", "zh": "他立刻回答道：“哦，哦，当然啦！”仿佛在谈论一件不言而喻的事。", "t": [138, 6412]}, {"en": "And I was obliged to make a great mental effort to solve this problem, without any assistance.", "zh": "我不得不竭尽全力去解决这个问题，毫无助力。", "t": [6412, 11812]}]}, {"id": "ch05p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Indeed, as I learned, there were on the planet where the little prince lived-- as on all planets-- good plants and bad plants.", "zh": "确实，正如我所了解的，小王子居住的星球上——就像所有星球一样——既有好植物也有坏植物。", "t": [138, 7112]}, {"en": "In consequence, there were good seeds from good plants, and bad seeds from bad plants.", "zh": "因此，既有来自好植物的良种，也有来自坏植物的恶种。", "t": [7112, 12550]}, {"en": "But seeds are invisible.", "zh": "种子是看不见的。", "t": [12550, 14562]}, {"en": "They sleep deep in the heart of the earth's darkness, until some one among them is seized with the desire to awaken.", "zh": "它们在地球黑暗的深处沉睡，直至其中一颗被唤醒的欲望所攫获。", "t": [14562, 21062]}, {"en": "Then this little seed will stretch itself and begin-- timidly at first-- to push a charming little sprig inoffensively upward toward the sun.", "zh": "这颗小小的种子将伸展身躯，起初是胆怯地，开始向上向太阳推送一根迷人的小嫩枝。", "t": [21062, 28850]}, {"en": "If it is only a sprout of radish or the sprig of a rose-bush, one would let it grow wherever it might wish.", "zh": "若它只是一株萝卜苗或玫瑰枝，便任其生长，无论它愿往何处。", "t": [28850, 35075]}, {"en": "But when it is a bad plant, one must destroy it as soon as possible, the very first instant that one recognizes it.", "zh": "但若是恶草，一经辨认，便须立即铲除，绝不可拖延。", "t": [35075, 41913]}]}, {"id": "ch05p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Now there were some terrible seeds on the planet that was the home of the little prince; and these were the seeds of the baobab.", "zh": "这颗星球上长着可怕的种子，那是猴面包树的种子。", "t": [125, 6638]}, {"en": "The soil of that planet was infested with them.", "zh": "那颗星球的土壤被它们侵扰。", "t": [6638, 9638]}, {"en": "A baobab is something you will never, never be able to get rid of if you attend to it too late.", "zh": "若你晚些时候才留意，那猴面包树你将永远无法摆脱。", "t": [9638, 15200]}, {"en": "It spreads over the entire planet.", "zh": "它覆盖了整个星球。", "t": [15200, 17662]}, {"en": "It bores clear through it with its roots.", "zh": "根须将它彻底穿透。", "t": [17662, 20375]}, {"en": "And if the planet is too small, and the baobabs are too many, they split it in pieces...", "zh": "若星球太小，而猴面包树太多，它们就会把星球撕裂成碎片。", "t": [20375, 25337]}]}, {"id": "ch05p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is a question of discipline,\" the little prince said to me later on.", "zh": "“这关乎自律，”小王子后来对我说。", "t": [138, 4225]}, {"en": "\"When you've finished your own toilet in the morning, then it is time to attend to the toilet of your planet, just so, with the greatest care.", "zh": "清晨梳洗完毕，便要细心照料你那颗星球的清洁。", "t": [4225, 11962]}, {"en": "You must see to it that you pull up regularly all the baobabs, at the very first moment when they can be distinguished from the rosebushes which they resemble so closely in their earliest youth.", "zh": "务必在猴面包树与玫瑰花苗初生时难以区分之际，立即将它们连根拔除。", "t": [11962, 22138]}, {"en": "It is very tedious work,\" the little prince added, \"but very easy.\"", "zh": "这活儿单调乏味，却也极易完成。", "t": [22138, 26274]}]}, {"id": "ch05p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And one day he said to me: \"You ought to make a beautiful drawing, so that the children where you live can see exactly how all this is.", "zh": "于是有一天他对我说：“你应该画一幅漂亮的画，好让你们那里的孩子们能清楚地看到这一切。”", "t": [138, 7425]}, {"en": "That would be very useful to them if they were to travel some day.", "zh": "若他们日后旅行，这将会很有用。", "t": [7425, 11238]}, {"en": "Sometimes,\" he added, \"there is no harm in putting off a piece of work until another day.", "zh": "有时，他补充道，“推迟一件工作到另一天也无妨。", "t": [11238, 16650]}, {"en": "But when it is a matter of baobabs, that always means a catastrophe.", "zh": "但若是猴面包树的事，那就总是意味着灾难。", "t": [16650, 20962]}, {"en": "I knew a planet that was inhabited by a lazy man.", "zh": "那颗星球上住着一个懒惰的人。", "t": [20962, 24488]}, {"en": "He neglected three little bushes...\"", "zh": "他忽略了三株小灌木……", "t": [24488, 26600]}]}, {"id": "ch05p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So, as the little prince described it to me, I have made a drawing of that planet.", "zh": "于是，按照小王子向我描述的那样，我画下了那颗星球。", "t": [125, 5338]}, {"en": "I do not much like to take the tone of a moralist.", "zh": "我不喜欢摆出一副道德家的嘴脸。", "t": [5338, 8525]}, {"en": "But the danger of the baobabs is so little understood, and such considerable risks would be run by anyone who might get lost on an asteroid, that for once I am breaking through my reserve.", "zh": "然而，人们对猴面包树的危害认识不足，而在小行星上迷路的人面临的风险又如此之大，我不得不打破一贯的矜持。", "t": [8525, 18775]}, {"en": "\"Children,\" I say plainly, \"watch out for the baobabs!\"", "zh": "孩子们，当心猴面包树！", "t": [18775, 22063]}]}, {"id": "ch05p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "My friends, like myself, have been skirting this danger for a long time, without ever knowing it; and so it is for them that I have worked so hard over this drawing.", "zh": "朋友们，就像我一样，他们长期以来一直在不知不觉中规避这个危险；因此，为了他们，我才在这幅画上倾注了如此多的心血。", "t": [125, 9612]}, {"en": "The lesson which I pass on by this means is worth all the trouble it has cost me.", "zh": "这教训，虽费尽周折，却值得我付出所有。", "t": [9612, 13988]}]}, {"id": "ch05p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Perhaps you will ask me, \"Why are there no other drawing in this book as magnificent and impressive as this drawing of the baobabs?\"", "zh": "或许你们会问我：“为什么这本书里的其他插画没有这幅猴面包树的画那么雄伟、那么令人印象深刻？”", "t": [100, 6887]}]}, {"id": "ch05p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The reply is simple.", "zh": "答案简单。", "t": [138, 1875]}, {"en": "I have tried.", "zh": "我曾尝试。", "t": [1875, 3212]}, {"en": "But with the others I have not been successful.", "zh": "但画那些其他的画，我并不成功。", "t": [3212, 6288]}, {"en": "When I made the drawing of the baobabs I was carried beyond myself by the inspiring force of urgent necessity.", "zh": "在绘制猴面包树时，紧迫的需求激励着我，我的画笔超越了自我。", "t": [6288, 12463]}]}]}, {"id": "ch06", "title_en": "Chapter VI", "title_zh": "第 6 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch06p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Oh, little prince!", "zh": "哦，小王子！", "t": [125, 1925]}, {"en": "Bit by bit I came to understand the secrets of your sad little life...", "zh": "逐渐地，我逐渐洞悉了你那悲伤的小生活的秘密……", "t": [1925, 6362]}, {"en": "For a long time you had found your only entertainment in the quiet pleasure of looking at the sunset.", "zh": "长久以来，你唯一的乐趣便是在观赏夕阳的宁静中寻找快乐。", "t": [6362, 12112]}, {"en": "I learned that new detail on the morning of the fourth day, when you said to me:", "zh": "第四天清晨，你向我提及了这个新细节：", "t": [12112, 16338]}]}, {"id": "ch06p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am very fond of sunsets.", "zh": "我偏爱那夕阳的余晖。", "t": [138, 2350]}, {"en": "Come, let us go look at a sunset now.\"", "zh": "让我们去看日落吧。", "t": [2350, 4850]}]}, {"id": "ch06p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But we must wait,\" I said.", "zh": "但我道：“然而，我们必须等待。”", "t": [100, 1975]}]}, {"id": "ch06p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Wait?", "zh": "然而，为何等待？", "t": [125, 1012]}, {"en": "For what?\"", "zh": "为何等待？", "t": [1012, 1788]}]}, {"id": "ch06p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"For the sunset.", "zh": "只为那日落。", "t": [112, 1600]}, {"en": "We must wait until it is time.\"", "zh": "我们得等到那时。", "t": [1600, 3538]}]}, {"id": "ch06p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "At first you seemed to be very much surprised.", "zh": "你起初显得非常惊讶。", "t": [138, 3225]}, {"en": "And then you laughed to yourself.", "zh": "你自嘲地笑了。", "t": [3225, 5262]}, {"en": "You said to me:", "zh": "你对我说：", "t": [5262, 6200]}]}, {"id": "ch06p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am always thinking that I am at home!\"", "zh": "我总以为我是在自己家里呢！", "t": [138, 2388]}]}, {"id": "ch06p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Just so.", "zh": "如此而已。", "t": [100, 1300]}, {"en": "Everybody knows that when it is noon in the United States the sun is setting over France.", "zh": "人人皆知，当美国正值正午时分，法国已是夕阳西下。", "t": [1300, 6250]}]}, {"id": "ch06p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "If you could fly to France in one minute, you could go straight into the sunset, right from noon.", "zh": "若能瞬间飞往法国，便可从正午直奔日落。", "t": [138, 5812]}, {"en": "Unfortunately, France is too far away for that.", "zh": "遗憾的是，法国太远了。", "t": [5812, 9262]}, {"en": "But on your tiny planet, my little prince, all you need do is move your chair a few steps.", "zh": "然而，在你那小小的星球上，小王子，你只需挪动你的椅子几步。", "t": [9262, 15025]}, {"en": "You can see the day end and the twilight falling whenever you like...", "zh": "你随时都能目睹白昼落幕，暮色降临。", "t": [15025, 18700]}]}, {"id": "ch06p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"One day,\" you said to me, \"I saw the sunset forty-four times!\"", "zh": "“有一天，”你对我说，“我看了四十四次日落！”", "t": [125, 4188]}]}, {"id": "ch06p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And a little later you added:", "zh": "你后来又补充道：", "t": [112, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch06p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know-- one loves the sunset, when one is so sad...\"", "zh": "你深知——当一个人愁绪满怀时，便偏爱那夕阳的余晖……", "t": [125, 3300]}]}, {"id": "ch06p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Were you so sad, then?\" I asked, \"on the day of the forty-four sunsets?\"", "zh": "那天，四十四次日落，你如此忧伤吗？", "t": [112, 5226]}]}, {"id": "ch06p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince made no reply.", "zh": "小王子默然不语。", "t": [100, 2312]}]}]}, {"id": "ch07", "title_en": "Chapter VII", "title_zh": "第 7 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch07p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On the fifth day-- again, as always, it was thanks to the sheep-- the secret of the little prince's life was revealed to me.", "zh": "第五天——又像往常一样，多亏了那只绵羊——小王子生活的秘密向我透露了出来。", "t": [138, 6912]}, {"en": "Abruptly, without anything to lead up to it, and as if the question had been born of long and silent meditation on his problem, he demanded:", "zh": "他突然提出，仿佛这个问题经过他长时间的沉默深思才诞生出来。", "t": [6912, 14913]}]}, {"id": "ch07p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A sheep-- if it eats little bushes, does it eat flowers, too?\"", "zh": "绵羊若吃小灌木，也会吃花吗？", "t": [112, 3974]}]}, {"id": "ch07p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A sheep,\" I answered, \"eats anything it finds in its reach.\"", "zh": "绵羊，见什么吃什么。", "t": [138, 3800]}]}, {"id": "ch07p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Even flowers that have thorns?\"", "zh": "连带刺的花也吃吗？", "t": [112, 1974]}]}, {"id": "ch07p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, even flowers that have thorns.\"", "zh": "是的，连带刺的花也吃。", "t": [138, 2537]}]}, {"id": "ch07p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then the thorns-- what use are they?\"", "zh": "那刺还有什么用呢？", "t": [125, 1937]}]}, {"id": "ch07p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not know.", "zh": "我不知其所以然。", "t": [112, 1562]}, {"en": "At that moment I was very busy trying to unscrew a bolt that had got stuck in my engine.", "zh": "那时我正忙于拧下卡在发动机里的螺栓。", "t": [1562, 6800]}, {"en": "I was very much worried, for it was becoming clear to me that the breakdown of my plane was extremely serious.", "zh": "我深感忧虑，因为我的飞机故障显然极其严重。", "t": [6800, 13175]}, {"en": "And I had so little drinking water left that I had to fear for the worst.", "zh": "我剩下的饮用水寥寥无几，不禁担忧着最坏的结果。", "t": [13175, 17126]}]}, {"id": "ch07p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The thorns-- what use are they?\"", "zh": "刺，它们有何用？", "t": [138, 1724]}]}, {"id": "ch07p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince never let go of a question, once he had asked it.", "zh": "小王子一旦提问，便锲而不舍。", "t": [138, 4275]}, {"en": "As for me, I was upset over that bolt.", "zh": "至于我，那螺栓让我心烦意乱。", "t": [4275, 7425]}, {"en": "And I answered with the first thing that came into my head:", "zh": "我随口答道：", "t": [7425, 10424]}]}, {"id": "ch07p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The thorns are of no use at all.", "zh": "刺毫无用处。", "t": [138, 2450]}, {"en": "Flowers have thorns just for spite!\"", "zh": "花儿长刺，只为泄愤。", "t": [2450, 4576]}]}, {"id": "ch07p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!\"", "zh": "哦！", "t": [100, 412]}]}, {"id": "ch07p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "There was a moment of complete silence.", "zh": "一时寂静无声。", "t": [138, 2800]}, {"en": "Then the little prince flashed back at me, with a kind of resentfulness:", "zh": "小王子带着一丝怨恨，向我闪过一瞥。", "t": [2800, 6750]}]}, {"id": "ch07p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I don't believe you!", "zh": "我不信你的话！", "t": [138, 1600]}, {"en": "Flowers are weak creatures.", "zh": "花儿是脆弱的生物。", "t": [1600, 3812]}, {"en": "They are naive.", "zh": "她们天真无邪。", "t": [3812, 5138]}, {"en": "They reassure themselves as best they can.", "zh": "她们尽力自我安慰。", "t": [5138, 8075]}, {"en": "They believe that their thorns are terrible weapons...\"", "zh": "它们以为自己的刺是可怕的武器……", "t": [8075, 10938]}]}, {"id": "ch07p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not answer.", "zh": "我默然不语。", "t": [138, 1688]}, {"en": "At that instant I was saying to myself: \"If this bolt still won't turn, I am going to knock it out with the hammer.\" Again the little prince disturbed my thoughts.", "zh": "那一刻，我自言自语道：“如果这颗螺栓还是拧不动，我就用锤子把它砸下来。”小王子又一次打断了我在思考。", "t": [1688, 10750]}]}, {"id": "ch07p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And you actually believe that the flowers--\"", "zh": "而你竟然相信花儿——", "t": [112, 2350]}]}, {"id": "ch07p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, no!\" I cried.", "zh": "哦，不！我惊呼。", "t": [112, 2525]}, {"en": "\"No, no no!", "zh": "不，不，不！", "t": [2525, 4025]}, {"en": "I don't believe anything.", "zh": "我不信任何事。", "t": [4025, 5838]}, {"en": "I answered you with the first thing that came into my head.", "zh": "随口应道，我脑海中浮现的第一个念头便是答案。", "t": [5838, 9250]}, {"en": "Don't you see-- I am very busy with matters of consequence!\"", "zh": "您忙于正事，无暇他顾。", "t": [9250, 12600]}]}, {"id": "ch07p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He stared at me, thunderstruck.", "zh": "他瞪着我，惊愕不已。", "t": [138, 2213]}]}, {"id": "ch07p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Matters of consequence!\"", "zh": "事关重大！", "t": [125, 1650]}]}, {"id": "ch07p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He looked at me there, with my hammer in my hand, my fingers black with engine-grease, bending down over an object, which seemed to him extremely ugly...", "zh": "他瞧着我，手里握着锤子，指头沾满了发动机的机油，俯身对着在他看来极其丑陋的物件。", "t": [138, 8575]}]}, {"id": "ch07p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You talk just like the grown-ups!\"", "zh": "你说话就像大人一样！", "t": [138, 1975]}]}, {"id": "ch07p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "That made me a little ashamed.", "zh": "这让我感到有些羞愧。", "t": [138, 2275]}, {"en": "But he went on, relentlessly:", "zh": "但他却继续说，毫不留情。", "t": [2275, 4412]}]}, {"id": "ch07p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You mix everything up together...", "zh": "你把一切都搅和在一起……", "t": [138, 2288]}, {"en": "You confuse everything...\"", "zh": "你把一切都混为一谈……", "t": [2288, 3788]}]}, {"id": "ch07p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was really very angry.", "zh": "他真的非常生气。", "t": [138, 2112]}, {"en": "He tossed his golden curls in the breeze.", "zh": "他金黄色的卷发在风中飘扬。", "t": [2112, 4500]}]}, {"id": "ch07p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I know a planet where there is a certain red-faced gentleman.", "zh": "我知道有一个星球上住着一位红脸先生。", "t": [138, 3838]}, {"en": "He has never smelled a flower.", "zh": "他未曾嗅过一瓣花。", "t": [3838, 5988]}, {"en": "He has never looked at a star.", "zh": "他从未仰望过一颗星星。", "t": [5988, 8000]}, {"en": "He has never loved any one.", "zh": "他从未爱过任何人。", "t": [8000, 10000]}, {"en": "He has never done anything in his life but add up figures.", "zh": "他一生只做加法。", "t": [10000, 13600]}, {"en": "And all day he says over and over, just like you: 'I am busy with matters of consequence!' And that makes him swell up with pride.", "zh": "他整天反复说着，就像你一样：“我正忙于要紧的事！”这让他骄傲得膨胀起来。", "t": [13600, 21675]}, {"en": "But he is not a man-- he is a mushroom!\"", "zh": "但他并非凡人——他只是一朵蘑菇！", "t": [21675, 23875]}]}, {"id": "ch07p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A what?\"", "zh": "“这是什么？”", "t": [112, 813]}]}, {"id": "ch07p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A mushroom!\"", "zh": "蘑菇！", "t": [100, 912]}]}, {"id": "ch07p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince was now white with rage.", "zh": "小王子气得脸色煞白。", "t": [138, 2512]}]}, {"id": "ch07p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The flowers have been growing thorns for millions of years.", "zh": "花儿已长刺数百万年。", "t": [138, 3662]}, {"en": "For millions of years the sheep have been eating them just the same.", "zh": "数百万年来，绵羊一直这样吃着它们。", "t": [3662, 7538]}, {"en": "And is it not a matter of consequence to try to understand why the flowers go to so much trouble to grow thorns, which are never of any use to them?", "zh": "探究为何花儿费尽心机长出无用的刺，这难道不是一件重要的事吗？", "t": [7538, 15575]}, {"en": "Is the warfare between the sheep and the flowers not important?", "zh": "羊与花的战争难道不重要吗？", "t": [15575, 19475]}, {"en": "Is this not of more consequence than a fat red-faced gentleman's sums?", "zh": "这难道不是比那位红脸胖子的算术更重要吗？", "t": [19475, 23862]}, {"en": "And if I know-- I, myself-- one flower which is unique in the world, which grows nowhere but on my planet, but which one little sheep can destroy in a single bite some morning, without even noticing what he is doing-- Oh!", "zh": "哦！若我深知——我自己——世间仅此一朵独一无二的花，它只生长在我的星球，而一只小小的绵羊却能在某个清晨不经意间将它一口吞噬，甚至未曾察觉自己的行为——哦！", "t": [23862, 35900]}, {"en": "You think that is not important!\"", "zh": "这难道不重要吗？", "t": [35900, 37737]}]}, {"id": "ch07p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "His face turned from white to red as he continued:", "zh": "他的脸色由白转红，继续说道：", "t": [138, 3100]}]}, {"id": "ch07p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If some one loves a flower, of which just one single blossom grows in all the millions and millions of stars, it is enough to make him happy just to look at the stars.", "zh": "若有人爱上了一朵生长在亿万星辰中的一朵花，只需仰望星空，便足以使他心满意足。", "t": [138, 9250]}, {"en": "He can say to himself, 'Somewhere, my flower is there...' But if the sheep eats the flower, in one moment all his stars will be darkened...", "zh": "他可以对自己说：“我的花儿在那儿……”但若绵羊吃掉了那朵花，他的所有星星在一瞬间都将黯淡无光……", "t": [9250, 18075]}, {"en": "And you think that is not important!\" He could not say anything more.", "zh": "这难道不重要吗？他再也无法说下去了。", "t": [18075, 22538]}, {"en": "His words were choked by sobbing.", "zh": "他的话语被抽泣所哽咽。", "t": [22538, 24512]}]}, {"id": "ch07p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The night had fallen.", "zh": "夜幕降临。", "t": [138, 1750]}, {"en": "I had let my tools drop from my hands.", "zh": "我手中的工具纷纷落地。", "t": [1750, 4550]}, {"en": "Of what moment now was my hammer, my bolt, or thirst, or death?", "zh": "我的锤子、螺栓、干渴或死亡，此刻又算得了什么？", "t": [4550, 9362]}, {"en": "On one star, one planet, my planet, the Earth, there was a little prince to be comforted.", "zh": "在地球，我的星球上，有一个小王子需要安慰。", "t": [9362, 15425]}, {"en": "I took him in my arms, and rocked him.", "zh": "将他紧紧抱在怀里，轻轻摇晃着他。", "t": [15425, 18050]}, {"en": "I said to him:", "zh": "我对他说：", "t": [18050, 19050]}]}, {"id": "ch07p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The flower that you love is not in danger.", "zh": "你爱的那朵花并无危险。", "t": [138, 2950]}, {"en": "I will draw you a muzzle for your sheep.", "zh": "我给你那绵羊画个口罩。", "t": [2950, 5488]}, {"en": "I will draw you a railing to put around your flower.", "zh": "我为你那朵花画一道栅栏。", "t": [5488, 8612]}, {"en": "I will--\"", "zh": "我将——", "t": [8612, 9250]}]}, {"id": "ch07p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not know what to say to him.", "zh": "我不知该如何向他开口。", "t": [138, 2338]}, {"en": "I felt awkward and blundering.", "zh": "我感到尴尬而笨拙。", "t": [2338, 4550]}, {"en": "I did not know how I could reach him, where I could overtake him and go on hand in hand with him once more.", "zh": "我不知如何才能追上他，在哪里才能与他并肩前行，再次携手同行。", "t": [4550, 9950]}]}, {"id": "ch07p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It is such a secret place, the land of tears.", "zh": "泪水的王国，如此神秘。", "t": [138, 3025]}]}]}, {"id": "ch08", "title_en": "Chapter VIII", "title_zh": "第 8 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch08p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I soon learned to know this flower better.", "zh": "我很快便更深入地了解了这朵花。", "t": [138, 2825]}, {"en": "On the little prince's planet the flowers had always been very simple.", "zh": "小王子的星球上，花朵总是极为朴素。", "t": [2825, 7150]}, {"en": "They had only one ring of petals; they took up no room at all; they were a trouble to nobody.", "zh": "花瓣仅一环，不占空间，不惹尘埃。", "t": [7150, 12688]}, {"en": "One morning they would appear in the grass, and by night they would have faded peacefully away.", "zh": "清晨它们在草间绽放，夜晚便平静地凋谢。", "t": [12688, 17875]}, {"en": "But one day, from a seed blown from no one knew where, a new flower had come up; and the little prince had watched very closely over this small sprout which was not like any other small sprouts on his planet.", "zh": "然而，一天，一朵来自无人知晓之处的种子发芽了；小王子密切地关注着这株与众不同的嫩芽，它不同于他星球上其他任何嫩芽。", "t": [17875, 29100]}, {"en": "It might, you see, have been a new kind of baobab.", "zh": "或许，它可能是一种新型的猴面包树。", "t": [29100, 32413]}]}, {"id": "ch08p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The shrub soon stopped growing, and began to get ready to produce a flower.", "zh": "灌木很快停止了生长，开始准备绽放花朵。", "t": [138, 4700]}, {"en": "The little prince, who was present at the first appearance of a huge bud, felt at once that some sort of miraculous apparition must emerge from it.", "zh": "小王子目睹那硕大的花蕾初现，便预感其中将诞生某种奇迹般的景象。", "t": [4700, 13125]}, {"en": "But the flower was not satisfied to complete the preparations for her beauty in the shelter of her green chamber.", "zh": "但那朵花并不满足于只在绿屋的庇护下完成她美丽的准备。", "t": [13125, 19550]}, {"en": "She chose her colours with the greatest care.", "zh": "她挑选色彩极是用心。", "t": [19550, 22412]}, {"en": "She adjusted her petals one by one.", "zh": "她逐一调整着花瓣。", "t": [22412, 25150]}, {"en": "She did not wish to go out into the world all rumpled, like the field poppies.", "zh": "她不愿像野罂粟花那样，皱巴巴地闯进世界。", "t": [25150, 29988]}, {"en": "It was only in the full radiance of her beauty that she wished to appear.", "zh": "她只愿在美丽绽放的极致中露面。", "t": [29988, 34125]}, {"en": "Oh, yes!", "zh": "哦，是的！", "t": [34125, 35475]}, {"en": "She was a coquettish creature!", "zh": "她是个爱美的生灵。", "t": [35475, 37475]}, {"en": "And her mysterious adornment lasted for days and days.", "zh": "她的神秘装扮持续了好多天。", "t": [37475, 40800]}]}, {"id": "ch08p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then one morning, exactly at sunrise, she suddenly showed herself.", "zh": "就在一个清晨，正逢日出时分，她突然现身。", "t": [125, 4376]}]}, {"id": "ch08p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, after working with all this painstaking precision, she yawned and said:", "zh": "经过这番苦心孤诣的精心打扮，她打了个哈欠说道：", "t": [138, 4750]}]}, {"id": "ch08p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "唉！", "t": [100, 838]}, {"en": "I am scarcely awake.", "zh": "我刚刚醒来，尚感朦胧。", "t": [838, 2638]}, {"en": "I beg that you will excuse me.", "zh": "请您原谅我的冒昧。", "t": [2638, 4838]}, {"en": "My petals are still all disarranged...\"", "zh": "我的花瓣仍凌乱不堪……", "t": [4838, 7212]}]}, {"id": "ch08p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince could not restrain his admiration:", "zh": "小王子忍不住赞叹：", "t": [100, 3275]}]}, {"id": "ch08p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!", "zh": "哦！", "t": [100, 800]}, {"en": "How beautiful you are!\"", "zh": "您真美啊！", "t": [800, 2050]}]}, {"id": "ch08p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Am I not?\" the flower responded, sweetly.", "zh": "“是啊，”花儿柔声回应。", "t": [125, 3562]}, {"en": "\"And I was born at the same moment as the sun...\"", "zh": "我与太阳同日而生。", "t": [3562, 6187]}]}, {"id": "ch08p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince could guess easily enough that she was not any too modest-- but how moving-- and exciting-- she was!", "zh": "小王子不难看出她并不怎么谦逊——然而她是多么动人——多么令人兴奋！", "t": [112, 6025]}]}, {"id": "ch08p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I think it is time for breakfast,\" she added an instant later.", "zh": "她随即又补充道：“现在是吃早餐的时候了。”", "t": [138, 4162]}, {"en": "\"If you would have the kindness to think of my needs--\"", "zh": "若您能体谅我的所需——", "t": [4162, 6788]}]}, {"id": "ch08p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince, completely abashed, went to look for a sprinkling-can of fresh water.", "zh": "小王子羞愧难当，去找一壶清水。", "t": [138, 5788]}, {"en": "So, he tended the flower.", "zh": "于是，他照料着这朵花。", "t": [5788, 7687]}]}, {"id": "ch08p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So, too, she began very quickly to torment him with her vanity-- which was, if the truth be known, a little difficult to deal with.", "zh": "于是，她很快便开始用她的虚荣心折磨他——若真相大白，这实在有些难以应对。", "t": [125, 8100]}, {"en": "One day, for instance, when she was speaking of her four thorns, she said to the little prince:", "zh": "有一天，当她谈到她那四根刺时，她对小王子说：", "t": [8100, 13537]}]}, {"id": "ch08p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Let the tigers come with their claws!\"", "zh": "让老虎带着它们的爪子来吧！", "t": [112, 2175]}]}, {"id": "ch08p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"There are no tigers on my planet,\" the little prince objected.", "zh": "我的星球上没有老虎。", "t": [138, 4138]}, {"en": "\"And, anyway, tigers do not eat weeds.\"", "zh": "老虎不吃杂草。", "t": [4138, 6962]}]}, {"id": "ch08p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am not a weed,\" the flower replied, sweetly.", "zh": "“我不是杂草。”花儿柔声回答。", "t": [138, 3263]}]}, {"id": "ch08p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Please excuse me...\"", "zh": "请原谅……", "t": [112, 1312]}]}, {"id": "ch08p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am not at all afraid of tigers,\" she went on, \"but I have a horror of drafts.", "zh": "“我对老虎毫不畏惧，却最怕穿堂风。”", "t": [138, 5225]}, {"en": "I suppose you wouldn't have a screen for me?\"", "zh": "您这儿有屏风吗？", "t": [5225, 7437]}]}, {"id": "ch08p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A horror of drafts-- that is bad luck, for a plant,\" remarked the little prince, and added to himself, \"This flower is a very complex creature...\"", "zh": "“对穿堂风如此恐惧——这对植物来说可真是不幸，”小王子评论道，心中暗想，“这朵花真是个复杂的生物……”", "t": [125, 8362]}]}, {"id": "ch08p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"At night I want you to put me under a glass globe.", "zh": "夜晚，请您把我罩在玻璃球里。", "t": [138, 3325]}, {"en": "It is very cold where you live.", "zh": "你住的地方非常寒冷。", "t": [3325, 5575]}, {"en": "In the place I came from--\"", "zh": "在我来的那个地方——", "t": [5575, 7025]}]}, {"id": "ch08p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But she interrupted herself at that point.", "zh": "她话未说完便打住了。", "t": [100, 2875]}, {"en": "She had come in the form of a seed.", "zh": "她以种子的形式降临。", "t": [2875, 5212]}, {"en": "She could not have known anything of any other worlds.", "zh": "她不可能了解任何其他世界。", "t": [5212, 8500]}, {"en": "Embarrassed over having let herself be caught on the verge of such a naïve untruth, she coughed two or three times, in order to put the little prince in the wrong.", "zh": "羞愧于让自己陷入如此幼稚谎言的边缘，她咳嗽了两三声，企图让小王子承担过错。", "t": [8500, 16875]}]}, {"id": "ch08p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The screen?\"", "zh": "您有屏风吗？", "t": [138, 862]}]}, {"id": "ch08p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I was just going to look for it when you spoke to me...\"", "zh": "我正要去找，是你和我说话的呀……", "t": [138, 2737]}]}, {"id": "ch08p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then she forced her cough a little more so that he should suffer from remorse just the same.", "zh": "她故意咳嗽得更重，让他也感到内疚。", "t": [138, 4688]}]}, {"id": "ch08p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So the little prince, in spite of all the good will that was inseparable from his love, had soon come to doubt her.", "zh": "尽管小王子对她的爱中充满了善意，但他很快便开始怀疑她了。", "t": [125, 6712]}, {"en": "He had taken seriously words, which were without importance, and it made him very unhappy.", "zh": "他认真对待了无关紧要的话语，这让他非常不快乐。", "t": [6712, 12037]}]}, {"id": "ch08p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I ought not to have listened to her,\" he confided to me one day.", "zh": "我那天不该听她的话。", "t": [138, 4175]}, {"en": "\"One never ought to listen to the flowers.", "zh": "永远也别信花儿讲的话。", "t": [4175, 6825]}, {"en": "One should simply look at them and breathe their fragrance.", "zh": "只需凝视它们，感受它们的芬芳。", "t": [6825, 10250]}, {"en": "Mine perfumed all my planet.", "zh": "我的星球上弥漫着花香。", "t": [10250, 12588]}, {"en": "But I did not know how to take pleasure in all her grace.", "zh": "但我不知如何享受她的所有优雅。", "t": [12588, 16162]}, {"en": "This tale of claws, which disturbed me so much, should only have filled my heart with tenderness and pity.\"", "zh": "这关于爪子的故事，本应只在我心中激起温柔与怜悯。", "t": [16162, 22088]}]}, {"id": "ch08p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he continued his confidences:", "zh": "他继续倾诉着。", "t": [112, 2338]}]}, {"id": "ch08p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The fact is that I did not know how to understand anything!", "zh": "事实上，我并不懂得如何理解任何事物！", "t": [138, 3725]}, {"en": "I ought to have judged by deeds and not by words.", "zh": "应凭行为而非言语来评判。", "t": [3725, 7000]}, {"en": "She cast her fragrance and her radiance over me.", "zh": "她的芬芳与光辉洒落在我身上。", "t": [7000, 10262]}, {"en": "I ought never to have run away from her...", "zh": "我本不该逃离她……", "t": [10262, 12875]}, {"en": "I ought to have guessed all the affection that lay behind her poor little stratagems.", "zh": "我本应猜透她那可怜的小伎俩背后深藏的柔情。", "t": [12875, 17700]}, {"en": "Flowers are so inconsistent!", "zh": "花儿真是反复无常！", "t": [17700, 20075]}, {"en": "But I was too young to know how to love her...\"", "zh": "那时我还太年轻，不懂如何去爱她……", "t": [20075, 22500]}]}]}, {"id": "ch09", "title_en": "Chapter IX", "title_zh": "第 9 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch09p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I believe that for his escape he took advantage of the migration of a flock of wild birds.", "zh": "他可能是趁着那群野鸟迁徙之际逃离的。", "t": [138, 5812]}, {"en": "On the morning of his departure he put his planet in perfect order.", "zh": "他离开那天早晨，把他的星球整理得井井有条。", "t": [5812, 9875]}, {"en": "He carefully cleaned out his active volcanoes.", "zh": "他仔细清理了他的活火山。", "t": [9875, 13138]}, {"en": "He possessed two active volcanoes; and they were very convenient for heating his breakfast in the morning.", "zh": "他拥有两座活火山，早晨煮早餐极为方便。", "t": [13138, 19062]}, {"en": "He also had one volcano that was extinct.", "zh": "他还拥有一座熄灭的火山。", "t": [19062, 22262]}, {"en": "But, as he said, \"One never knows!\" So he cleaned out the extinct volcano, too.", "zh": "然而，正如他所说：“世事难料！”于是，他也清理了那座死火山。", "t": [22262, 28525]}, {"en": "If they are well cleaned out, volcanoes burn slowly and steadily, without any eruptions.", "zh": "火山清理得当，火焰便缓缓而稳定地燃烧，不会喷发。", "t": [28525, 34338]}, {"en": "Volcanic eruptions are like fires in a chimney.", "zh": "火山喷发犹如烟囱中的火焰。", "t": [34338, 37263]}]}, {"id": "ch09p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On our earth we are obviously much too small to clean out our volcanoes.", "zh": "在我们地球上，我们显然太小了，无法清理我们的火山。", "t": [138, 4688]}, {"en": "That is why they bring no end of trouble upon us.", "zh": "这便是它们给我们带来无尽烦恼的原因。", "t": [4688, 7500]}]}, {"id": "ch09p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince also pulled up, with a certain sense of dejection, the last little shoots of the baobabs.", "zh": "小王子带着一丝沮丧，拔除了最后几株猴面包树苗。", "t": [138, 6588]}, {"en": "He believed that he would never want to return.", "zh": "他坚信自己不会再想回来。", "t": [6588, 9475]}, {"en": "But on this last morning all these familiar tasks seemed very precious to him.", "zh": "然而，在这最后的早晨，所有这些熟悉的任务在他看来都变得异常珍贵。", "t": [9475, 14300]}, {"en": "And when he watered the flower for the last time, and prepared to place her under the shelter of her glass globe, he realised that he was very close to tears.", "zh": "最后一次为花儿浇水，准备给她罩上玻璃罩，他意识到自己几乎要泪流满面了。", "t": [14300, 22413]}]}, {"id": "ch09p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" he said to the flower.", "zh": "再见，他对花儿说。", "t": [100, 2137]}]}, {"id": "ch09p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But she made no answer.", "zh": "她默然不语。", "t": [100, 1562]}]}, {"id": "ch09p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" he said again.", "zh": "再见，他又说。", "t": [112, 1750]}]}, {"id": "ch09p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The flower coughed.", "zh": "花儿轻咳。", "t": [112, 1612]}, {"en": "But it was not because she had a cold.", "zh": "但并非因为她感冒了。", "t": [1612, 3687]}]}, {"id": "ch09p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have been silly,\" she said to him, at last.", "zh": "她终于对他说：“我真是愚蠢。”", "t": [138, 3388]}, {"en": "\"I ask your forgiveness.", "zh": "请原谅我。", "t": [3388, 5175]}, {"en": "Try to be happy...\"", "zh": "试着快乐吧……", "t": [5175, 6337]}]}, {"id": "ch09p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was surprised by this absence of reproaches.", "zh": "她对他的离去毫无责怪。", "t": [138, 3375]}, {"en": "He stood there all bewildered, the glass globe held arrested in mid-air.", "zh": "他愣愣地站在那里，手中的玻璃罩悬停在半空。", "t": [3375, 7788]}, {"en": "He did not understand this quiet sweetness.", "zh": "他不懂这宁静的甜美。", "t": [7788, 10424]}]}, {"id": "ch09p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Of course I love you,\" the flower said to him.", "zh": "当然，我爱你。", "t": [112, 3125]}, {"en": "\"It is my fault that you have not known it all the while.", "zh": "你一直未曾察觉到，这全是我的过错。", "t": [3125, 6312]}, {"en": "That is of no importance.", "zh": "那无关紧要。", "t": [6312, 8350]}, {"en": "But you-- you have been just as foolish as I.", "zh": "但你——你也和我一样傻。", "t": [8350, 10525]}, {"en": "Try to be happy...", "zh": "试着快乐吧……", "t": [10525, 11912]}, {"en": "let the glass globe be.", "zh": "让玻璃罩见鬼去吧。", "t": [11912, 13550]}, {"en": "I don't want it any more.\"", "zh": "我不再需要它了。", "t": [13550, 14987]}]}, {"id": "ch09p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But the wind--\"", "zh": "但风……", "t": [100, 975]}]}, {"id": "ch09p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My cold is not so bad as all that...", "zh": "我的感冒并没有那么严重……", "t": [138, 2512]}, {"en": "the cool night air will do me good.", "zh": "清新的夜风对我大有裨益。", "t": [2512, 4562]}, {"en": "I am a flower.\"", "zh": "我是一朵花。", "t": [4562, 5612]}]}, {"id": "ch09p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But the animals--\"", "zh": "但那些动物——", "t": [112, 1162]}]}, {"id": "ch09p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Well, I must endure the presence of two or three caterpillars if I wish to become acquainted with the butterflies.", "zh": "我若想结识蝴蝶，就得忍受两三条毛虫的陪伴。", "t": [138, 6625]}, {"en": "It seems that they are very beautiful.", "zh": "它们似乎非常美丽。", "t": [6625, 9112]}, {"en": "And if not the butterflies-- and the caterpillars-- who will call upon me?", "zh": "蝴蝶不来，毛虫又何来拜访我呢？", "t": [9112, 13138]}, {"en": "You will be far away...", "zh": "你将远行……", "t": [13138, 14662]}, {"en": "as for the large animals-- I am not at all afraid of any of them.", "zh": "至于大动物——我一点也不怕它们。", "t": [14662, 18300]}, {"en": "I have my claws.\"", "zh": "我有我的爪子。", "t": [18300, 19487]}]}, {"id": "ch09p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, naïvely, she showed her four thorns.", "zh": "她天真地伸出她的四根刺。", "t": [138, 3438]}, {"en": "Then she added:", "zh": "她接着说：", "t": [3438, 4526]}]}, {"id": "ch09p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Don't linger like this.", "zh": "别这样拖延。", "t": [112, 1850]}, {"en": "You have decided to go away.", "zh": "你已决定离去。", "t": [1850, 4000]}, {"en": "Now go!\"", "zh": "那就走吧。", "t": [4000, 4662]}]}, {"id": "ch09p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For she did not want him to see her crying.", "zh": "她不愿让他看到自己哭泣。", "t": [125, 2738]}, {"en": "She was such a proud flower...", "zh": "她是一朵多么骄傲的花儿……", "t": [2738, 4575]}]}]}, {"id": "ch10", "title_en": "Chapter X", "title_zh": "第 10 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch10p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He found himself in the neighbourhood of the asteroids 325, 326, 327, 328, 329, and 330.", "zh": "他发现自己来到了小行星325号、326号、327号、328号、329号和330号所在的地区。", "t": [125, 11112]}, {"en": "He began, therefore, by visiting them, in order to add to his knowledge.", "zh": "于是他开始逐一拜访，以增长见识。", "t": [11112, 17138]}]}, {"id": "ch10p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The first of them was inhabited by a king.", "zh": "那颗星球上住着一位国王。", "t": [138, 3012]}, {"en": "Clad in royal purple and ermine, he was seated upon a throne which was at the same time both simple and majestic.", "zh": "身着皇家紫袍与貂皮，他端坐在既简单又威严的宝座上。", "t": [3012, 9475]}]}, {"id": "ch10p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "啊！", "t": [100, 850]}, {"en": "Here is a subject,\" exclaimed the king, when he saw the little prince coming.", "zh": "“来了一位臣民，”国王看见小王子走来，大声说道。", "t": [850, 5163]}]}, {"id": "ch10p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince asked himself:", "zh": "小王子自问：", "t": [138, 2262]}]}, {"id": "ch10p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"How could he recognize me when he had never seen me before?\"", "zh": "他从未见过我，怎能认出我呢？", "t": [125, 3338]}]}, {"id": "ch10p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He did not know how the world is simplified for kings.", "zh": "国王们眼中，世界变得简单了。", "t": [125, 3488]}, {"en": "To them, all men are subjects.", "zh": "在他们眼中，世人皆为臣民。", "t": [3488, 5600]}]}, {"id": "ch10p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Approach, so that I may see you better,\" said the king, who felt consumingly proud of being at last a king over somebody.", "zh": "“走近些，让我好好端详你，”国王说，他因终于统治了某个臣民而感到无比自豪。", "t": [138, 6963]}]}, {"id": "ch10p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince looked everywhere to find a place to sit down; but the entire planet was crammed and obstructed by the king's magnificent ermine robe.", "zh": "小王子环顾四周，寻找可坐之处；但整个星球已被国王那华丽的貂皮袍子塞满，无处下脚。", "t": [138, 8612]}, {"en": "So he remained standing upright, and, since he was tired, he yawned.", "zh": "他挺直了身子站立，由于疲惫，他打了个哈欠。", "t": [8612, 13225]}]}, {"id": "ch10p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is contrary to etiquette to yawn in the presence of a king,\" the monarch said to him.", "zh": "在国王面前打哈欠，有失礼节。", "t": [138, 5162]}, {"en": "\"I forbid you to do so.\"", "zh": "我禁止你这么做。", "t": [5162, 6688]}]}, {"id": "ch10p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I can't help it.", "zh": "我忍不住了。", "t": [138, 1662]}, {"en": "I can't stop myself,\" replied the little prince, thoroughly embarrassed.", "zh": "我忍不住了，小王子回答说，满脸尴尬。", "t": [1662, 6312]}, {"en": "\"I have come on a long journey, and I have had no sleep...\"", "zh": "我长途跋涉，未曾合眼……", "t": [6312, 9526]}]}, {"id": "ch10p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah, then,\" the king said.", "zh": "啊，那么，国王说。", "t": [138, 2475]}, {"en": "\"I order you to yawn.", "zh": "我命令你打哈欠。", "t": [2475, 4175]}, {"en": "It is years since I have seen anyone yawning.", "zh": "多年来未见有人打哈欠了。", "t": [4175, 7175]}, {"en": "Yawns, to me, are objects of curiosity.", "zh": "打哈欠在我眼里是件稀奇事。", "t": [7175, 10700]}, {"en": "Come, now!", "zh": "快点儿！", "t": [10700, 11900]}, {"en": "Yawn again!", "zh": "再打一个哈欠！", "t": [11900, 12962]}, {"en": "It is an order.\"", "zh": "这是命令。", "t": [12962, 13962]}]}, {"id": "ch10p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That frightens me...", "zh": "这让我害怕……", "t": [112, 1725]}, {"en": "I cannot, any more...\" murmured the little prince, now completely abashed.", "zh": "我无法再……小王子羞愧地低语。", "t": [1725, 6837]}]}, {"id": "ch10p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Hum!", "zh": "哼！", "t": [125, 888]}, {"en": "Hum!\" replied the king.", "zh": "哼！国王答道。", "t": [888, 2775]}, {"en": "\"Then I-- I order you sometimes to yawn and sometimes to--\"", "zh": "那么，我——我命令你有时打哈欠，有时不打——", "t": [2775, 6100]}]}, {"id": "ch10p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He sputtered a little, and seemed vexed.", "zh": "他咕哝了几句，似乎有些恼火。", "t": [138, 2587]}]}, {"id": "ch10p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For what the king fundamentally insisted upon was that his authority should be respected.", "zh": "国王根本坚持的是他的权威必须得到尊重。", "t": [125, 5650]}, {"en": "He tolerated no disobedience.", "zh": "他不容许任何违抗。", "t": [5650, 8350]}, {"en": "He was an absolute monarch.", "zh": "他是一位绝对的君主。", "t": [8350, 10425]}, {"en": "But, because he was a very good man, he made his orders reasonable.", "zh": "然而，由于他是个非常善良的人，他发布的命令总是合情合理。", "t": [10425, 14475]}]}, {"id": "ch10p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If I ordered a general,\" he would say, by way of example, \"if I ordered a general to change himself into a sea bird, and if the general did not obey me, that would not be the fault of the general.", "zh": "“假如我命令一位将军，”他举例说，“假如我命令他变成一只海鸟，而将军不服从，那责任不在将军。”", "t": [138, 10762]}, {"en": "It would be my fault.\"", "zh": "那责任在我。", "t": [10762, 12074]}]}, {"id": "ch10p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"May I sit down?\" came now a timid inquiry from the little prince.", "zh": "小王子怯生生地问道：“我可以坐下吗？”", "t": [125, 4187]}]}, {"id": "ch10p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I order you to do so,\" the king answered him, and majestically gathered in a fold of his ermine mantle.", "zh": "陛下如此命令，国王答道，威严地卷起他的貂皮披风。", "t": [138, 5950]}]}, {"id": "ch10p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince was wondering...", "zh": "小王子心中暗自思忖……", "t": [100, 2438]}, {"en": "The planet was tiny.", "zh": "这颗星球小得可怜。", "t": [2438, 4175]}, {"en": "Over what could this king really rule?", "zh": "这位国王究竟能统治什么？", "t": [4175, 6188]}]}, {"id": "ch10p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Sire,\" he said to him, \"I beg that you will excuse my asking you a question--\"", "zh": "陛下，他向他说道，请您原谅我向您提一个问题——", "t": [125, 4612]}]}, {"id": "ch10p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I order you to ask me a question,\" the king hastened to assure him.", "zh": "陛下急忙保证道：“我命令你向我提一个问题。”", "t": [138, 3900]}]}, {"id": "ch10p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Sire-- over what do you rule?\"", "zh": "陛下——您统治着什么？", "t": [125, 1975]}]}, {"id": "ch10p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Over everything,\" said the king, with magnificent simplicity.", "zh": "统治一切，国王以非凡的简洁说道。", "t": [112, 4012]}]}, {"id": "ch10p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Over everything?\"", "zh": "统治一切？", "t": [125, 1176]}]}, {"id": "ch10p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The king made a gesture, which took in his planet, the other planets, and all the stars.", "zh": "国王一挥手，涵盖了他的星球、其他星球以及所有星星。", "t": [138, 5212]}]}, {"id": "ch10p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Over all that?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "统治这一切？小王子问道。", "t": [125, 2674]}]}, {"id": "ch10p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Over all that,\" the king answered.", "zh": "统治这一切？国王回答道。", "t": [112, 2200]}]}, {"id": "ch10p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For his rule was not only absolute: it was also universal.", "zh": "他的统治不仅是绝对的，而且是普遍的。", "t": [125, 4112]}]}, {"id": "ch10p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And the stars obey you?\"", "zh": "星星都听命于您吗？", "t": [112, 1588]}]}, {"id": "ch10p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Certainly they do,\" the king said.", "zh": "当然啦，国王说。", "t": [125, 2688]}, {"en": "\"They obey instantly.", "zh": "它们立刻服从。", "t": [2688, 4512]}, {"en": "I do not permit insubordination.\"", "zh": "我禁止违抗。", "t": [4512, 6650]}]}, {"id": "ch10p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Such power was a thing for the little prince to marvel at.", "zh": "这股力量令小王子惊叹不已。", "t": [125, 3862]}, {"en": "If he had been master of such complete authority, he would have been able to watch the sunset, not forty-four times in one day, but seventy-two, or even a hundred, or even two hundred times, without ever having to move his chair.", "zh": "若他拥有如此至高无上的权力，便能每日观赏七十二次，甚至一百次，甚至两百次日落，而无需挪动座椅。", "t": [3862, 16975]}, {"en": "And because he felt a bit sad as he remembered his little planet, which he had forsaken, he plucked up his courage to ask the king a favour:", "zh": "因为想起被他遗弃的小行星，他鼓起勇气向国王提出一个请求：", "t": [16975, 24288]}]}, {"id": "ch10p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I should like to see a sunset...", "zh": "我想看看日落……", "t": [138, 2100]}, {"en": "do me that kindness...", "zh": "请行此善举……", "t": [2100, 3750]}, {"en": "Order the sun to set...\"", "zh": "命令太阳落山……", "t": [3750, 5163]}]}, {"id": "ch10p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If I ordered a general to fly from one flower to another like a butterfly, or to write a tragic drama, or to change himself into a sea bird, and if the general did not carry out the order that he had received, which one of us would be in the wrong?\" the king demanded.", "zh": "陛下质问道：“若我命令一位将军像蝴蝶般在花间飞舞，或撰写一部悲剧，或变成海鸟，而将军不遵从命令，那么，错的是我们中的哪一个？”", "t": [138, 14238]}, {"en": "\"The general, or myself?\"", "zh": "将军，还是我自己？", "t": [14238, 15937]}]}, {"id": "ch10p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You,\" said the little prince firmly.", "zh": "“你，”小王子坚定地说。", "t": [138, 2350]}]}, {"id": "ch10p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Exactly.", "zh": "正是如此。", "t": [100, 1350]}, {"en": "One much require from each one the duty which each one can perform,\" the king went on.", "zh": "国王继续说道：“每个人都必须尽其所能履行职责。”", "t": [1350, 6612]}, {"en": "\"Accepted authority rests first of all on reason.", "zh": "权威首先建立在理性之上。", "t": [6612, 10125]}, {"en": "If you ordered your people to go and throw themselves into the sea, they would rise up in revolution.", "zh": "若你命令你的子民跳海，他们便会起义反抗。", "t": [10125, 15688]}, {"en": "I have the right to require obedience because my orders are reasonable.\"", "zh": "我有权要求服从，因为我的命令合乎情理。", "t": [15688, 19650]}]}, {"id": "ch10p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then my sunset?\" the little prince reminded him: for he never forgot a question once he had asked it.", "zh": "“那么，我的日落呢？”小王子提醒他，因为他一旦提出问题就绝不会忘记。", "t": [138, 5900]}]}, {"id": "ch10p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You shall have your sunset.", "zh": "你将看到你的日落。", "t": [138, 2100]}, {"en": "I shall command it.", "zh": "我命令它。", "t": [2100, 3762]}, {"en": "But, according to my science of government, I shall wait until conditions are favourable.\"", "zh": "但根据我的治国之策，我将等待时机成熟。", "t": [3762, 8813]}]}, {"id": "ch10p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"When will that be?\" inquired the little prince.", "zh": "小王子问道：“那会是什么时候？”", "t": [138, 3000]}]}, {"id": "ch10p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Hum!", "zh": "哼！", "t": [125, 875]}, {"en": "Hum!\" replied the king; and before saying anything else he consulted a bulky almanac.", "zh": "哼！国王答道，随即查阅了一本厚重的星历。", "t": [875, 6412]}, {"en": "\"Hum!", "zh": "哼！", "t": [6412, 7150]}, {"en": "Hum!", "zh": "哼！", "t": [7150, 7900]}, {"en": "That will be about-- about-- that will be this evening about twenty minutes to eight.", "zh": "大约——大约——今晚八点差二十分左右。", "t": [7900, 12475]}, {"en": "And you will see how well I am obeyed.\"", "zh": "你将见识到我的命令被遵从得多么得体。", "t": [12475, 14588]}]}, {"id": "ch10p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince yawned.", "zh": "小王子打了个哈欠。", "t": [138, 1950]}, {"en": "He was regretting his lost sunset.", "zh": "他惋惜那失去的日落。", "t": [1950, 4575]}, {"en": "And then, too, he was already beginning to be a little bored.", "zh": "他渐渐开始感到有些无聊了。", "t": [4575, 8137]}]}, {"id": "ch10p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have nothing more to do here,\" he said to the king.", "zh": "“我在这里已无事可做，”他对国王说。", "t": [138, 3262]}, {"en": "\"So I shall set out on my way again.\"", "zh": "我将再次踏上旅程。", "t": [3262, 5487]}]}, {"id": "ch10p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do not go,\" said the king, who was very proud of having a subject.", "zh": "“别走，”国王说，他对拥有一个臣民感到非常自豪。", "t": [100, 4512]}, {"en": "\"Do not go.", "zh": "别走。", "t": [4512, 5800]}, {"en": "I will make you a Minister!\"", "zh": "我封你为部长！", "t": [5800, 7300]}]}, {"id": "ch10p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Minister of what?\"", "zh": "司法部长？", "t": [125, 1388]}]}, {"id": "ch10p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Minster of-- of Justice!\"", "zh": "司法部长！", "t": [112, 1674]}]}, {"id": "ch10p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But there is nobody here to judge!\"", "zh": "但这里无人可审。", "t": [100, 1987]}]}, {"id": "ch10p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We do not know that,\" the king said to him.", "zh": "“我们并不知道，”国王对他说。", "t": [138, 3012]}, {"en": "\"I have not yet made a complete tour of my kingdom.", "zh": "我尚未巡游完我的王国。", "t": [3012, 6188]}, {"en": "I am very old.", "zh": "我年事已高。", "t": [6188, 7750]}, {"en": "There is no room here for a carriage.", "zh": "这里容不下马车。", "t": [7750, 10112]}, {"en": "And it tires me to walk.\"", "zh": "行走令我疲惫不堪。", "t": [10112, 11637]}]}, {"id": "ch10p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, but I have looked already!\" said the little prince, turning around to give one more glance to the other side of the planet.", "zh": "哦，但我已经看过了！小王子转身，又朝星球的另一端瞥了一眼。", "t": [112, 7125]}, {"en": "On that side, as on this, there was nobody at all...", "zh": "在那一边，就像这边一样，根本无人居住。", "t": [7125, 10487]}]}, {"id": "ch10p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then you shall judge yourself,\" the king answered.", "zh": "那么，你将自我审判。", "t": [112, 3212]}, {"en": "\"that is the most difficult thing of all.", "zh": "这是最难的事。", "t": [3212, 5738]}, {"en": "It is much more difficult to judge oneself than to judge others.", "zh": "评判自己远比评判他人困难。", "t": [5738, 9612]}, {"en": "If you succeed in judging yourself rightly, then you are indeed a man of true wisdom.\"", "zh": "若能正确审判自己，你便真正成为智者。", "t": [9612, 14350]}]}, {"id": "ch10p48", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes,\" said the little prince, \"but I can judge myself anywhere.", "zh": "是的，小王子说，“但我在任何地方都能审判自己。”", "t": [138, 4312]}, {"en": "I do not need to live on this planet.", "zh": "我不必居住在这颗星球上。", "t": [4312, 6387]}]}, {"id": "ch10p49", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Hum!", "zh": "哼！", "t": [125, 888]}, {"en": "Hum!\" said the king.", "zh": "哼！国王说道。", "t": [888, 2575]}, {"en": "\"I have good reason to believe that somewhere on my planet there is an old rat.", "zh": "在这颗星球上，我确信某个角落住着一只老耗子。", "t": [2575, 7050]}, {"en": "I hear him at night.", "zh": "我在夜里听到他。", "t": [7050, 8738]}, {"en": "You can judge this old rat.", "zh": "你可以审判这只老耗子。", "t": [8738, 10812]}, {"en": "From time to time you will condemn him to death.", "zh": "时而将他判处死刑。", "t": [10812, 13838]}, {"en": "Thus his life will depend on your justice.", "zh": "他的生命将取决于你的公正。", "t": [13838, 16700]}, {"en": "But you will pardon him on each occasion; for he must be treated thriftily.", "zh": "但每次你都得赦免他；因为他必须被节省使用。", "t": [16700, 21162]}, {"en": "He is the only one we have.\"", "zh": "他是我们唯一拥有的。", "t": [21162, 22887]}]}, {"id": "ch10p50", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I,\" replied the little prince, \"do not like to condemn anyone to death.", "zh": "我不愿将任何人判处死刑。", "t": [138, 4888]}, {"en": "And now I think I will go on my way.\"", "zh": "现在我想继续我的旅程了。", "t": [4888, 7000]}]}, {"id": "ch10p51", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No,\" said the king.", "zh": "“不，”国王说。", "t": [125, 1562]}]}, {"id": "ch10p52", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince, having now completed his preparations for departure, had no wish to grieve the old monarch.", "zh": "但小王子完成离行准备后，不愿让老国王感到悲伤。", "t": [100, 6387]}]}, {"id": "ch10p53", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If Your Majesty wishes to be promptly obeyed,\" he said, \"he should be able to give me a reasonable order.", "zh": "陛下若欲令行禁止，便应能下达合理的命令。", "t": [138, 6275]}, {"en": "He should be able, for example, to order me to be gone by the end of one minute.", "zh": "他可以命令我，比如说，在一分钟内离开。", "t": [6275, 11450]}, {"en": "It seems to me that conditions are favourable...\"", "zh": "在我看来，条件似乎很适宜……", "t": [11450, 14100]}]}, {"id": "ch10p54", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As the king made no answer, the little prince hesitated a moment.", "zh": "国王沉默不语，小王子犹豫了片刻。", "t": [138, 4488]}, {"en": "Then, with a sigh, he took his leave.", "zh": "带着一声叹息，他告辞离去。", "t": [4488, 6950]}]}, {"id": "ch10p55", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I made you my Ambassador,\" the king called out, hastily.", "zh": "我封你为大使。", "t": [138, 3625]}]}, {"id": "ch10p56", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He had a magnificent air of authority.", "zh": "他威严非凡。", "t": [125, 2500]}]}, {"id": "ch10p57", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The grown-ups are very strange,\" the little prince said to himself, as he continued on his journey.", "zh": "大人们真是奇怪，小王子边走边自言自语。", "t": [138, 5487]}]}]}, {"id": "ch11", "title_en": "Chapter XI", "title_zh": "第 11 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch11p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The second planet was inhabited by a conceited man.", "zh": "第二颗星球住着一个自负的人。", "t": [138, 3476]}]}, {"id": "ch11p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "啊！", "t": [100, 825]}, {"en": "Ah!", "zh": "啊！", "t": [825, 1538]}, {"en": "I am about to receive a visit from an admirer!\" he exclaimed from afar, when he first saw the little prince coming.", "zh": "他远远望见小王子走来，便大声喊道：“我正要接待一位崇拜者！”", "t": [1538, 7800]}]}, {"id": "ch11p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For, to conceited men, all other men are admirers.", "zh": "对自负的人来说，所有人都是崇拜者。", "t": [125, 3650]}]}, {"id": "ch11p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "早上好，小王子说。", "t": [112, 2712]}, {"en": "\"That is a queer hat you are wearing.\"", "zh": "这顶帽子戴得真古怪。", "t": [2712, 4600]}]}, {"id": "ch11p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is a hat for salutes,\" the conceited man replied.", "zh": "这顶帽子是敬礼用的。", "t": [138, 3750]}, {"en": "\"It is to raise in salute when people acclaim me.", "zh": "这顶帽子是人们欢呼时用来敬礼的。", "t": [3750, 6762]}, {"en": "Unfortunately, nobody at all ever passes this way.\"", "zh": "可惜，从来没有人经过这里。", "t": [6762, 10087]}]}, {"id": "ch11p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes?\" said the little prince, who did not understand what the conceited man was talking about.", "zh": "小王子问道：“什么？”他不懂这位自负的人究竟在说什么。", "t": [138, 5600]}]}, {"id": "ch11p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Clap your hands, one against the other,\" the conceited man now directed him.", "zh": "请用手掌相击，一只手对另一只手，自负的人现在这样指示他。", "t": [112, 4737]}]}, {"id": "ch11p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince clapped his hands.", "zh": "小王子拍起了手。", "t": [138, 2525]}, {"en": "The conceited man raised his hat in a modest salute.", "zh": "自负的人谦恭地举帽致意。", "t": [2525, 5800]}]}, {"id": "ch11p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This is more entertaining than the visit to the king,\" the little prince said to himself.", "zh": "这比拜访国王有趣多了，小王子自言自语道。", "t": [138, 5100]}, {"en": "And he began again to clap his hands, one against the other.", "zh": "他再次开始拍手，一只手对另一只手。", "t": [5100, 8900]}, {"en": "The conceited man against raised his hat in salute.", "zh": "自负的人举起帽子行礼。", "t": [8900, 12025]}]}, {"id": "ch11p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After five minutes of this exercise the little prince grew tired of the game's monotony.", "zh": "五分钟后，小王子对这场单调的游戏感到厌倦。", "t": [138, 4812]}]}, {"id": "ch11p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what should one do to make the hat come down?\" he asked.", "zh": "他问道：“那怎样才能让这顶帽子放下呢？”", "t": [125, 3512]}]}, {"id": "ch11p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the conceited man did not hear him.", "zh": "但自负的人没有听见他。", "t": [100, 2738]}, {"en": "Conceited people never hear anything but praise.", "zh": "自负的人只听见赞美之词。", "t": [2738, 5763]}]}, {"id": "ch11p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do you really admire me very much?\" he demanded of the little prince.", "zh": "你真的非常崇拜我吗？他向小王子质问道。", "t": [100, 4163]}]}, {"id": "ch11p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What does that mean-- 'admire'?\"", "zh": "那“崇拜”究竟是什么意思？", "t": [112, 1675]}]}, {"id": "ch11p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"To admire mean that you regard me as the handsomest, the best-dressed, the richest, and the most intelligent man on this planet.\"", "zh": "您认为我是这星球上最英俊、最讲究衣着、最富有、最聪明的人。", "t": [100, 7512]}]}, {"id": "ch11p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But you are the only man on your planet!\"", "zh": "但你是你那星球上唯一的人！", "t": [100, 2325]}]}, {"id": "ch11p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do me this kindness.", "zh": "请行此善举。", "t": [112, 1862]}, {"en": "Admire me just the same.\"", "zh": "依旧崇拜我吧。", "t": [1862, 3450]}]}, {"id": "ch11p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I admire you,\" said the little prince, shrugging his shoulders slightly, \"but what is there in that to interest you so much?\"", "zh": "“我崇拜你，”小王子轻轻耸了耸肩，“但这又有什么能让你如此高兴呢？”", "t": [138, 6838]}]}, {"id": "ch11p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince went away.", "zh": "小王子离去了。", "t": [138, 1888]}]}, {"id": "ch11p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The grown-ups are certainly very odd,\" he said to himself, as he continued on his journey.", "zh": "大人们确实古怪得可以，他边走边自言自语。", "t": [138, 5150]}]}]}, {"id": "ch12", "title_en": "Chapter XII", "title_zh": "第 12 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch12p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The next planet was inhabited by a tippler.", "zh": "下一颗星球住着一个酒徒。", "t": [112, 3275]}, {"en": "This was a very short visit, but it plunged the little prince into deep dejection.", "zh": "这次拜访虽短，却让小王子陷入深深的忧郁。", "t": [3275, 8100]}]}, {"id": "ch12p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What are you doing there?\" he said to the tippler, whom he found settled down in silence before a collection of empty bottles and also a collection of full bottles.", "zh": "“你在此做什么？”他对那个酒徒说，只见他静静地坐在面前的一大堆空瓶子和满瓶之间。", "t": [138, 8525]}]}, {"id": "ch12p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am drinking,\" replied the tippler, with a lugubrious air.", "zh": "“我正喝着呢，”酒徒带着哀伤的神情答道。", "t": [138, 3787]}]}, {"id": "ch12p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why are you drinking?\" demanded the little prince.", "zh": "“你为何饮酒？”小王子质问道。", "t": [138, 3000]}]}, {"id": "ch12p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"So that I may forget,\" replied the tippler.", "zh": "为了忘记，酒徒答道。", "t": [125, 2800]}]}, {"id": "ch12p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Forget what?\" inquired the little prince, who already was sorry for him.", "zh": "“为了什么？”小王子问，心中已对他生出了怜悯。", "t": [125, 4450]}]}, {"id": "ch12p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Forget that I am ashamed,\" the tippler confessed, hanging his head.", "zh": "“忘了我说我羞愧吧，”酒徒低垂着头，老实承认。", "t": [125, 4163]}]}, {"id": "ch12p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ashamed of what?\" insisted the little prince, who wanted to help him.", "zh": "“羞愧什么？”小王子坚持问道，他想要帮助他。", "t": [125, 4313]}]}, {"id": "ch12p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ashamed of drinking!\" The tippler brought his speech to an end, and shut himself up in an impregnable silence.", "zh": "羞愧于饮酒！酒徒话音戛然而止，将自己封闭在坚不可摧的沉默之中。", "t": [125, 6676]}]}, {"id": "ch12p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince went away, puzzled.", "zh": "小王子困惑地走了。", "t": [138, 2650]}]}, {"id": "ch12p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The grown-ups are certainly very, very odd,\" he said to himself, as he continued on his journey.", "zh": "大人们确实非常、非常古怪，他边走边自言自语。", "t": [138, 5750]}]}]}, {"id": "ch13", "title_en": "Chapter XIII", "title_zh": "第 13 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch13p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The fourth planet belonged to a businessman.", "zh": "第四颗星球属于一个商人。", "t": [138, 2975]}, {"en": "This man was so much occupied that he did not even raise his head at the little prince's arrival.", "zh": "这位商人如此忙碌，以至于在小王子到来时，连头都没抬一下。", "t": [2975, 8162]}]}, {"id": "ch13p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" the little prince said to him.", "zh": "早上好，小王子对他说。", "t": [100, 2925]}, {"en": "\"Your cigarette has gone out.\"", "zh": "您的香烟熄灭了。", "t": [2925, 4550]}]}, {"id": "ch13p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Three and two make five.", "zh": "三加二等于五。", "t": [112, 2125]}, {"en": "Five and seven make twelve.", "zh": "五加七等于十二。", "t": [2125, 4262]}, {"en": "Twelve and three make fifteen.", "zh": "十二加三等于十五。", "t": [4262, 6488]}, {"en": "Good morning.", "zh": "早上好。", "t": [6488, 7675]}, {"en": "Fifteen and seven make twenty-two.", "zh": "十五加七等于二十二。", "t": [7675, 10425]}, {"en": "Twenty-two and six make twenty-eight.", "zh": "二十二加六等于二十八。", "t": [10425, 13350]}, {"en": "I haven't time to light it again.", "zh": "没空再点一根。", "t": [13350, 15612]}, {"en": "Twenty-six and five make thirty-one.", "zh": "二十六加五等于三十一。", "t": [15612, 18475]}, {"en": "Phew!", "zh": "哎呀！", "t": [18475, 19262]}, {"en": "Then that makes five-hundred-and-one-million, six-hundred-twenty-two-thousand, seven-hundred-thirty-one.\"", "zh": "五亿零一百六十二万二千七百三十一。", "t": [19262, 25075]}]}, {"id": "ch13p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Five hundred million what?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "五亿零一百……这是什么？小王子问道。", "t": [125, 3412]}]}, {"id": "ch13p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Eh?", "zh": "哎呀？", "t": [138, 888]}, {"en": "Are you still there?", "zh": "您还在吗？", "t": [888, 2288]}, {"en": "Five-hundred-and-one million-- I can't stop...", "zh": "五亿零一百万——我无法停下...", "t": [2288, 5238]}, {"en": "I have so much to do!", "zh": "我事务繁多。", "t": [5238, 7000]}, {"en": "I am concerned with matters of consequence.", "zh": "我关注的是重要之事。", "t": [7000, 10062]}, {"en": "I don't amuse myself with balderdash.", "zh": "我从不浪费时间在无聊的事情上。", "t": [10062, 12750]}, {"en": "Two and five make seven...\"", "zh": "二加五等于七……", "t": [12750, 14488]}]}, {"id": "ch13p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Five-hundred-and-one million what?\" repeated the little prince, who never in his life had let go of a question once he had asked it.", "zh": "五亿零一百万个什么？小王子反复问道，他一生中一旦提问就绝不会放弃。", "t": [125, 7162]}]}, {"id": "ch13p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The businessman raised his head.", "zh": "商人抬起了头。", "t": [138, 1950]}]}, {"id": "ch13p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"During the fifty-four years that I have inhabited this planet, I have been disturbed only three times.", "zh": "在这颗星球上居住的五十四年里，我只被打扰过三次。", "t": [138, 6162]}, {"en": "The first time was twenty-two years ago, when some giddy goose fell from goodness knows where.", "zh": "第一次是二十二年前，不知从何而来的疯子一头栽了下来。", "t": [6162, 11475]}, {"en": "He made the most frightful noise that resounded all over the place, and I made four mistakes in my addition.", "zh": "他发出震耳欲聋的巨响，我的加法出了四个错。", "t": [11475, 17588]}, {"en": "The second time, eleven years ago, I was disturbed by an attack of rheumatism.", "zh": "第二次，十一年前，我被关节炎的发作打扰。", "t": [17588, 22738]}, {"en": "I don't get enough exercise.", "zh": "我缺乏锻炼。", "t": [22738, 24850]}, {"en": "I have no time for loafing.", "zh": "我无暇闲逛。", "t": [24850, 26975]}, {"en": "The third time-- well, this is it!", "zh": "第三次——嗯，就是这一次！", "t": [26975, 29388]}, {"en": "I was saying, then, five-hundred-and-one millions--\"", "zh": "那么，我接着说，五亿零一百万——", "t": [29388, 32675]}]}, {"id": "ch13p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Millions of what?\"", "zh": "五亿零一百万个什么？", "t": [125, 1375]}]}, {"id": "ch13p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The businessman suddenly realized that there was no hope of being left in peace until he answered this question.", "zh": "商人突然意识到，除非回答这个问题，否则他永远无法安宁。", "t": [138, 5775]}]}, {"id": "ch13p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Millions of those little objects,\" he said, \"which one sometimes sees in the sky.\"", "zh": "那些小小的东西，有时在天空里可以看到。", "t": [125, 4988]}]}, {"id": "ch13p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Flies?\"", "zh": "苍蝇吗？", "t": [100, 788]}]}, {"id": "ch13p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, no.", "zh": "哦，不。", "t": [112, 1488]}, {"en": "Little glittering objects.\"", "zh": "小小的闪烁之物。", "t": [1488, 3200]}]}, {"id": "ch13p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Bees?\"", "zh": "蜜蜂吗？", "t": [100, 675]}]}, {"id": "ch13p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, no.", "zh": "哦，不。", "t": [112, 1488]}, {"en": "Little golden objects that set lazy men to idle dreaming.", "zh": "那金色的小东西，让闲散的人沉醉于梦幻之中。", "t": [1488, 5538]}, {"en": "As for me, I am concerned with matters of consequence.", "zh": "至于我，我只关心重要的事。", "t": [5538, 9475]}, {"en": "There is no time for idle dreaming in my life.\"", "zh": "生活中不容我闲散做梦。", "t": [9475, 12250]}]}, {"id": "ch13p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "哎呀！", "t": [100, 850]}, {"en": "You mean the stars?\"", "zh": "您是指星星吗？", "t": [850, 2050]}]}, {"id": "ch13p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that's it.", "zh": "是的，就是这样。", "t": [112, 1862]}, {"en": "The stars.\"", "zh": "星星。", "t": [1862, 2662]}]}, {"id": "ch13p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what do you do with five-hundred millions of stars?\"", "zh": "你用五亿颗星星做什么呢？", "t": [112, 3100]}]}, {"id": "ch13p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Five-hundred-and-one million, six-hundred-twenty-two thousand, seven-hundred-thirty-one.", "zh": "五亿零一百六十二万二千七百三十一", "t": [125, 5738]}, {"en": "I am concerned with matters of consequence: I am accurate.\"", "zh": "我专注于重要之事：我追求精确。", "t": [5738, 9400]}]}, {"id": "ch13p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what do you do with these stars?\"", "zh": "您用这些星星做什么呢？", "t": [112, 2000]}]}, {"id": "ch13p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What do I do with them?\"", "zh": "我拿它们怎么办呢？", "t": [112, 1412]}]}, {"id": "ch13p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes.\"", "zh": "是的。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch13p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Nothing.", "zh": "没什么。", "t": [112, 1138]}, {"en": "I own them.\"", "zh": "我拥有它们。", "t": [1138, 1888]}]}, {"id": "ch13p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You own the stars?\"", "zh": "您拥有星星吗？", "t": [138, 1300]}]}, {"id": "ch13p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes.\"", "zh": "是的。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch13p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But I have already seen a king who--\"", "zh": "但我已见过一个国王，他——", "t": [100, 2087]}]}, {"id": "ch13p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Kings do not own, they reign over.", "zh": "国王并非“拥有”，而是“统治”。", "t": [100, 2788]}, {"en": "It is a very different matter.\"", "zh": "这大不相同。", "t": [2788, 4487]}]}, {"id": "ch13p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what good does it do you to own the stars?\"", "zh": "拥有星星对你有何益处？", "t": [112, 2500]}]}, {"id": "ch13p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It does me the good of making me rich.\"", "zh": "这使我变得富有。", "t": [138, 2276]}]}, {"id": "ch13p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what good does it do you to be rich?\"", "zh": "这财富对你有何益处？", "t": [138, 2300]}]}, {"id": "ch13p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It makes it possible for me to buy more stars, if any are ever discovered.\"", "zh": "若有人发现新的星星，我便可以买下更多。", "t": [138, 4487]}]}, {"id": "ch13p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This man,\" the little prince said to himself, \"reasons a little like my poor tippler...\"", "zh": "这位小王子心想：“这个人啊，他的推理方法有点像我那可怜的酒鬼。”", "t": [125, 4962]}]}, {"id": "ch13p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Nevertheless, he still had some more questions.", "zh": "然而，他仍有许多疑问。", "t": [125, 2988]}]}, {"id": "ch13p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"How is it possible for one to own the stars?\"", "zh": "一个人怎能拥有星星呢？", "t": [125, 2674]}]}, {"id": "ch13p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"To whom do they belong?\" the businessman retorted, peevishly.", "zh": "商人愤愤地反问：“它们属于谁？”", "t": [112, 3937]}]}, {"id": "ch13p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I don't know.", "zh": "我不知道。", "t": [125, 1350]}, {"en": "To nobody.\"", "zh": "对任何人都不属于。", "t": [1350, 2176]}]}, {"id": "ch13p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then they belong to me, because I was the first person to think of it.\"", "zh": "那它们就属于我了，因为我是第一个想到这个主意的人。", "t": [138, 3876]}]}, {"id": "ch13p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Is that all that is necessary?\"", "zh": "这还不够吗？", "t": [112, 1938]}]}, {"id": "ch13p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Certainly.", "zh": "当然。", "t": [112, 1275]}, {"en": "When you find a diamond that belongs to nobody, it is yours.", "zh": "当你发现一颗无主之钻，它便属于你了。", "t": [1275, 5238]}, {"en": "When you discover an island that belongs to nobody, it is yours.", "zh": "当你发现一座无人的岛屿，它便属于你。", "t": [5238, 9425]}, {"en": "When you get an idea before any one else, you take out a patent on it: it is yours.", "zh": "当你第一个想到一个主意，你就申请专利：那主意就是你的了。", "t": [9425, 14925]}, {"en": "So with me: I own the stars, because nobody else before me ever thought of owning them.\"", "zh": "如此，于我而言：我拥有星星，因为在我之前，无人曾想过拥有它们。", "t": [14925, 20062]}]}, {"id": "ch13p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is true,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "是的，这倒是真的，小王子说。", "t": [138, 3400]}, {"en": "\"And what do you do with them?\"", "zh": "您拿它们怎么办呢？", "t": [3400, 4812]}]}, {"id": "ch13p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I administer them,\" replied the businessman.", "zh": "我管理着它们。", "t": [138, 3112]}, {"en": "\"I count them and recount them.", "zh": "我数了又数。", "t": [3112, 5225]}, {"en": "It is difficult.", "zh": "这很困难。", "t": [5225, 6688]}, {"en": "But I am a man who is naturally interested in matters of consequence.\"", "zh": "然而，我天生对重要之事感兴趣。", "t": [6688, 10638]}]}, {"id": "ch13p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince was still not satisfied.", "zh": "小王子依旧不满足。", "t": [138, 2600]}]}, {"id": "ch13p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If I owned a silk scarf,\" he said, \"I could put it around my neck and take it away with me.", "zh": "如果我拥有一条丝巾，我就能围在脖子上带走。", "t": [138, 5475]}, {"en": "If I owned a flower, I could pluck that flower and take it away with me.", "zh": "若我拥有这朵花，便可摘下它，随身带走。", "t": [5475, 9762]}, {"en": "But you cannot pluck the stars from heaven...\"", "zh": "你不能从天空中摘下星星...", "t": [9762, 12138]}]}, {"id": "ch13p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.", "zh": "不。", "t": [100, 962]}, {"en": "But I can put them in the bank.\"", "zh": "但我可以把它们存进银行。", "t": [962, 2637]}]}, {"id": "ch13p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Whatever does that mean?\"", "zh": "这究竟是什么意思呢？", "t": [138, 1512]}]}, {"id": "ch13p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That means that I write the number of my stars on a little paper.", "zh": "这意味着我在一张小纸条上写下我的星星数目。", "t": [138, 4075]}, {"en": "And then I put this paper in a drawer and lock it with a key.\"", "zh": "然后我把这张纸条放进抽屉，并用钥匙锁上。", "t": [4075, 7363]}]}, {"id": "ch13p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And that is all?\"", "zh": "这便是全部了吗？", "t": [138, 1050]}]}, {"id": "ch13p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is enough,\" said the businessman.", "zh": "那便足够了，商人说。", "t": [125, 2350]}]}, {"id": "ch13p48", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is entertaining,\" thought the little prince.", "zh": "这倒有趣，小王子心想。", "t": [138, 3150]}, {"en": "\"It is rather poetic.", "zh": "这倒颇有诗意。", "t": [3150, 5025]}, {"en": "But it is of no great consequence.\"", "zh": "但这并无大碍。", "t": [5025, 7200]}]}, {"id": "ch13p49", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On matters of consequence, the little prince had ideas which were very different from those of the grown-ups.", "zh": "小王子在事关重大之事上，所持见解与成人迥异。", "t": [138, 5888]}]}, {"id": "ch13p50", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I myself own a flower,\" he continued his conversation with the businessman, \"which I water every day.", "zh": "“我自己养着一朵花，”他继续与商人交谈，“每天都要给它浇水。”", "t": [138, 6388]}, {"en": "I own three volcanoes, which I clean out every week (for I also clean out the one that is extinct; one never knows).", "zh": "我拥有三座火山，每周都要清理一番（包括那座死火山；毕竟，世事难料）。", "t": [6388, 13612]}, {"en": "It is of some use to my volcanoes, and it is of some use to my flower, that I own them.", "zh": "它使我的火山有了意义，也使我的玫瑰有了价值。", "t": [13612, 18962]}, {"en": "But you are of no use to the stars...\"", "zh": "但对星星来说，你毫无用处……", "t": [18962, 21175]}]}, {"id": "ch13p51", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The businessman opened his mouth, but he found nothing to say in answer.", "zh": "商人张口结舌，无言以对。", "t": [138, 4588]}, {"en": "And the little prince went away.", "zh": "小王子离去了。", "t": [4588, 6388]}]}, {"id": "ch13p52", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The grown-ups are certainly altogether extraordinary,\" he said simply, talking to himself as he continued on his journey.", "zh": "大人们真是奇怪得不可思议，他边走边自言自语。", "t": [138, 6900]}]}]}, {"id": "ch14", "title_en": "Chapter XIV", "title_zh": "第 14 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch14p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The fifth planet was very strange.", "zh": "第五颗星球颇为奇异。", "t": [138, 2638]}, {"en": "It was the smallest of all.", "zh": "那是所有星球中最小的一颗。", "t": [2638, 4662]}, {"en": "There was just enough room on it for a street lamp and a lamplighter.", "zh": "这颗星球仅能容纳一盏路灯和一个点灯人。", "t": [4662, 8550]}, {"en": "The little prince was not able to reach any explanation of the use of a street lamp and a lamplighter, somewhere in the heavens, on a planet, which had no people, and not one house.", "zh": "小王子无法解释清楚，在某个星球上，天空中，为何会有路灯和点灯人的存在，而这个星球既无人居住，也无房屋。", "t": [8550, 18750]}, {"en": "But he said to himself, nevertheless:", "zh": "然而，他自言自语道：", "t": [18750, 21213]}]}, {"id": "ch14p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It may well be that this man is absurd.", "zh": "这盏灯的人或许有些荒唐。", "t": [138, 2900]}, {"en": "But he is not so absurd as the king, the conceited man, the businessman, and the tippler.", "zh": "但他并不像国王、自负的人、商人、酒鬼那样荒谬。", "t": [2900, 8600]}, {"en": "For at least his work has some meaning.", "zh": "至少他的工作尚有意义。", "t": [8600, 11150]}, {"en": "When he lights his street lamp, it is as if he brought one more star to life, or one flower.", "zh": "他点亮街灯，仿佛又唤醒了一颗星星，或一朵花儿。", "t": [11150, 16662]}, {"en": "When he puts out his lamp, he sends the flower, or the star, to sleep.", "zh": "他熄灭灯火，便让花儿或星星进入梦乡。", "t": [16662, 21475]}, {"en": "That is a beautiful occupation.", "zh": "这是一份美好的职业。", "t": [21475, 23788]}, {"en": "And since it is beautiful, it is truly useful.\"", "zh": "既然美好，便真正有益。", "t": [23788, 26726]}]}, {"id": "ch14p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When he arrived on the planet he respectfully saluted the lamplighter.", "zh": "他抵达星球时，向点灯人毕恭毕敬地行礼。", "t": [138, 4012]}]}, {"id": "ch14p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning.", "zh": "早上好。", "t": [112, 1288]}, {"en": "Why have you just put out your lamp?\"", "zh": "你为何刚刚熄了灯？", "t": [1288, 3162]}]}, {"id": "ch14p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Those are the orders,\" replied the lamplighter.", "zh": "这是规定。", "t": [125, 3150]}, {"en": "\"Good morning.\"", "zh": "早上好。", "t": [3150, 3962]}]}, {"id": "ch14p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What are the orders?\"", "zh": "这是命令。", "t": [125, 1300]}]}, {"id": "ch14p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The orders are that I put out my lamp.", "zh": "这是熄灯的命令。", "t": [138, 2825]}, {"en": "Good evening.\"", "zh": "晚安。", "t": [2825, 3650]}]}, {"id": "ch14p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he lighted his lamp again.", "zh": "他又点亮了灯火。", "t": [138, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch14p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But why have you just lighted it again?\"", "zh": "你为何又把灯点亮了？", "t": [100, 2200]}]}, {"id": "ch14p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Those are the orders,\" replied the lamplighter.", "zh": "这是命令。", "t": [125, 2787]}]}, {"id": "ch14p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I do not understand,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "我不明白，小王子说。", "t": [138, 2863]}]}, {"id": "ch14p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"There is nothing to understand,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "“这没什么好理解的，”点灯人说。", "t": [125, 3488]}, {"en": "\"Orders are orders.", "zh": "命令就是命令。", "t": [3488, 5100]}, {"en": "Good morning.\"", "zh": "早上好。", "t": [5100, 5912]}]}, {"id": "ch14p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he put out his lamp.", "zh": "他熄灭了灯火。", "t": [138, 1538]}]}, {"id": "ch14p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then he mopped his forehead with a handkerchief decorated with red squares.", "zh": "他用手帕上的红格子方巾擦拭额头。", "t": [138, 4288]}]}, {"id": "ch14p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I follow a terrible profession.", "zh": "我从事着一份糟糕的职业。", "t": [138, 2538]}, {"en": "In the old days it was reasonable.", "zh": "往昔的规定尚合情理。", "t": [2538, 5000]}, {"en": "I put the lamp out in the morning, and in the evening I lighted it again.", "zh": "晨曦中熄灭灯火，暮色中复燃光亮。", "t": [5000, 9325]}, {"en": "I had the rest of the day for relaxation and the rest of the night for sleep.\"", "zh": "我拥有了整个白天的闲暇与夜晚的安眠。", "t": [9325, 13412]}]}, {"id": "ch14p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And the orders have been changed since that time?\"", "zh": "自那以后，规定已经改了？", "t": [125, 2725]}]}, {"id": "ch14p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The orders have not been changed,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "规定并未更改，点灯人说道。", "t": [138, 3562]}, {"en": "\"That is the tragedy!", "zh": "这是悲剧！", "t": [3562, 5188]}, {"en": "From year to year the planet has turned more rapidly and the orders have not been changed!\"", "zh": "年复一年，星球转得越来越快，而命令却未曾更改。", "t": [5188, 10000]}]}, {"id": "ch14p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then what?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "小王子问道：“那么呢？”", "t": [138, 2512]}]}, {"id": "ch14p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then-- the planet now makes a complete turn every minute, and I no longer have a single second for repose.", "zh": "这颗星球现在每分钟转一圈，我连一秒钟的休息时间都没有。", "t": [138, 6425]}, {"en": "Once every minute I have to light my lamp and put it out!\"", "zh": "每分钟我都要点亮又熄灭我的灯。", "t": [6425, 9625]}]}, {"id": "ch14p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is very funny!", "zh": "这真有趣！", "t": [125, 1600]}, {"en": "A day lasts only one minute, here where you live!\"", "zh": "在这里，一天仅有一分钟。", "t": [1600, 4526]}]}, {"id": "ch14p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is not funny at all!\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "这根本不有趣！点灯人说道。", "t": [112, 3088]}, {"en": "\"While we have been talking together a month has gone by.\"", "zh": "我们交谈之际，一个月已悄然流逝。", "t": [3088, 5987]}]}, {"id": "ch14p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A month?\"", "zh": "一个月？", "t": [112, 800]}]}, {"id": "ch14p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, a month.", "zh": "是的，一个月。", "t": [138, 1762]}, {"en": "Thirty minutes.", "zh": "三十分钟。", "t": [1762, 3212]}, {"en": "Thirty days.", "zh": "三十天。", "t": [3212, 4600]}, {"en": "Good evening.\"", "zh": "晚安。", "t": [4600, 5450]}]}, {"id": "ch14p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he lighted his lamp again.", "zh": "他又点亮了灯火。", "t": [138, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch14p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As the little prince watched him, he felt that he loved this lamplighter who was so faithful to his orders.", "zh": "他看着点灯人，心中涌起对这位忠于职责的灯夫的喜爱。", "t": [138, 6062]}, {"en": "He remembered the sunsets, which he himself had gone to seek, in other days, merely by pulling up his chair; and he wanted to help his friend.", "zh": "他记得，往昔自己只是搬动椅子，就能观赏到日落；他想要帮助他的朋友。", "t": [6062, 13938]}]}, {"id": "ch14p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know,\" he said, \"I can tell you a way you can rest whenever you want to...\"", "zh": "“你知道，”他道，“我可以告诉你一个方法，你想要休息的时候就能休息……”", "t": [112, 4288]}]}, {"id": "ch14p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I always want to rest,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "“我总是想休息，”点灯人说道。", "t": [138, 2813]}]}, {"id": "ch14p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For it is possible for a man to be faithful and lazy at the same time.", "zh": "人可以同时忠诚又懒惰。", "t": [125, 4588]}, {"en": "The little prince went on with his explanation:", "zh": "小王子继续解释道：", "t": [4588, 7288]}]}, {"id": "ch14p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Your planet is so small that three strides will take you all the way around it.", "zh": "你的星球如此之小，只需迈三步就能绕它一周。", "t": [138, 4712]}, {"en": "To be always in the sunshine, you need only walk along rather slowly.", "zh": "只需缓缓前行，便能始终沐浴在阳光下。", "t": [4712, 9075]}, {"en": "When you want to rest, you will walk-- and the day will last as long as you like.\"", "zh": "当你想休息时，就前行——日子便会如你所愿地延长。", "t": [9075, 13200]}]}, {"id": "ch14p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That doesn't do me much good,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "这对我帮助不大，点灯人说道。", "t": [125, 3338]}, {"en": "\"The one thing I love in life is to sleep.\"", "zh": "生命中所爱唯有沉睡。", "t": [3338, 5612]}]}, {"id": "ch14p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then you're unlucky,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "那你真是不幸啊。", "t": [125, 2676]}]}, {"id": "ch14p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am unlucky,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "我真是倒霉。", "t": [138, 2762]}, {"en": "\"Good morning.\" And he put out his lamp.", "zh": "早上好。他熄灭了灯火。", "t": [2762, 5338]}]}, {"id": "ch14p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That man,\" said the little prince to himself, as he continued farther on his journey, \"that man would be scorned by all the others: by the king, by the conceited man, by the tippler, by the businessman.", "zh": "那个人，”小王子在继续前行时自言自语，“那个人会被所有人嘲笑：国王、自负的人、酒鬼、商人。", "t": [125, 11788]}, {"en": "Nevertheless he is the only one of them all who does not seem to me ridiculous.", "zh": "然而，他是他们所有人中唯一一个在我看来并不荒谬的人。", "t": [11788, 16562]}, {"en": "Perhaps that is because he is thinking of something else besides himself.\"", "zh": "或许是因为他在想别的事情，而非只顾自己。", "t": [16562, 20526]}]}, {"id": "ch14p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He breathed a sigh of regret, and said to himself, again:", "zh": "他叹了口气，又自言自语道：", "t": [125, 3663]}]}, {"id": "ch14p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That man is the only one of them all whom I could have made my friend.", "zh": "那他是他们所有人中唯一一个我可以成为朋友的人。", "t": [138, 4212]}, {"en": "But his planet is indeed too small.", "zh": "然而，他的星球实在太小了。", "t": [4212, 6875]}, {"en": "There is no room on it for two people...\"", "zh": "这颗星球容不下两个人...", "t": [6875, 8963]}]}, {"id": "ch14p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "What the little prince did not dare confess was that he was sorry most of all to leave this planet, because it was blest every day with 1440 sunsets!", "zh": "他不敢承认的是，他最遗憾的是即将离开这个星球，因为它每天都能目睹1440次日落。", "t": [100, 9312]}]}]}, {"id": "ch15", "title_en": "Chapter XV", "title_zh": "第 15 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch15p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The sixth planet was ten times larger than the last one.", "zh": "第六颗行星比上一颗大十倍。", "t": [138, 3762]}, {"en": "It was inhabited by an old gentleman who wrote voluminous books.", "zh": "这位老先生撰写着厚重的书籍。", "t": [3762, 7662]}]}, {"id": "ch15p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, look!", "zh": "哦，看哪！", "t": [100, 1438]}, {"en": "Here is an explorer!\" he exclaimed to himself when he saw the little prince coming.", "zh": "哦，看哪！来了一位探险家！", "t": [1438, 5813]}]}, {"id": "ch15p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince sat down on the table and panted a little.", "zh": "小王子坐在桌子上，喘着气。", "t": [138, 3725]}, {"en": "He had already travelled so much and so far!", "zh": "他已跋涉千里，路途遥远！", "t": [3725, 6338]}]}, {"id": "ch15p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Where do you come from?\" the old gentleman said to him.", "zh": "您从何方来？", "t": [125, 3075]}]}, {"id": "ch15p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is that big book?\" said the little prince.", "zh": "那本厚重的书是何物？小王子问道。", "t": [138, 3225]}, {"en": "\"What are you doing?\"", "zh": "您在做什么？", "t": [3225, 4250]}]}, {"id": "ch15p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am a geographer,\" the old gentleman said to him.", "zh": "“我是地理学家，”老先生对他说。", "t": [138, 3063]}]}, {"id": "ch15p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is a geographer?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "小王子问：“地理学家是做什么的？”", "t": [125, 2975]}]}, {"id": "ch15p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A geographer is a scholar who knows the location of all the seas, rivers, towns, mountains, and deserts.\"", "zh": "地理学家是知晓大海、江河、城镇、山脉和沙漠位置的学者。", "t": [138, 7063]}]}, {"id": "ch15p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is very interesting,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "这倒很有趣，小王子说。", "t": [125, 3350]}, {"en": "\"Here at last is a man who has a real profession!\" And he cast a look around him at the planet of the geographer.", "zh": "终于，他遇见了一位真正有职业的人！他环顾四周，打量着地理学家的星球。", "t": [3350, 10212]}, {"en": "It was the most magnificent and stately planet that he had ever seen.", "zh": "这颗星球是他所见过的最为雄伟庄严的星球。", "t": [10212, 14075]}]}, {"id": "ch15p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Your planet is very beautiful,\" he said.", "zh": "您的星球真美。", "t": [138, 3075]}, {"en": "\"Has it any oceans?\"", "zh": "这颗星球有海洋吗？", "t": [3075, 4463]}]}, {"id": "ch15p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I couldn't tell you,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "“这我无法告知，”地理学家说。", "t": [138, 2376]}]}, {"id": "ch15p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!\" The little prince was disappointed.", "zh": "啊！小王子有些失望。", "t": [100, 3300]}, {"en": "\"Has it any mountains?\"", "zh": "这颗星球有山脉吗？", "t": [3300, 4737]}]}, {"id": "ch15p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I couldn't tell you,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "“这我无法告知，”地理学家说。", "t": [138, 2376]}]}, {"id": "ch15p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And towns, and rivers, and deserts?\"", "zh": "城镇、河流、沙漠？", "t": [112, 2812]}]}, {"id": "ch15p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I couldn't tell you that, either.\"", "zh": "这我也无法回答。", "t": [138, 2100]}]}, {"id": "ch15p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But you are a geographer!\"", "zh": "但您是地理学家！", "t": [100, 1588]}]}, {"id": "ch15p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Exactly,\" the geographer said.", "zh": "“正是如此，”地理学家答道。", "t": [112, 2600]}, {"en": "\"But I am not an explorer.", "zh": "但我不是探险家。", "t": [2600, 4600]}, {"en": "I haven't a single explorer on my planet.", "zh": "我的星球上没有一位探险家。", "t": [4600, 7638]}, {"en": "It is not the geographer who goes out to count the towns, the rivers, the mountains, the seas, the oceans, and the deserts.", "zh": "地理学家并非外出计数城镇、河流、山脉、海洋、大洋和沙漠。", "t": [7638, 15575]}, {"en": "The geographer is much too important to go loafing about.", "zh": "地理学家太过重要，不容闲逛。", "t": [15575, 19538]}, {"en": "He does not leave his desk.", "zh": "他从未离开过他的办公桌。", "t": [19538, 21525]}, {"en": "But he receives the explorers in his study.", "zh": "他在书房接待探险家。", "t": [21525, 24450]}, {"en": "He asks them questions, and he notes down what they recall of their travels.", "zh": "他询问他们，记录下他们旅途中的回忆。", "t": [24450, 29025]}, {"en": "And if the recollections of any one among them seem interesting to him, the geographer orders an inquiry into that explorer's moral character.\"", "zh": "若其中某位探险家的回忆引起了他的兴趣，地理学家便会下令调查那位探险者的道德品质。", "t": [29025, 36612]}]}, {"id": "ch15p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why is that?\"", "zh": "那是什么原因呢？", "t": [112, 1088]}]}, {"id": "ch15p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because an explorer who told lies would bring disaster on the books of the geographer.", "zh": "因为一个说谎的探险家会给地理学家的书籍带来灾难。", "t": [112, 5162]}, {"en": "So would an explorer who drank too much.\"", "zh": "一个酗酒的探险家也不行。", "t": [5162, 7700]}]}, {"id": "ch15p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why is that?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "“这又是为什么？”小王子问道。", "t": [138, 2600]}]}, {"id": "ch15p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because intoxicated men see double.", "zh": "酗酒者所见皆为双重。", "t": [100, 2938]}, {"en": "Then the geographer would note down two mountains in a place where there was only one.\"", "zh": "于是地理学家会在只有一座山的地方记下两座山。", "t": [2938, 7387]}]}, {"id": "ch15p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I know some one,\" said the little prince, \"who would make a bad explorer.\"", "zh": "我认识一个人，他会成为糟糕的探险家。", "t": [138, 4100]}]}, {"id": "ch15p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is possible.", "zh": "这是可能的。", "t": [125, 1650]}, {"en": "Then, when the moral character of the explorer is shown to be good, an inquiry is ordered into his discovery.\"", "zh": "于是，当探险者的道德品质得到证实，便下令调查他的发现。", "t": [1650, 7975]}]}, {"id": "ch15p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"One goes to see it?\"", "zh": "您去看过它吗？", "t": [125, 1400]}]}, {"id": "ch15p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.", "zh": "不。", "t": [100, 1000]}, {"en": "That would be too complicated.", "zh": "这太过复杂了。", "t": [1000, 3162]}, {"en": "But one requires the explorer to furnish proofs.", "zh": "但需探险家提供证据。", "t": [3162, 6550]}, {"en": "For example, if the discovery in question is that of a large mountain, one requires that large stones be brought back from it.\"", "zh": "例如，如果探险的成果是发现了一座大山，便需从那里带回大石头。", "t": [6550, 13537]}]}, {"id": "ch15p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The geographer was suddenly stirred to excitement.", "zh": "地理学家突然激动起来。", "t": [138, 3075]}]}, {"id": "ch15p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But you-- you come from far away!", "zh": "但你——你从远方来！", "t": [100, 2338]}, {"en": "You are an explorer!", "zh": "你是一位探险家！", "t": [2338, 3825]}, {"en": "You shall describe your planet to me!\"", "zh": "请向我描述你的星球。", "t": [3825, 5800]}]}, {"id": "ch15p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, having opened his big register, the geographer sharpened his pencil.", "zh": "地理学家翻开他那厚重的登记册，削尖了他的铅笔。", "t": [138, 5100]}, {"en": "The recitals of explorers are put down first in pencil.", "zh": "探险家的口述先以铅笔记录。", "t": [5100, 9038]}, {"en": "One waits until the explorer has furnished proofs, before putting them down in ink.", "zh": "待探险家提供证据后，方以墨水记录之。", "t": [9038, 13876]}]}, {"id": "ch15p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Well?\" said the geographer expectantly.", "zh": "“嗯？”地理学家期待地问道。", "t": [138, 2900]}]}, {"id": "ch15p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, where I live,\" said the little prince, \"it is not very interesting.", "zh": "哦，我那地方可没意思了，小王子说。", "t": [125, 4725]}, {"en": "It is all so small.", "zh": "这一切都如此渺小。", "t": [4725, 6475]}, {"en": "I have three volcanoes.", "zh": "我有三座火山。", "t": [6475, 8438]}, {"en": "Two volcanoes are active and the other is extinct.", "zh": "两座火山活跃，另一座已熄灭。", "t": [8438, 11938]}, {"en": "But one never knows.\"", "zh": "然而，无人能预知。", "t": [11938, 13262]}]}, {"id": "ch15p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"One never knows,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "无人能预知，地理学家说。", "t": [138, 2438]}]}, {"id": "ch15p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have also a flower.\"", "zh": "我还有一朵花。", "t": [100, 1637]}]}, {"id": "ch15p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We do not record flowers,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "我们不记录花朵，地理学家说。", "t": [138, 2938]}]}, {"id": "ch15p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why is that?", "zh": "那又是为何呢？", "t": [112, 1462]}, {"en": "The flower is the most beautiful thing on my planet!\"", "zh": "这朵花是我星球上最美的东西。", "t": [1462, 4450]}]}, {"id": "ch15p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We do not record them,\" said the geographer, \"because they are ephemeral.\"", "zh": "“我们不记录它们，”地理学家说，“因为它们是转瞬即逝的。”", "t": [138, 4100]}]}, {"id": "ch15p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What does that mean-- 'ephemeral'?\"", "zh": "那“转瞬即逝”又是什么意思？", "t": [138, 1663]}]}, {"id": "ch15p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Geographies,\" said the geographer, \"are the books which, of all books, are most concerned with matters of consequence.", "zh": "地理学，地理学家说，“是所有书籍中最关注重大事务的书籍。", "t": [100, 7250]}, {"en": "They never become old-fashioned.", "zh": "它们永远不会过时。", "t": [7250, 9462]}, {"en": "It is very rarely that a mountain changes its position.", "zh": "山移位，极为罕见。", "t": [9462, 13025]}, {"en": "It is very rarely that an ocean empties itself of its waters.", "zh": "海洋干涸之事，极为罕见。", "t": [13025, 17150]}, {"en": "We write of eternal things.\"", "zh": "我们记载永恒之物。", "t": [17150, 18875]}]}, {"id": "ch15p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But extinct volcanoes may come to life again,\" the little prince interrupted.", "zh": "但死火山也可能复苏，小王子打断了他的话。", "t": [100, 5100]}, {"en": "\"What does that mean-- 'ephemeral'?\"", "zh": "那“转瞬即逝”又是什么意思？", "t": [5100, 6662]}]}, {"id": "ch15p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Whether volcanoes are extinct or alive, it comes to the same thing for us,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "火山是否熄灭或活跃，对我们来说并无区别。", "t": [138, 5938]}, {"en": "\"The thing that matters to us is the mountain.", "zh": "山，对我们来说，才是重要的。", "t": [5938, 8775]}, {"en": "It does not change.\"", "zh": "它不会改变。", "t": [8775, 10000]}]}, {"id": "ch15p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But what does that mean-- 'ephemeral'?\" repeated the little prince, who never in his life had let go of a question, once he had asked it.", "zh": "“‘转瞬即逝’是什么意思？”小王子继续追问，他一生中一旦提问，就绝不会轻易放手。", "t": [100, 7200]}]}, {"id": "ch15p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It means, 'which is in danger of speedy disappearance.'\"", "zh": "意味着“面临迅速消失的危险”。", "t": [138, 3650]}]}, {"id": "ch15p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Is my flower in danger of speedy disappearance?\"", "zh": "我的花儿面临迅速消失的危险吗？", "t": [112, 3300]}]}, {"id": "ch15p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Certainly it is.\"", "zh": "当然如此。", "t": [125, 1350]}]}, {"id": "ch15p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My flower is ephemeral,\" the little prince said to himself, \"and she has only four thorns to defend herself against the world.", "zh": "我的花儿是转瞬即逝的，小王子自言自语道，而她只有四根刺来保护自己抵御这个世界。", "t": [138, 7388]}, {"en": "And I have left her on my planet, all alone!\"", "zh": "我让她孤零零地留在了我的星球上。", "t": [7388, 10087]}]}, {"id": "ch15p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "That was his first moment of regret.", "zh": "那是他第一次感到悔恨。", "t": [138, 2662]}, {"en": "But he took courage once more.", "zh": "他再次鼓起勇气。", "t": [2662, 4425]}]}, {"id": "ch15p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What place would you advise me to visit now?\" he asked.", "zh": "您现在建议我去哪个地方呢？", "t": [138, 3412]}]}, {"id": "ch15p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The planet Earth,\" replied the geographer.", "zh": "地球，地理学家答道。", "t": [138, 3012]}, {"en": "\"It has a good reputation.\"", "zh": "它享有盛名。", "t": [3012, 4625]}]}, {"id": "ch15p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince went away, thinking of his flower.", "zh": "小王子离去，心中想着他的花儿。", "t": [138, 3250]}]}]}, {"id": "ch16", "title_en": "Chapter XVI", "title_zh": "第 16 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch16p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then the seventh planet was the Earth.", "zh": "于是，第七颗行星便是地球。", "t": [112, 2425]}]}, {"id": "ch16p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The Earth is not just an ordinary planet!", "zh": "地球非同小可！", "t": [125, 2975]}, {"en": "One can count; there are 111 kings (not forgetting, to be sure, the Negro kings among them), 7000 geographers, 900,000 businessmen, 7,500,000 tipplers, and 311,000,000 conceited men-- that is to say, about 2,000,000,000 grown-ups.", "zh": "可数的是，这里有111位国王（当然，别忘了，其中也有黑人国王），7000位地理学家，900万商人，7500万酒鬼，3.11亿自命不凡的人——也就是说，大约有2亿个大人。", "t": [2975, 21150]}]}, {"id": "ch16p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "To give you an idea of the size of the Earth, I will tell you that before the invention of electricity it was necessary to maintain, over the whole of the six continents, a veritable army of 462,511 lamplighters for the street lamps.", "zh": "为了让你对地球的大小有个具体概念，我得告诉你，在电发明之前，整个六大洲需要维持一支由四十六万二千五百一十一个点灯人组成的真正大军。", "t": [100, 14550]}]}, {"id": "ch16p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Seen from a slight distance, that would make a splendid spectacle.", "zh": "从远处望去，那将是一场壮观的景象。", "t": [112, 4262]}, {"en": "The movements of this army would be regulated like those of the ballet in the opera.", "zh": "这支部队的动作将如同歌剧芭蕾舞般井然有序。", "t": [4262, 9012]}, {"en": "First would come the turn of the lamplighters of New Zealand and Australia.", "zh": "新西兰和澳大利亚的提灯人将率先登场。", "t": [9012, 13588]}, {"en": "Having set their lamps alight, these would go off to sleep.", "zh": "点亮了灯，他们便去安睡了。", "t": [13588, 17275]}, {"en": "Next, the lamplighters of China and Siberia would enter for their steps in the dance, and then they too would be waved back into the wings.", "zh": "接着，中国和西伯利亚的提灯人加入舞步，随后他们也渐渐退入幕后。", "t": [17275, 25200]}, {"en": "After that would come the turn of the lamplighters of Russia and the Indies; then those of Africa and Europe, then those of South America; then those of South America; then those of North America.", "zh": "接着，轮到俄罗斯和印度群岛的提灯人，然后是非洲和欧洲的，接着是南美洲的，最后是北美洲的。", "t": [25200, 35938]}, {"en": "And never would they make a mistake in the order of their entry upon the stage.", "zh": "他们的进场顺序从未出错。", "t": [35938, 40288]}, {"en": "It would be magnificent.", "zh": "壮观至极。", "t": [40288, 41788]}]}, {"id": "ch16p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Only the man who was in charge of the single lamp at the North Pole, and his colleague who was responsible for the single lamp at the South Pole-- only these two would live free from toil and care: they would be busy twice a year.", "zh": "北极那盏灯的守护者，以及南极那盏灯的同事——唯有他们二人得以远离劳碌与烦恼：他们只需每年忙碌两次。", "t": [100, 11050]}]}]}, {"id": "ch17", "title_en": "Chapter XVII", "title_zh": "第 17 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch17p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When one wishes to play the wit, he sometimes wanders a little from the truth.", "zh": "当人想卖弄聪明时，有时会稍稍偏离真相。", "t": [125, 4950]}, {"en": "I have not been altogether honest in what I have told you about the lamplighters.", "zh": "我讲述点灯人的事时，并未全然坦诚。", "t": [4950, 9612]}, {"en": "And I realize that I run the risk of giving a false idea of our planet to those who do not know it.", "zh": "我意识到，我可能给那些不了解我们星球的人留下了错误的印象。", "t": [9612, 15425]}, {"en": "Men occupy a very small place upon the Earth.", "zh": "人在地球上占据的只是极小的一隅。", "t": [15425, 18788]}, {"en": "If the two billion inhabitants who people its surface were all to stand upright and somewhat crowded together, as they do for some big public assembly, they could easily be put into one public square twenty miles long and twenty miles wide.", "zh": "若这二十亿居民都站立起来，且稍微挤一挤，就像他们参加大型集会那样，便能轻松地安置在二十英里长、二十英里宽的广场上。", "t": [18788, 31650]}, {"en": "All humanity could be piled up on a small Pacific islet.", "zh": "人类可以堆在太平洋上的一座小岛上。", "t": [31650, 35237]}]}, {"id": "ch17p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The grown-ups, to be sure, will not believe you when you tell them that.", "zh": "大人们，当然，当你告诉他们这些时，他们不会相信的。", "t": [138, 4450]}, {"en": "They imagine that they fill a great deal of space.", "zh": "他们自以为占据了极大的空间。", "t": [4450, 7512]}, {"en": "They fancy themselves as important as the baobabs.", "zh": "他们自以为与猴面包树一样重要。", "t": [7512, 11075]}, {"en": "You should advise them, then, to make their own calculations.", "zh": "你们不妨建议他们自己算一算。", "t": [11075, 15125]}, {"en": "They adore figures, and that will please them.", "zh": "他们偏爱数字，这会让他们高兴的。", "t": [15125, 17962]}, {"en": "But do not waste your time on this extra task.", "zh": "但别在这额外任务上浪费时间。", "t": [17962, 21138]}, {"en": "It is unnecessary.", "zh": "这并无必要。", "t": [21138, 22850]}, {"en": "You have, I know, confidence in me.", "zh": "你对我，我深知，满怀信心。", "t": [22850, 25400]}]}, {"id": "ch17p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When the little prince arrived on the Earth, he was very much surprised not to see any people.", "zh": "小王子抵达地球时，惊讶地发现不见一人。", "t": [138, 5612]}, {"en": "He was beginning to be afraid he had come to the wrong planet, when a coil of gold, the colour of the moonlight, flashed across the sand.", "zh": "他开始害怕自己来到了错误的星球，就在这时，一道金色螺旋，月光般的光辉，在沙地上闪现。", "t": [5612, 12750]}]}, {"id": "ch17p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good evening,\" said the little prince courteously.", "zh": "“晚上好，”小王子有礼地说。", "t": [112, 2813]}]}, {"id": "ch17p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good evening,\" said the snake.", "zh": "“晚上好，”蛇说。", "t": [100, 1950]}]}, {"id": "ch17p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What planet is this on which I have come down?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "这颗星球，我降落在了哪里？小王子问道。", "t": [138, 4200]}]}, {"id": "ch17p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This is the Earth; this is Africa,\" the snake answered.", "zh": "这是地球；这是非洲，蛇回答说。", "t": [100, 3588]}]}, {"id": "ch17p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "啊！", "t": [100, 838]}, {"en": "Then there are no people on the Earth?\"", "zh": "地球上无人吗？", "t": [838, 2738]}]}, {"id": "ch17p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This is the desert.", "zh": "这是沙漠。", "t": [125, 1725]}, {"en": "There are no people in the desert.", "zh": "沙漠中无人迹。", "t": [1725, 3875]}, {"en": "The Earth is large,\" said the snake.", "zh": "地球辽阔，蛇说。", "t": [3875, 6076]}]}, {"id": "ch17p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince sat down on a stone, and raised his eyes toward the sky.", "zh": "小王子坐在一块石头上，仰望天空。", "t": [138, 4263]}]}, {"id": "ch17p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I wonder,\" he said, \"whether the stars are set alight in heaven so that one day each one of us may find his own again...", "zh": "他自言自语道：“我想知道，是不是星星在天空中被点亮，以便有一天我们都能找到属于自己的那颗。”", "t": [138, 7062]}, {"en": "Look at my planet.", "zh": "看我的星球。", "t": [7062, 8688]}, {"en": "It is right there above us.", "zh": "它就在我们头顶上方。", "t": [8688, 10675]}, {"en": "But how far away it is!\"", "zh": "它多么遥远啊！", "t": [10675, 12238]}]}, {"id": "ch17p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is beautiful,\" the snake said.", "zh": "它真美。", "t": [112, 2612]}, {"en": "\"What has brought you here?\"", "zh": "你为何至此？", "t": [2612, 3963]}]}, {"id": "ch17p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have been having some trouble with a flower,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“我那朵花让我挺烦恼的。”小王子说。", "t": [138, 3726]}]}, {"id": "ch17p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!\" said the snake.", "zh": "啊！蛇说。", "t": [138, 1513]}]}, {"id": "ch17p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And they were both silent.", "zh": "他们俩都沉默了。", "t": [138, 1588]}]}, {"id": "ch17p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Where are the men?\" the little prince at last took up the conversation again.", "zh": "小王子终于又开口说话：“人们在哪里？”", "t": [138, 4300]}]}, {"id": "ch17p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is a little lonely in the desert...\"", "zh": "沙漠中，有点孤单。", "t": [138, 2187]}]}, {"id": "ch17p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is also lonely among men,\" the snake said.", "zh": "人在人间，亦感孤寂。", "t": [138, 3013]}]}, {"id": "ch17p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince gazed at him for a long time.", "zh": "小王子凝视着他许久。", "t": [138, 2700]}]}, {"id": "ch17p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are a funny animal,\" he said at last.", "zh": "他终于说道：“你真是个有趣的动物。”", "t": [138, 3025]}, {"en": "\"You are no thicker than a finger...\"", "zh": "你细得就像一根手指。", "t": [3025, 4750]}]}, {"id": "ch17p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But I am more powerful than the finger of a king,\" said the snake.", "zh": "但我的力量胜过国王的手指。", "t": [100, 3650]}]}, {"id": "ch17p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince smiled.", "zh": "小王子微笑了。", "t": [138, 1625]}]}, {"id": "ch17p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are not very powerful.", "zh": "你并不怎么强大。", "t": [138, 2112]}, {"en": "You haven't even any feet.", "zh": "你连脚都没有。", "t": [2112, 4138]}, {"en": "You cannot even travel...\"", "zh": "你甚至无法远行...", "t": [4138, 5638]}]}, {"id": "ch17p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I can carry you farther than any ship could take you,\" said the snake.", "zh": "我能带你走得更远，蛇说。", "t": [138, 3937]}]}, {"id": "ch17p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He twined himself around the little prince's ankle, like a golden bracelet.", "zh": "他如金镯般缠绕在小王子的脚踝上。", "t": [125, 4600]}]}, {"id": "ch17p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Whomever I touch, I send back to the earth from whence he came,\" the snake spoke again.", "zh": "无论我触及谁，都能将他送回他来的地方。", "t": [138, 5562]}, {"en": "\"But you are innocent and true, and you come from a star...\"", "zh": "但你纯洁无瑕，来自星辰之巅。", "t": [5562, 8837]}]}, {"id": "ch17p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince made no reply.", "zh": "小王子默然不语。", "t": [138, 2163]}]}, {"id": "ch17p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You move me to pity-- you are so weak on this Earth made of granite,\" the snake said.", "zh": "在这花岗岩构成的地球上，你如此羸弱，令我心生怜悯。", "t": [138, 5175]}, {"en": "\"I can help you, some day, if you grow too homesick for your own planet.", "zh": "若你日思夜想，渴望回到自己的星球，我终将助你一臂之力。", "t": [5175, 9825]}, {"en": "I can--\"", "zh": "我能——", "t": [9825, 10475]}]}, {"id": "ch17p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!", "zh": "哦！", "t": [100, 838]}, {"en": "I understand you very well,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "我深知你的心意，小王子说。", "t": [838, 4325]}, {"en": "\"But why do you always speak in riddles?\"", "zh": "但你为何总是说谜语？", "t": [4325, 6550]}]}, {"id": "ch17p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I solve them all,\" said the snake.", "zh": "我解开所有的谜。", "t": [138, 2200]}]}, {"id": "ch17p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And they were both silent.", "zh": "他们俩都沉默了。", "t": [138, 1588]}]}]}, {"id": "ch18", "title_en": "Chapter XVIII", "title_zh": "第 18 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch18p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince crossed the desert and met with only one flower.", "zh": "小王子穿越沙漠，邂逅了那朵花。", "t": [138, 4038]}, {"en": "It was a flower with three petals, a flower of no account at all.", "zh": "一朵三瓣的花，平凡无奇。", "t": [4038, 7937]}]}, {"id": "ch18p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "早上好，小王子说。", "t": [112, 2312]}]}, {"id": "ch18p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the flower.", "zh": "早上好，花儿说。", "t": [100, 1987]}]}, {"id": "ch18p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Where are the men?\" the little prince asked, politely.", "zh": "小王子彬彬有礼地问道：“人在哪里？”", "t": [138, 3413]}]}, {"id": "ch18p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The flower had once seen a caravan passing.", "zh": "那朵花儿曾见过一队商队经过。", "t": [138, 2712]}]}, {"id": "ch18p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Men?\" she echoed.", "zh": "人吗？她应声而问。", "t": [112, 2012]}, {"en": "\"I think there are six or seven of them in existence.", "zh": "世间大概有六七个这样的人。", "t": [2012, 5225]}, {"en": "I saw them, several years ago.", "zh": "几年前我曾见过他们。", "t": [5225, 7650]}, {"en": "But one never knows where to find them.", "zh": "但无人能知晓他们在何方。", "t": [7650, 10062]}, {"en": "The wind blows them away.", "zh": "风将他们吹散了。", "t": [10062, 11988]}, {"en": "They have no roots, and that makes their life very difficult.\"", "zh": "他们无根无基，生活因而颇为艰难。", "t": [11988, 15475]}]}, {"id": "ch18p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "再见，小王子说。", "t": [112, 2175]}]}, {"id": "ch18p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" said the flower.", "zh": "再见，花儿说。", "t": [100, 1874]}]}]}, {"id": "ch19", "title_en": "Chapter XIX", "title_zh": "第 19 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch19p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After that, the little prince climbed a high mountain.", "zh": "此后，小王子攀登上一座高山。", "t": [125, 3588]}, {"en": "The only mountains he had ever known were the three volcanoes, which came up to his knees.", "zh": "他仅知的山只有那三座火山，它们的高度仅至他的膝盖。", "t": [3588, 8762]}, {"en": "And he used the extinct volcano as a footstool.", "zh": "他用那座死火山当脚凳。", "t": [8762, 12100]}, {"en": "\"From a mountain as high as this one,\" he said to himself, \"I shall be able to see the whole planet at one glance, and all the people...\"", "zh": "从这座高山之巅，他自语道：“我一眼便能将整个星球尽收眼底，以及所有人……”", "t": [12100, 19337]}]}, {"id": "ch19p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he saw nothing, save peaks of rock that were sharpened like needles.", "zh": "只见岩石尖峰，如针般锋利。", "t": [100, 4212]}]}, {"id": "ch19p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" he said courteously.", "zh": "早上好，他礼貌地说。", "t": [100, 2300]}]}, {"id": "ch19p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning--Good morning--Good morning,\" answered the echo.", "zh": "早上好——早上好——早上好，回声答道。", "t": [100, 3187]}]}, {"id": "ch19p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Who are you?\" said the little prince.", "zh": "你是谁？小王子问道。", "t": [138, 2326]}]}, {"id": "ch19p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Who are you--Who are you--Who are you?\" answered the echo.", "zh": "你是谁——你是谁——你是谁？回声应道。", "t": [138, 3100]}]}, {"id": "ch19p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Be my friends.", "zh": "做我的朋友吧。", "t": [112, 1538]}, {"en": "I am all alone,\" he said.", "zh": "我孤零零一人，他说。", "t": [1538, 3225]}]}, {"id": "ch19p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am all alone--all alone--all alone,\" answered the echo.", "zh": "我孤零零一人——孤零零一人——孤零零一人，回声应道。", "t": [138, 3400]}]}, {"id": "ch19p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What a queer planet!\" he thought.", "zh": "多么奇特的星球啊，他想。", "t": [100, 2425]}, {"en": "\"It is altogether dry, and altogether pointed, and altogether harsh and forbidding.", "zh": "干涸而尖锐，严酷而拒人于千里之外。", "t": [2425, 7638]}, {"en": "And the people have no imagination.", "zh": "人们缺乏想象力。", "t": [7638, 10088]}, {"en": "They repeat whatever one says to them...", "zh": "他们重复着别人对他们的每一句话。", "t": [10088, 12662]}, {"en": "On my planet I had a flower; she always was the first to speak...\"", "zh": "在我的星球上，我有一朵花，她总是抢先开口……", "t": [12662, 16613]}]}]}, {"id": "ch20", "title_en": "Chapter XX", "title_zh": "第 20 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch20p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But it happened that after walking for a long time through sand, and rocks, and snow, the little prince at last came upon a road.", "zh": "走过漫漫长路，穿过沙丘、岩石和雪地，小王子终于找到了一条道路。", "t": [100, 7413]}]}, {"id": "ch20p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And all roads lead to the abodes of men.", "zh": "所有道路都通向人类的居所。", "t": [138, 2574]}]}, {"id": "ch20p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" he said.", "zh": "早上好，他道。", "t": [100, 1638]}]}, {"id": "ch20p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was standing before a garden, all a-bloom with roses.", "zh": "他站在一片盛开的玫瑰花丛前。", "t": [125, 3575]}]}, {"id": "ch20p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the roses.", "zh": "玫瑰们道：“早上好。”", "t": [100, 2075]}]}, {"id": "ch20p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince gazed at them.", "zh": "小王子凝望着她们。", "t": [138, 2250]}, {"en": "They all looked like his flower.", "zh": "她们都像他的那朵花。", "t": [2250, 3838]}]}, {"id": "ch20p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Who are you?\" he demanded, thunderstruck.", "zh": "他惊愕地问道：“你们是谁？”", "t": [138, 2987]}]}, {"id": "ch20p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We are roses,\" the roses said.", "zh": "“我们是玫瑰，”玫瑰们说。", "t": [138, 2325]}]}, {"id": "ch20p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he was overcome with sadness.", "zh": "他不禁悲伤不已。", "t": [138, 2475]}, {"en": "His flower had told him that she was the only one of her kind in all the universe.", "zh": "他的玫瑰曾告诉他，她是宇宙间独一无二的存在。", "t": [2475, 7275]}, {"en": "And here were five thousand of them, all alike, in one single garden!", "zh": "在这片花园里，五千朵玫瑰，无一例外。", "t": [7275, 11350]}]}, {"id": "ch20p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"She would be very much annoyed,\" he said to himself, \"if she should see that...", "zh": "她若看到这些，一定会非常生气。", "t": [125, 4238]}, {"en": "she would cough most dreadfully, and she would pretend that she was dying, to avoid being laughed at.", "zh": "她将痛苦地咳嗽，装作自己快要死去，以免被人嘲笑。", "t": [4238, 9588]}, {"en": "And I should be obliged to pretend that I was nursing her back to life-- for if I did not do that, to humble myself also, she would really allow herself to die...\"", "zh": "我只好装作在悉心照料她，让她恢复生机——否则，为了自谦，她真的会让自己死去……", "t": [9588, 18075]}]}, {"id": "ch20p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then he went on with his reflections: \"I thought that I was rich, with a flower that was unique in all the world; and all I had was a common rose.", "zh": "我以为自己富足，却原来只拥有了一朵普普通通的玫瑰。", "t": [138, 8400]}, {"en": "A common rose, and three volcanoes that come up to my knees-- and one of them perhaps extinct forever...", "zh": "一朵平凡的玫瑰，三座仅及膝高的火山——其中一座或许永远熄灭。", "t": [8400, 14275]}, {"en": "that doesn't make me a very great prince...\"", "zh": "这并不能使我成为一位伟大的王子……", "t": [14275, 16388]}]}, {"id": "ch20p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he lay down in the grass and cried.", "zh": "他躺在草地上，失声痛哭。", "t": [138, 2337]}]}]}, {"id": "ch21", "title_en": "Chapter XXI", "title_zh": "第 21 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch21p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It was then that the fox appeared.", "zh": "那时，狐狸出现了。", "t": [138, 2012]}]}, {"id": "ch21p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the fox.", "zh": "早上好，狐狸说。", "t": [100, 1988]}]}, {"id": "ch21p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" the little prince responded politely, although when he turned around he saw nothing.", "zh": "早上好，小王子有礼地回应，尽管他转身四顾，却什么也没看见。", "t": [138, 5313]}]}, {"id": "ch21p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am right here,\" the voice said, \"under the apple tree.\"", "zh": "“我就在苹果树下。”", "t": [138, 3350]}]}, {"id": "ch21p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Who are you?\" asked the little prince, and added, \"You are very pretty to look at.\"", "zh": "小王子问：“你是谁？你看起来真美。”", "t": [138, 4837]}]}, {"id": "ch21p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am a fox,\" said the fox.", "zh": "“我是狐狸，”狐狸说。", "t": [138, 2163]}]}, {"id": "ch21p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Come and play with me,\" proposed the little prince.", "zh": "来和我一起玩吧，小王子提议。", "t": [100, 3325]}, {"en": "\"I am so unhappy.\"", "zh": "我如此不快乐。", "t": [3325, 4662]}]}, {"id": "ch21p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I cannot play with you,\" the fox said.", "zh": "我不能与你玩耍，狐狸说。", "t": [138, 2812]}, {"en": "\"I am not tamed.\"", "zh": "我尚未被驯服。", "t": [2812, 3912]}]}, {"id": "ch21p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "啊！", "t": [100, 800]}, {"en": "Please excuse me,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "请见谅，小王子说。", "t": [800, 3350]}]}, {"id": "ch21p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But, after some thought, he added: \"What does that mean-- 'tame'?\"", "zh": "但经过一番思考，他又问：“那‘驯服’究竟是什么意思？”", "t": [100, 4037]}]}, {"id": "ch21p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You do not live here,\" said the fox.", "zh": "你并不住在这里。", "t": [112, 2700]}, {"en": "\"What is it that you are looking for?\"", "zh": "你在寻找什么？", "t": [2700, 4500]}]}, {"id": "ch21p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am looking for men,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "我寻找人类，小王子说。", "t": [138, 3125]}, {"en": "\"What does that mean-- 'tame'?\"", "zh": "那“驯服”究竟是什么意思？", "t": [3125, 4550]}]}, {"id": "ch21p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Men,\" said the fox.", "zh": "人们，狐狸说。", "t": [125, 2138]}, {"en": "\"They have guns, and they hunt.", "zh": "他们有枪，他们打猎。", "t": [2138, 4450]}, {"en": "It is very disturbing.", "zh": "令人心绪不宁。", "t": [4450, 6262]}, {"en": "They also raise chickens.", "zh": "人们也养鸡。", "t": [6262, 8300]}, {"en": "These are their only interests.", "zh": "这些便是他们的唯一兴趣。", "t": [8300, 10462]}, {"en": "Are you looking for chickens?\"", "zh": "你在找鸡吗？", "t": [10462, 11987]}]}, {"id": "ch21p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“不，”小王子说。", "t": [125, 2450]}, {"en": "\"I am looking for friends.", "zh": "我在寻找朋友。", "t": [2450, 4288]}, {"en": "What does that mean-- 'tame'?\"", "zh": "那“驯服”究竟是什么意思？", "t": [4288, 5675]}]}, {"id": "ch21p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is an act too often neglected,\" said the fox.", "zh": "这是件常被忽视的行为，狐狸说。", "t": [138, 3762]}, {"en": "It means to establish ties.\"", "zh": "建立联系。", "t": [3762, 5650]}]}, {"id": "ch21p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"'To establish ties'?\"", "zh": "建立联系？", "t": [100, 1500]}]}, {"id": "ch21p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Just that,\" said the fox.", "zh": "“就如此，”狐狸说。", "t": [100, 2388]}, {"en": "\"To me, you are still nothing more than a little boy who is just like a hundred thousand other little boys.", "zh": "对你而言，我不过是一个和无数小男孩无异的男孩。", "t": [2388, 8338]}, {"en": "And I have no need of you.", "zh": "我并不需要你。", "t": [8338, 10162]}, {"en": "And you, on your part, have no need of me.", "zh": "你对我，也无需任何依赖。", "t": [10162, 13338]}, {"en": "To you, I am nothing more than a fox like a hundred thousand other foxes.", "zh": "对你而言，我不过是一只和其他成千上万的狐狸一样的狐狸。", "t": [13338, 18088]}, {"en": "But if you tame me, then we shall need each other.", "zh": "但若你驯服了我，我们便彼此需要。", "t": [18088, 21125]}, {"en": "To me, you will be unique in all the world.", "zh": "在你眼中，我是这世上独一无二的。", "t": [21125, 24075]}, {"en": "To you, I shall be unique in all the world...\"", "zh": "在你们的世界里，我将独一无二。", "t": [24075, 26775]}]}, {"id": "ch21p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am beginning to understand,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "我开始明白了，小王子说。", "t": [138, 3538]}, {"en": "\"There is a flower...", "zh": "那朵花儿……", "t": [3538, 5075]}, {"en": "I think that she has tamed me...\"", "zh": "我想她已经驯服了我……", "t": [5075, 6763]}]}, {"id": "ch21p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is possible,\" said the fox.", "zh": "“这可能，”狐狸说。", "t": [100, 2600]}, {"en": "\"On the Earth one sees all sorts of things.\"", "zh": "地球上可见万物。", "t": [2600, 5050]}]}, {"id": "ch21p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, but this is not on the Earth!\" said the little prince.", "zh": "哦，但这里可不是在地球上！小王子说。", "t": [112, 3475]}]}, {"id": "ch21p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The fox seemed perplexed, and very curious.", "zh": "狐狸显得困惑，十分好奇。", "t": [138, 3063]}]}, {"id": "ch21p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"On another planet?\"", "zh": "在另一个星球上？", "t": [138, 1350]}]}, {"id": "ch21p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes.\"", "zh": "是的。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch21p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Are there hunters on this planet?\"", "zh": "这颗星球上有猎人吗？", "t": [112, 2038]}]}, {"id": "ch21p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.\"", "zh": "没有。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch21p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah, that is interesting!", "zh": "哦，这很有意思！", "t": [138, 2050]}, {"en": "Are there chickens?\"", "zh": "这里有鸡吗？", "t": [2050, 3137]}]}, {"id": "ch21p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.\"", "zh": "不。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch21p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Nothing is perfect,\" sighed the fox.", "zh": "世间无完美，狐狸叹了口气。", "t": [125, 2550]}]}, {"id": "ch21p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he came back to his idea.", "zh": "但他又回到了自己的想法。", "t": [100, 1888]}]}, {"id": "ch21p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My life is very monotonous,\" the fox said.", "zh": "我的生活极为单调，狐狸说。", "t": [138, 3325]}, {"en": "\"I hunt chickens; men hunt me.", "zh": "我捕猎鸡，人捕猎我。", "t": [3325, 5888]}, {"en": "All the chickens are just alike, and all the men are just alike.", "zh": "所有的鸡都长得一样，所有的人也都一样。", "t": [5888, 9800]}, {"en": "And, in consequence, I am a little bored.", "zh": "因此，我有些无聊。", "t": [9800, 13088]}, {"en": "But if you tame me, it will be as if the sun came to shine on my life.", "zh": "但若你驯服了我，就如同阳光照耀我的生命。", "t": [13088, 17550]}, {"en": "I shall know the sound of a step that will be different from all the others.", "zh": "我将能辨识出与众不同的脚步声。", "t": [17550, 21650]}, {"en": "Other steps send me hurrying back underneath the ground.", "zh": "其他脚步声让我匆忙钻回地下。", "t": [21650, 25250]}, {"en": "Yours will call me, like music, out of my burrow.", "zh": "你的脚步声，如同音乐，将把我从洞穴中唤醒。", "t": [25250, 28800]}, {"en": "And then look: you see the grain-fields down yonder?", "zh": "然后瞧：你看到那边的麦田了吗？", "t": [28800, 32250]}, {"en": "I do not eat bread.", "zh": "我不吃面包。", "t": [32250, 33912]}, {"en": "Wheat is of no use to me.", "zh": "麦子对我毫无用处。", "t": [33912, 35812]}, {"en": "The wheat fields have nothing to say to me.", "zh": "麦田对我默默无言。", "t": [35812, 38450]}, {"en": "And that is sad.", "zh": "这实在可悲！", "t": [38450, 39850]}, {"en": "But you have hair that is the colour of gold.", "zh": "你的头发是金色的。", "t": [39850, 42638]}, {"en": "Think how wonderful that will be when you have tamed me!", "zh": "想见你驯服我后的美好景象吧！", "t": [42638, 45925]}, {"en": "The grain, which is also golden, will bring me back the thought of you.", "zh": "麦子的金色会让我想起你。", "t": [45925, 50262]}, {"en": "And I shall love to listen to the wind in the wheat...\"", "zh": "我愿倾听麦田中风的低语……", "t": [50262, 52974]}]}, {"id": "ch21p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The fox gazed at the little prince, for a long time.", "zh": "狐狸久久地凝视着小王子。", "t": [138, 3263]}]}, {"id": "ch21p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Please-- tame me!\" he said.", "zh": "请——驯服我吧！", "t": [100, 1674]}]}, {"id": "ch21p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I want to, very much,\" the little prince replied.", "zh": "我非常愿意。", "t": [138, 3762]}, {"en": "\"But I have not much time.", "zh": "但我没有太多时间。", "t": [3762, 5725]}, {"en": "I have friends to discover, and a great many things to understand.\"", "zh": "我有朋友要结识，有许多事要理解。", "t": [5725, 9538]}]}, {"id": "ch21p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"One only understands the things that one tames,\" said the fox.", "zh": "驯服了的东西，人才懂得它的价值。", "t": [138, 4288]}, {"en": "\"Men have no more time to understand anything.", "zh": "人们不再有时间去理解任何事物。", "t": [4288, 7312]}, {"en": "They buy things all ready made at the shops.", "zh": "他们在商店里购买现成的东西。", "t": [7312, 10112]}, {"en": "But there is no shop anywhere where one can buy friendship, and so men have no friends any more.", "zh": "然而，世间并无店铺可售友谊，故人皆无友。", "t": [10112, 15612]}, {"en": "If you want a friend, tame me...\"", "zh": "若你愿与我结伴，驯服我吧……", "t": [15612, 17513]}]}, {"id": "ch21p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What must I do, to tame you?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "我该做些什么，才能驯服你？", "t": [125, 3613]}]}, {"id": "ch21p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You must be very patient,\" replied the fox.", "zh": "你必须非常耐心，狐狸回答道。", "t": [138, 3400]}, {"en": "\"First you will sit down at a little distance from me-- like that-- in the grass.", "zh": "首先，你将坐在离我一段距离的地方——就像这样——在草地上。", "t": [3400, 7912]}, {"en": "I shall look at you out of the corner of my eye, and you will say nothing.", "zh": "我斜眼瞥着你，你不必说一句话。", "t": [7912, 12162]}, {"en": "Words are the source of misunderstandings.", "zh": "言语是误会的根源。", "t": [12162, 15088]}, {"en": "But you will sit a little closer to me, every day...\"", "zh": "但你每天都要离我近一点……", "t": [15088, 18087]}]}, {"id": "ch21p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The next day the little prince came back.", "zh": "次日，小王子又来了。", "t": [138, 2450]}]}, {"id": "ch21p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It would have been better to come back at the same hour,\" said the fox.", "zh": "最好是同一时间回来，狐狸说。", "t": [138, 4075]}, {"en": "\"If, for example, you come at four o'clock in the afternoon, then at three o'clock I shall begin to be happy.", "zh": "若你下午四点钟来，那么从三点钟开始，我便开始感到幸福了。", "t": [4075, 10400]}, {"en": "I shall feel happier and happier as the hour advances.", "zh": "随着时光流逝，我的快乐将愈发浓烈。", "t": [10400, 14112]}, {"en": "At four o'clock, I shall already be worrying and jumping about.", "zh": "四点钟，我已开始焦虑不安，坐立难安。", "t": [14112, 18125]}, {"en": "I shall show you how happy I am!", "zh": "我将向你展示我是多么快乐！", "t": [18125, 20412]}, {"en": "But if you come at just any time, I shall never know at what hour my heart is to be ready to greet you...", "zh": "但如果你随时来访，我就永远不知道何时我的心该准备好迎接你……", "t": [20412, 26175]}, {"en": "One must observe the proper rites...\"", "zh": "必须遵守适当的仪式……", "t": [26175, 28350]}]}, {"id": "ch21p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is a rite?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "小王子问：“什么是仪式？”", "t": [138, 2750]}]}, {"id": "ch21p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Those also are actions too often neglected,\" said the fox.", "zh": "那些也是常被忽视的行为，狐狸说。", "t": [125, 4388]}, {"en": "\"They are what make one day different from other days, one hour from other hours.", "zh": "它们使一日不同于他日，一小时不同于其他小时。", "t": [4388, 9125]}, {"en": "There is a rite, for example, among my hunters.", "zh": "例如，我的猎人中有一种仪式。", "t": [9125, 12688]}, {"en": "Every Thursday they dance with the village girls.", "zh": "每周四，他们与村里的姑娘们共舞。", "t": [12688, 15762]}, {"en": "So Thursday is a wonderful day for me!", "zh": "星期四对我来说是个美好的日子！", "t": [15762, 18412]}, {"en": "I can take a walk as far as the vineyards.", "zh": "我可以一直走到葡萄园。", "t": [18412, 21175]}, {"en": "But if the hunters danced at just any time, every day would be like every other day, and I should never have any vacation at all.\"", "zh": "但若猎人随时跳舞，那么每一天都将如同其他日子，我便永远没有假期可言。", "t": [21175, 27962]}]}, {"id": "ch21p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So the little prince tamed the fox.", "zh": "小王子驯服了狐狸。", "t": [112, 2662]}, {"en": "And when the hour of his departure drew near--", "zh": "当离别的时刻临近——", "t": [2662, 5100]}]}, {"id": "ch21p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah,\" said the fox, \"I shall cry.\"", "zh": "啊，狐狸说，我要哭了。", "t": [125, 2525]}]}, {"id": "ch21p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is your own fault,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "是你的错，小王子说。", "t": [138, 3150]}, {"en": "\"I never wished you any sort of harm; but you wanted me to tame you...\"", "zh": "我从未希望给你带来伤害；但你却想让我驯服你……", "t": [3150, 7000]}]}, {"id": "ch21p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is so,\" said the fox.", "zh": "是的，是这样的，狐狸说。", "t": [112, 2574]}]}, {"id": "ch21p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But now you are going to cry!\" said the little prince.", "zh": "但你现在要哭了！小王子说。", "t": [100, 2938]}]}, {"id": "ch21p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is so,\" said the fox.", "zh": "是的，是这样的，狐狸说。", "t": [112, 2574]}]}, {"id": "ch21p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then it has done you no good at all!\"", "zh": "对你毫无益处。", "t": [125, 1988]}]}, {"id": "ch21p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It has done me good,\" said the fox, \"because of the colour of the wheat fields.\" And then he added:", "zh": "“它让我感到愉悦，”狐狸说，“因为麦田的颜色。”然后他又补充道：", "t": [138, 5926]}]}, {"id": "ch21p48", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Go and look again at the roses.", "zh": "再去看看那些玫瑰。", "t": [100, 2338]}, {"en": "You will understand now that yours is unique in all the world.", "zh": "你的玫瑰，在这世上独一无二。", "t": [2338, 6312]}, {"en": "Then come back to say goodbye to me, and I will make you a present of a secret.\"", "zh": "然后回来向我告别，我会送你一个秘密作为礼物。", "t": [6312, 10612]}]}, {"id": "ch21p49", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince went away, to look again at the roses.", "zh": "小王子离去，再次凝视着玫瑰。", "t": [138, 3400]}]}, {"id": "ch21p50", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are not at all like my rose,\" he said.", "zh": "你那朵玫瑰与我截然不同。", "t": [138, 3000]}, {"en": "\"As yet you are nothing.", "zh": "你尚无所有。", "t": [3000, 4712]}, {"en": "No one has tamed you, and you have tamed no one.", "zh": "无人驯服于你，你亦未驯服他人。", "t": [4712, 8075]}, {"en": "You are like my fox when I first knew him.", "zh": "你就像我最初遇见的那只狐狸。", "t": [8075, 10912]}, {"en": "He was only a fox like a hundred thousand other foxes.", "zh": "他只是一只和其他成千上万的狐狸一样的狐狸。", "t": [10912, 14500]}, {"en": "But I have made him my friend, and now he is unique in all the world.\"", "zh": "但他已成了我的朋友，现在他是这世上独一无二的。", "t": [14500, 18338]}]}, {"id": "ch21p51", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the roses were very much embarrassed.", "zh": "玫瑰们感到非常尴尬。", "t": [138, 2525]}]}, {"id": "ch21p52", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are beautiful, but you are empty,\" he went on.", "zh": "你美丽，却空洞无物。", "t": [138, 3712]}, {"en": "\"One could not die for you.", "zh": "人们不会为你而死。", "t": [3712, 5562]}, {"en": "To be sure, an ordinary passer-by would think that my rose looked just like you-- the rose that belongs to me.", "zh": "当然，一个普通的过路人会认为我的玫瑰和你的一样——那朵属于我的玫瑰。", "t": [5562, 11650]}, {"en": "But in herself alone she is more important than all the hundreds of you other roses: because it is she that I have watered; because it is she that I have put under the glass globe; because it is she that I have sheltered behind the screen; because it is for her that I have killed the caterpillars (except the two or three that we saved to become butterflies); because it is she that I have listened to, when she grumbled, or boasted, or even sometimes when she said nothing.", "zh": "然而，仅凭她自身，她比你们所有数百朵玫瑰都要重要：因为是我为她浇水；是我为她罩上玻璃罩；是我为她挡风遮雨；是我为她杀死了毛毛虫（除了我们留下变成蝴蝶的那两三只）；是我倾听她的抱怨，或她的自夸，有时甚至在她默默无言时。", "t": [11650, 36138]}, {"en": "Because she is my rose.", "zh": "因为她是我玫瑰。", "t": [36138, 37638]}]}, {"id": "ch21p53", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he went back to meet the fox.", "zh": "他回到狐狸那里。", "t": [138, 2026]}]}, {"id": "ch21p54", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" he said.", "zh": "再见，他说。", "t": [100, 1574]}]}, {"id": "ch21p55", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" said the fox.", "zh": "再见，狐狸说。", "t": [100, 2288]}, {"en": "\"And now here is my secret, a very simple secret: It is only with the heart that one can see rightly; what is essential is invisible to the eye.\"", "zh": "用心去看，才能看得真切；本质的东西，肉眼是看不见的。", "t": [2288, 10512]}]}, {"id": "ch21p56", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is essential is invisible to the eye,\" the little prince repeated, so that he would be sure to remember.", "zh": "本质的东西，肉眼难辨，小王子反复念诵，以便牢记于心。", "t": [125, 6075]}]}, {"id": "ch21p57", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is the time you have wasted for your rose that makes your rose so important.\"", "zh": "你为你的玫瑰浪费的时间，使你的玫瑰变得如此重要。", "t": [138, 4374]}]}, {"id": "ch21p58", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is the time I have wasted for my rose--\" said the little prince, so that he would be sure to remember.", "zh": "“我为我的玫瑰浪费的时间——”小王子说，以便确保自己能记住。", "t": [138, 5413]}]}, {"id": "ch21p59", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Men have forgotten this truth,\" said the fox.", "zh": "人们已遗忘这一真理，狐狸说。", "t": [112, 3275]}, {"en": "\"But you must not forget it.", "zh": "但你切莫忘记。", "t": [3275, 5362]}, {"en": "You become responsible, forever, for what you have tamed.", "zh": "你一旦驯服了什么，便永远对其负责。", "t": [5362, 9350]}, {"en": "You are responsible for your rose...\"", "zh": "你须对你的玫瑰负责……", "t": [9350, 11387]}]}, {"id": "ch21p60", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am responsible for my rose,\" the little prince repeated, so that he would be sure to remember.", "zh": "我为我的玫瑰负责，小王子反复说道，以便牢记于心。", "t": [138, 5475]}]}]}, {"id": "ch22", "title_en": "Chapter XXII", "title_zh": "第 22 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch22p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "早上好，小王子说。", "t": [112, 2312]}]}, {"id": "ch22p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the railway switchman.", "zh": "早上好，扳道工说。", "t": [100, 2513]}]}, {"id": "ch22p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What do you do here?\" the little prince asked.", "zh": "小王子问道：“你在此做什么？”", "t": [125, 2737]}]}, {"id": "ch22p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I sort out travellers, in bundles of a thousand,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "“我负责把旅客分成一千人一组的批次，”扳道工说。", "t": [138, 4588]}, {"en": "\"I send off the trains that carry them; now to the right, now to the left.\"", "zh": "我调度着载着他们的火车，时而向右，时而向左。", "t": [4588, 8888]}]}, {"id": "ch22p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And a brilliantly lighted express train shook the switchman's cabin as it rushed by with a roar like thunder.", "zh": "一列灯火通明的快车如雷霆般轰鸣而过，震得扳道工的小屋摇摇欲坠。", "t": [138, 5962]}]}, {"id": "ch22p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"They are in a great hurry,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "他们匆匆忙忙，小王子说。", "t": [125, 3212]}, {"en": "\"What are they looking for?\"", "zh": "他们在寻找什么？", "t": [3212, 4563]}]}, {"id": "ch22p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Not even the locomotive engineer knows that,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "连火车头上的司机也弄不清楚，”扳道工说。", "t": [125, 3788]}]}, {"id": "ch22p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And a second brilliantly lighted express thundered by, in the opposite direction.", "zh": "第二列灯火通明的快车在相反方向呼啸而过。", "t": [125, 4813]}]}, {"id": "ch22p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Are they coming back already?\" demanded the little prince.", "zh": "他们已经回来了吗？小王子问道。", "t": [138, 3388]}]}, {"id": "ch22p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"These are not the same ones,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "这不是同一批人，扳道工说。", "t": [125, 3100]}, {"en": "\"It is an exchange.\"", "zh": "这是对开的火车。", "t": [3100, 4325]}]}, {"id": "ch22p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Were they not satisfied where they were?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "他们对自己的居住地不满意吗？小王子问道。", "t": [138, 3776]}]}, {"id": "ch22p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No one is ever satisfied where he is,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "他总觉得自己所在的地方不尽人意，扳道工说。", "t": [125, 3500]}]}, {"id": "ch22p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And they heard the roaring thunder of a third brilliantly lighted express.", "zh": "又有一列灯火通明的快车如雷鸣般轰鸣而过。", "t": [138, 4124]}]}, {"id": "ch22p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Are they pursuing the first travellers?\" demanded the little prince.", "zh": "他们是在追赶第一批旅客吗？小王子质问道。", "t": [138, 3913]}]}, {"id": "ch22p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"They are pursuing nothing at all,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "他们根本无所追寻，扳道工说。", "t": [138, 3375]}, {"en": "\"They are asleep in there, or if they are not asleep they are yawning.", "zh": "他们在车厢里昏昏欲睡，或者若非沉睡，便在打哈欠。", "t": [3375, 7125]}, {"en": "Only the children are flattening their noses against the windowpanes.\"", "zh": "只有孩子们才把鼻子贴在窗玻璃上。", "t": [7125, 10963]}]}, {"id": "ch22p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Only the children know what they are looking for,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "只有孩子知道他们在寻找什么，小王子说。", "t": [112, 4200]}, {"en": "\"They waste their time over a rag doll and it becomes very important to them; and if anybody takes it away from them, they cry...\"", "zh": "他们把时间浪费在布娃娃身上，那对它们来说变得极其重要；要是有人把它夺走，他们就会哭鼻子……", "t": [4200, 11200]}]}, {"id": "ch22p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"They are lucky,\" the switchman said.", "zh": "他们是幸运的，扳道工说。", "t": [138, 2213]}]}]}, {"id": "ch23", "title_en": "Chapter XXIII", "title_zh": "第 23 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch23p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "早上好，小王子说。", "t": [112, 2312]}]}, {"id": "ch23p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the merchant.", "zh": "早上好，商人说。", "t": [100, 2500]}, {"en": "This was a merchant who sold pills that had been invented to quench thirst.", "zh": "这是一位售卖解渴药丸的商人。", "t": [2500, 6962]}, {"en": "You need only swallow one pill a week, and you would feel no need of anything to drink.", "zh": "只需每周吞下一颗药丸，便无需再饮任何东西。", "t": [6962, 11476]}]}, {"id": "ch23p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why are you selling those?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "“你为何卖这种药？”小王子问道。", "t": [125, 3063]}]}, {"id": "ch23p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because they save a tremendous amount of time,\" said the merchant.", "zh": "“因为这样可以节省大量时间，”商人说。", "t": [100, 4125]}, {"en": "\"Computations have been made by experts.", "zh": "专家们已做过计算。", "t": [4125, 7238]}, {"en": "With these pills, you save fifty-three minutes in every week.\"", "zh": "每周，这些药丸能为你节省五十三分钟。", "t": [7238, 10913]}]}, {"id": "ch23p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what do I do with those fifty-three minutes?\"", "zh": "我该如何利用这五十三分钟？", "t": [112, 2712]}]}, {"id": "ch23p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Anything you like...\"", "zh": "你喜欢做什么……", "t": [100, 1300]}]}, {"id": "ch23p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"As for me,\" said the little prince to himself, \"if I had fifty-three minutes to spend as I liked, I should walk at my leisure toward a spring of fresh water.\"", "zh": "“至于我，”小王子自言自语道，“若我有五十三分钟可以随心所欲地度过，我便悠然地向一泓清泉走去。”", "t": [138, 8512]}]}]}, {"id": "ch24", "title_en": "Chapter XXIV", "title_zh": "第 24 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch24p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It was now the eighth day since I had had my accident in the desert, and I had listened to the story of the merchant as I was drinking the last drop of my water supply.", "zh": "沙漠中我的飞机失事已第八天，我边听商人的故事边饮尽了我最后一滴水。", "t": [138, 8713]}]}, {"id": "ch24p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah,\" I said to the little prince, \"these memories of yours are very charming; but I have not yet succeeded in repairing my plane; I have nothing more to drink; and I, too, should be very happy if I could walk at my leisure toward a spring of fresh water!\"", "zh": "“啊，”我对小王子说，“你的这些回忆真是迷人；不过，我的飞机还没修好，水也喝光了；若能悠闲地走向一汪清泉，我也会很快乐的！”", "t": [125, 13663]}]}, {"id": "ch24p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My friend the fox--\" the little prince said to me.", "zh": "我的朋友狐狸——小王子对我说。", "t": [138, 2662]}]}, {"id": "ch24p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My dear little man, this is no longer a matter that has anything to do with the fox!\"", "zh": "亲爱的孩子，这已与狐狸无关了！", "t": [112, 4825]}]}, {"id": "ch24p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why not?\"", "zh": "为何不可？", "t": [112, 850]}]}, {"id": "ch24p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because I am about to die of thirst...\"", "zh": "因为我即将渴死……", "t": [100, 2237]}]}, {"id": "ch24p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He did not follow my reasoning, and he answered me:", "zh": "他并未理解我的话，却回答道：", "t": [138, 2950]}]}, {"id": "ch24p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is a good thing to have had a friend, even if one is about to die.", "zh": "有了一位朋友，即便是在命悬一线之际，也是一件好事。", "t": [138, 4238]}, {"en": "I, for instance, am very glad to have had a fox as a friend...\"", "zh": "我很高兴能有一位狐狸作为朋友……", "t": [4238, 8175]}]}, {"id": "ch24p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"He has no way of guessing the danger,\" I said to myself.", "zh": "他无法想象危险的严重。", "t": [138, 3850]}, {"en": "\"He has never been either hungry or thirsty.", "zh": "他从未尝过饥饿或口渴的滋味。", "t": [3850, 6650]}, {"en": "A little sunshine is all he needs...\"", "zh": "他只需一点阳光便足矣……", "t": [6650, 8875]}]}, {"id": "ch24p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he looked at me steadily, and replied to my thought:", "zh": "他凝视着我，对我的想法回应道：", "t": [100, 3250]}]}, {"id": "ch24p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am thirsty, too.", "zh": "我也渴了……", "t": [100, 2138]}, {"en": "Let us look for a well...\"", "zh": "让我们去找一口井……", "t": [2138, 3637]}]}, {"id": "ch24p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I made a gesture of weariness.", "zh": "我打了个倦怠的手势。", "t": [138, 2462]}, {"en": "It is absurd to look for a well, at random, in the immensity of the desert.", "zh": "在沙漠的浩瀚中随意寻找一口井，实在荒谬至极。", "t": [2462, 7162]}, {"en": "But nevertheless we started walking.", "zh": "然而，我们还是出发了。", "t": [7162, 9350]}]}, {"id": "ch24p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When we had trudged along for several hours, in silence, the darkness fell, and the stars began to come out.", "zh": "我们默默前行数小时，夜幕降临，星辰渐次闪烁。", "t": [138, 6838]}, {"en": "Thirst had made me a little feverish, and I looked at them as if I were in a dream.", "zh": "干渴让我微微发烧，我望着它们，仿佛置身梦境。", "t": [6838, 11675]}, {"en": "The little prince's last words came reeling back into my memory:", "zh": "小王子的最后几句话如潮水般涌回我的记忆：", "t": [11675, 15325]}]}, {"id": "ch24p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then you are thirsty, too?\" I demanded.", "zh": "你也渴了吗？我追问。", "t": [125, 3250]}]}, {"id": "ch24p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he did not reply to my question.", "zh": "但他并未回答我的问题。", "t": [100, 2650]}, {"en": "He merely said to me:", "zh": "他只是对我说：", "t": [2650, 3900]}]}, {"id": "ch24p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Water may also be good for the heart...\"", "zh": "水对心灵亦有益……", "t": [125, 2412]}]}, {"id": "ch24p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not understand this answer, but I said nothing.", "zh": "我不解其意，却缄口不言。", "t": [138, 3700]}, {"en": "I knew very well that it was impossible to cross-examine him.", "zh": "我深知无法对他进行质询。", "t": [3700, 7126]}]}, {"id": "ch24p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was tired.", "zh": "他疲惫不堪。", "t": [138, 1512]}, {"en": "He sat down.", "zh": "他坐了下来。", "t": [1512, 2888]}, {"en": "I sat down beside him.", "zh": "我坐在他身边。", "t": [2888, 4850]}, {"en": "And, after a little silence, he spoke again: \"The stars are beautiful, because of a flower that cannot be seen.\"", "zh": "星星之所以美丽，是因为有一朵看不见的花。", "t": [4850, 11424]}]}, {"id": "ch24p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I replied, \"Yes, that is so.\" And, without saying anything more, I looked across the ridges of sand that were stretched out before us in the moonlight.", "zh": "我答道：“没错，正是如此。”然后默默无言，凝视着月光下绵延的沙丘。", "t": [138, 9300]}]}, {"id": "ch24p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The desert is beautiful,\" the little prince added.", "zh": "沙漠真美，小王子补充道。", "t": [138, 3112]}]}, {"id": "ch24p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And that was true.", "zh": "这倒是真的。", "t": [112, 1625]}, {"en": "I have always loved the desert.", "zh": "沙漠，我始终钟爱。", "t": [1625, 3862]}, {"en": "One sits down on a desert sand dune, sees nothing, hears nothing.", "zh": "坐在沙漠沙丘上，无所见，无所闻。", "t": [3862, 8475]}, {"en": "Yet through the silence something throbs, and gleams...", "zh": "寂静中，有何物跳动，闪烁……", "t": [8475, 11712]}]}, {"id": "ch24p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What makes the desert beautiful,\" said the little prince, \"is that somewhere it hides a well...\"", "zh": "沙漠之所以美丽，是因为它某个角落隐藏着一口井。", "t": [125, 5200]}]}, {"id": "ch24p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I was astonished by a sudden understanding of that mysterious radiation of the sands.", "zh": "我猛然领悟到沙漠那神秘闪烁的奥秘。", "t": [138, 5562]}, {"en": "When I was a little boy I lived in an old house, and legend told us that a treasure was buried there.", "zh": "我年幼时曾住在一座古老的大屋中，传说那里埋藏着一笔宝藏。", "t": [5562, 11375]}, {"en": "To be sure, no one had ever known how to find it; perhaps no one had ever even looked for it.", "zh": "确实，无人知晓如何找到它；或许无人曾试图寻找过。", "t": [11375, 17088]}, {"en": "But it cast an enchantment over that house.", "zh": "但那座房子被施了魔法。", "t": [17088, 20050]}, {"en": "My home was hiding a secret in the depths of its heart...", "zh": "我的家在心底深处藏着一个秘密……", "t": [20050, 23362]}]}, {"id": "ch24p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes,\" I said to the little prince.", "zh": "“是的，”我对小王子说。", "t": [138, 2775]}, {"en": "\"The house, the stars, the desert-- what gives them their beauty is something that is invisible!\"", "zh": "房子、星星、沙漠——赋予它们美丽的是肉眼无法看见的东西。", "t": [2775, 8013]}]}, {"id": "ch24p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am glad,\" he said, \"that you agree with my fox.\"", "zh": "他笑着说：“很高兴，你赞同我的狐狸。”", "t": [138, 3387]}]}, {"id": "ch24p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As the little prince dropped off to sleep, I took him in my arms and set out walking once more.", "zh": "小王子入睡，我把他抱在怀里，再次踏上了旅程。", "t": [138, 5700]}, {"en": "I felt deeply moved, and stirred.", "zh": "内心深受触动，波澜起伏。", "t": [5700, 8388]}, {"en": "It seemed to me that I was carrying a very fragile treasure.", "zh": "我仿佛抱着一件极其脆弱的珍宝。", "t": [8388, 12100]}, {"en": "It seemed to me, even, that there was nothing more fragile on all Earth.", "zh": "在这片大地上，似乎再无比他更脆弱之物。", "t": [12100, 16600]}, {"en": "In the moonlight I looked at his pale forehead, his closed eyes, his locks of hair that trembled in the wind, and I said to myself: \"What I see here is nothing but a shell.", "zh": "在这月光下，我凝视着他苍白的额头、紧闭的双眼、随风轻颤的鬈发，心中自语道：“我所看到的，不过是一具躯壳。”", "t": [16600, 26550]}, {"en": "What is most important is invisible...\"", "zh": "最重要的，是肉眼看不见的……", "t": [26550, 28950]}]}, {"id": "ch24p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As his lips opened slightly with the suspicious of a half-smile, I said to myself, again: \"What moves me so deeply, about this little prince who is sleeping here, is his loyalty to a flower-- the image of a rose that shines through his whole being like the flame of a lamp, even when he is asleep...\" And I felt him to be more fragile still.", "zh": "在这半张的嘴唇上，带着一丝怀疑的微笑微微张开，我再次对自己说：“打动我的，正是这位在此沉睡的小王子对一朵花的忠诚——玫瑰的影像在他整个生命中如灯焰般闪耀，即便在他入睡时……”我愈发觉得他显得更加脆弱。", "t": [100, 18888]}, {"en": "I felt the need of protecting him, as if he himself were a flame that might be extinguished by a little puff of wind...", "zh": "我感到需要保护他，仿佛他自身就是一丝微风就能吹灭的火焰……", "t": [18888, 25187]}]}, {"id": "ch24p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, as I walked on so, I found the well, at daybreak.", "zh": "曙光初露，我找到了那口井。", "t": [112, 4026]}]}]}, {"id": "ch25", "title_en": "Chapter XXV", "title_zh": "第 25 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch25p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Men,\" said the little prince, \"set out on their way in express trains, but they do not know what they are looking for.", "zh": "人们踏上旅程，乘坐快车，却不知他们在寻找什么。", "t": [125, 6688]}, {"en": "Then they rush about, and get excited, and turn round and round...\"", "zh": "他们忙乱地四处奔走，激动不已，团团打转……", "t": [6688, 10712]}]}, {"id": "ch25p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he added: \"It is not worth the trouble...\"", "zh": "他接着说：“这番忙碌实在不值得。”", "t": [112, 2625]}]}, {"id": "ch25p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The well that we had come to was not like the wells of the Sahara.", "zh": "我们找到的井与撒哈拉沙漠的井大不相同。", "t": [125, 4038]}, {"en": "The wells of the Sahara are mere holes dug in the sand.", "zh": "撒哈拉之井，不过是沙中浅洞。", "t": [4038, 7525]}, {"en": "This one was like a well in a village.", "zh": "这口井宛如村中的井。", "t": [7525, 10012]}, {"en": "But there was no village here, and I thought I must be dreaming...", "zh": "然而此处并无村落，我疑心自己是在梦中。", "t": [10012, 13400]}]}, {"id": "ch25p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is strange,\" I said to the little prince.", "zh": "这真奇怪，我对小王子说。", "t": [138, 3075]}, {"en": "\"Everything is ready for use: the pulley, the bucket, the rope...\"", "zh": "一切用具俱备：辘轳、水桶、绳子……", "t": [3075, 7175]}]}, {"id": "ch25p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He laughed, touched the rope, and set the pulley to working.", "zh": "他笑着，轻触绳索，启动了辘轳。", "t": [138, 4138]}, {"en": "And the pulley moaned, like an old weathervane, which the wind has long since forgotten.", "zh": "辘轳哀鸣，宛如久被遗忘的老风信鸡。", "t": [4138, 8812]}]}, {"id": "ch25p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do you hear?\" said the little prince.", "zh": "你听，小王子说。", "t": [138, 2812]}, {"en": "\"We have wakened the well, and it is singing...\"", "zh": "我们唤醒了这口井，它正在歌唱……", "t": [2812, 5326]}]}, {"id": "ch25p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not want him to tire himself with the rope.", "zh": "我不愿他因拉绳而劳累。", "t": [138, 2850]}]}, {"id": "ch25p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Leave it to me,\" I said.", "zh": "让我来吧。", "t": [112, 2188]}, {"en": "\"It is too heavy for you.\"", "zh": "这份工作对你来说太沉重了。", "t": [2188, 3724]}]}, {"id": "ch25p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I hoisted the bucket slowly to the edge of the well and set it there-- happy, tired as I was, over my achievement.", "zh": "我缓缓将水桶提到井边，放置其间——尽管疲惫，但为我的成就而喜悦。", "t": [138, 6938]}, {"en": "The song of the pulley was still in my ears, and I could see the sunlight shimmer in the still trembling water.", "zh": "辘轳之歌仍在耳畔回响，我看见阳光在静止摇曳的水面闪烁。", "t": [6938, 12713]}]}, {"id": "ch25p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am thirsty for this water,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "我渴望的就是这样的水，小王子说。", "t": [138, 3600]}, {"en": "\"Give me some of it to drink...\"", "zh": "让我喝上几口……", "t": [3600, 5263]}]}, {"id": "ch25p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And I understood what he had been looking for.", "zh": "我明白了他在寻找什么。", "t": [138, 2463]}]}, {"id": "ch25p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I raised the bucket to his lips.", "zh": "我举桶至他唇边。", "t": [138, 2488]}, {"en": "He drank, his eyes closed.", "zh": "他闭目啜饮。", "t": [2488, 4838]}, {"en": "It was as sweet as some special festival treat.", "zh": "宛如节日佳肴般甘甜。", "t": [4838, 8150]}, {"en": "This water was indeed a different thing from ordinary nourishment.", "zh": "这水确是不同于寻常的滋养。", "t": [8150, 12375]}, {"en": "Its sweetness was born of the walk under the stars, the song of the pulley, and the effort of my arms.", "zh": "星光下的漫步、辘轳的歌声与我的臂力，孕育了这水的甘甜。", "t": [12375, 18412]}, {"en": "It was good for the heart, like a present.", "zh": "宛如礼物，温暖了心房。", "t": [18412, 21275]}, {"en": "When I was a little boy, the lights of the Christmas tree, the music of the Midnight Mass, the tenderness of smiling faces, used to make up, so, the radiance of the gifts I received.", "zh": "儿时，圣诞树上的灯光、子夜弥撒的乐音、微笑脸庞的温柔，构成了我所收到的礼物的光辉。", "t": [21275, 31800]}]}, {"id": "ch25p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The men where you live,\" said the little prince, \"raise five thousand roses in the same garden-- and they do not find in it what they are looking for.\"", "zh": "“你们那里的男人，”小王子说，“在同一花园里培育了五千朵玫瑰——却在那里找不到他们所寻找的东西。”", "t": [138, 7500]}]}, {"id": "ch25p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"They do not find it,\" I replied.", "zh": "他们并未找到。", "t": [138, 2250]}]}, {"id": "ch25p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And yet what they are looking for could be found in one single rose, or in a little water.\"", "zh": "在一朵玫瑰或一滴水中，他们所寻之物便可觅得。", "t": [138, 5124]}]}, {"id": "ch25p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is true,\" I said.", "zh": "是的，这确实如此。", "t": [112, 2337]}]}, {"id": "ch25p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince added:", "zh": "小王子又补充道：", "t": [138, 1750]}]}, {"id": "ch25p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But the eyes are blind.", "zh": "但眼睛是盲的。", "t": [100, 1925]}, {"en": "One must look with the heart...\"", "zh": "必须用心去看……", "t": [1925, 3600]}]}, {"id": "ch25p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I had drunk the water.", "zh": "我饮了这水。", "t": [138, 1925]}, {"en": "I breathed easily.", "zh": "呼吸顺畅了。", "t": [1925, 3525]}, {"en": "At sunrise the sand is the colour of honey.", "zh": "日出时分，沙地泛着蜜色。", "t": [3525, 6400]}, {"en": "And that honey colour was making me happy, too.", "zh": "这蜜色也让我心情愉悦。", "t": [6400, 9675]}, {"en": "What brought me, then, this sense of grief?", "zh": "那又是什么，让我心生哀愁？", "t": [9675, 12413]}]}, {"id": "ch25p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You must keep your promise,\" said the little prince, softly, as he sat down beside me once more.", "zh": "你务必遵守诺言，小王子轻声说，再次坐到我身边。", "t": [138, 5863]}]}, {"id": "ch25p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What promise?\"", "zh": "什么诺言？", "t": [112, 1075]}]}, {"id": "ch25p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know-- a muzzle for my sheep...", "zh": "你知道——给我的绵羊画一个口罩……", "t": [138, 2288]}, {"en": "I am responsible for this flower...\"", "zh": "我负责这朵花……", "t": [2288, 4300]}]}, {"id": "ch25p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I took my rough drafts of drawings out of my pocket.", "zh": "我从口袋里掏出草图。", "t": [138, 3662]}, {"en": "The little prince looked them over, and laughed as he said:", "zh": "小王子打量了一番，笑着说：", "t": [3662, 6863]}]}, {"id": "ch25p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Your baobabs-- they look a little like cabbages.\"", "zh": "你的猴面包树——它们有点像卷心菜。", "t": [138, 2662]}]}, {"id": "ch25p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!\"", "zh": "哦！", "t": [100, 412]}]}, {"id": "ch25p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I had been so proud of my baobabs!", "zh": "我对自己画的猴面包树颇为自豪！", "t": [138, 2262]}]}, {"id": "ch25p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Your fox-- his ears look a little like horns; and they are too long.\"", "zh": "你的狐狸——它的耳朵有点像角，而且太长了。", "t": [138, 3788]}]}, {"id": "ch25p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he laughed again.", "zh": "他又笑了。", "t": [138, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch25p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are not fair, little prince,\" I said.", "zh": "你这不公平，小王子，我说。", "t": [138, 3200]}, {"en": "\"I don't know how to draw anything except boa constrictors from the outside and boa constrictors from the inside.\"", "zh": "我只懂得画外部的蟒蛇和内部的蟒蛇。", "t": [3200, 9287]}]}, {"id": "ch25p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, that will be all right,\" he said, \"children understand.\"", "zh": "哦，那没关系，他说，孩子们会理解的。", "t": [125, 3962]}]}, {"id": "ch25p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then I made a pencil sketch of a muzzle.", "zh": "于是，我画了一张绵羊口罩的铅笔草图。", "t": [125, 2912]}, {"en": "And as I gave it to him my heart was torn.", "zh": "我的心在交付给他时撕裂了。", "t": [2912, 5388]}]}, {"id": "ch25p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You have plans that I do not know about,\" I said.", "zh": "你有所图，我却不晓。", "t": [138, 3124]}]}, {"id": "ch25p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he did not answer me.", "zh": "但他没有回答我。", "t": [100, 1875]}, {"en": "He said to me, instead:", "zh": "他转而对我说：", "t": [1875, 3600]}]}, {"id": "ch25p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know-- my descent to the earth...", "zh": "你知道——我降临到地球……", "t": [138, 2362]}, {"en": "Tomorrow will be its anniversary.\"", "zh": "明天就是它的周年纪念日。", "t": [2362, 4313]}]}, {"id": "ch25p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then, after a silence, he went on:", "zh": "然后，沉默片刻，他又继续说道：", "t": [125, 2776]}]}, {"id": "ch25p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I came down very near here.\"", "zh": "我降落得离这里很近。", "t": [138, 1900]}]}, {"id": "ch25p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he flushed.", "zh": "他的脸泛起了红晕。", "t": [138, 1088]}]}, {"id": "ch25p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And once again, without understanding why, I had a queer sense of sorrow.", "zh": "又不知为何，我心中涌起一股莫名的哀愁。", "t": [138, 4975]}, {"en": "One question, however, occurred to me:", "zh": "然而，一个问题浮现在我的脑海中：", "t": [4975, 7588]}]}, {"id": "ch25p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then it was not by chance that on the morning when I first met you-- a week ago-- you were strolling along like that, all alone, a thousand miles from any inhabited region?", "zh": "那天早上，我们初次相遇——一周前——你独自一人，在这远离人烟的沙漠中漫步，这并非偶然？", "t": [125, 9250]}, {"en": "You were on the your back to the place where you landed?\"", "zh": "你正背对着你的降落点走去？", "t": [9250, 11926]}]}, {"id": "ch25p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince flushed again.", "zh": "小王子再次涨红了脸。", "t": [138, 1850]}]}, {"id": "ch25p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And I added, with some hesitancy:", "zh": "我带着几分犹豫，补充道：", "t": [112, 2388]}]}, {"id": "ch25p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Perhaps it was because of the anniversary?\"", "zh": "或许是因为周年纪念吧？", "t": [100, 2500]}]}, {"id": "ch25p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince flushed once more.", "zh": "小王子脸颊再次泛红。", "t": [138, 2500]}, {"en": "He never answered questions-- but when one flushes does that not mean \"Yes\"?", "zh": "他从不回答问题——但一个人脸红，难道不是就意味着“是”吗？", "t": [2500, 6600]}]}, {"id": "ch25p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah,\" I said to him, \"I am a little frightened--\"", "zh": "“啊，”我对他说，“我有点害怕——”", "t": [138, 3087]}]}, {"id": "ch25p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he interrupted me.", "zh": "他打断了我。", "t": [100, 1475]}]}, {"id": "ch25p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Now you must work.", "zh": "现在你必须工作了。", "t": [125, 1762]}, {"en": "You must return to your engine.", "zh": "你必须回到你的引擎旁。", "t": [1762, 3900]}, {"en": "I will be waiting for you here.", "zh": "我在这儿等你。", "t": [3900, 6012]}, {"en": "Come back tomorrow evening...\"", "zh": "明天晚上再来……", "t": [6012, 7687]}]}, {"id": "ch25p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But I was not reassured.", "zh": "但我并未感到安心。", "t": [100, 2112]}, {"en": "I remembered the fox.", "zh": "我记起了那只狐狸。", "t": [2112, 3938]}, {"en": "One runs the risk of weeping a little, if one lets himself be tamed...", "zh": "若有人让自己被驯服，难免会流下几滴泪……", "t": [3938, 8037]}]}]}, {"id": "ch26", "title_en": "Chapter XXVI", "title_zh": "第 26 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch26p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Beside the well there was the ruin of an old stonewall.", "zh": "井边，一堵古老的石墙残垣断壁。", "t": [138, 3600]}, {"en": "When I came back from my work, the next evening, I saw from some distance away my little price sitting on top of a wall, with his feet dangling.", "zh": "当晚我下班归来，远远望见小王子坐在断壁之上，双脚悬空。", "t": [3600, 11962]}, {"en": "And I heard him say:", "zh": "我听见他这么说：", "t": [11962, 13225]}]}, {"id": "ch26p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then you don't remember.", "zh": "那么，你不记得了。", "t": [138, 1862]}, {"en": "This is not the exact spot.\"", "zh": "这不是确切的地方。", "t": [1862, 3637]}]}, {"id": "ch26p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Another voice must have answered him, for he replied to it:", "zh": "另一个声音定然回应了他，因为他对此反驳道：", "t": [112, 3413]}]}, {"id": "ch26p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, yes!", "zh": "没错！没错！", "t": [100, 1588]}, {"en": "It is the right day, but this is not the place.\"", "zh": "正是这一天，但不是这个地方。", "t": [1588, 4325]}]}, {"id": "ch26p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I continued my walk toward the wall.", "zh": "我继续朝墙走去。", "t": [138, 2762]}, {"en": "At no time did I see or hear anyone.", "zh": "我从未见过或听到过任何人。", "t": [2762, 5600]}, {"en": "The little prince, however, replied once again:", "zh": "小王子却再次反驳道：", "t": [5600, 8738]}]}, {"id": "ch26p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"--Exactly.", "zh": "没错。", "t": [100, 1350]}, {"en": "You will see where my track begins, in the sand.", "zh": "你将看到我的足迹在沙地上起始之处。", "t": [1350, 4650]}, {"en": "You have nothing to do but wait for me there.", "zh": "你只需在那里等我。", "t": [4650, 7300]}, {"en": "I shall be there tonight.\"", "zh": "今夜我会在那儿等你。", "t": [7300, 8775]}]}, {"id": "ch26p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I was only twenty metres from the wall, and I still saw nothing.", "zh": "我离墙仅有二十米，却仍一无所见。", "t": [138, 3776]}]}, {"id": "ch26p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After a silence the little prince spoke again:", "zh": "沉默片刻后，小王子又开口了。", "t": [138, 2826]}]}, {"id": "ch26p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You have good poison?", "zh": "你有毒药吗？", "t": [138, 1812]}, {"en": "You are sure that it will not make me suffer too long?\"", "zh": "你能否肯定不会让我遭受太久痛苦？", "t": [1812, 4637]}]}, {"id": "ch26p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I stopped in my tracks, my heart torn asunder; but still I did not understand.", "zh": "我止步不前，心碎如裂；然而我依旧不解。", "t": [138, 5150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Now go away,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "现在你走吧，小王子说。", "t": [125, 2875]}, {"en": "\"I want to get down from the wall.\"", "zh": "我想要从墙上下来。", "t": [2875, 4674]}]}, {"id": "ch26p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I dropped my eyes, then, to the foot of the wall-- and I leaped into the air.", "zh": "我低头看向墙脚——然后纵身跃起。", "t": [138, 4850]}, {"en": "There before me, facing the little prince, was one of those yellow snakes that take just thirty seconds to bring your life to an end.", "zh": "黄蛇昂首面对小王子，这种蛇只需三十秒就能夺走人的生命。", "t": [4850, 12300]}, {"en": "Even as I was digging into my pocked to get out my revolver I made a running step back.", "zh": "我掏枪入袋，同时快步后退。", "t": [12300, 17625]}, {"en": "But, at the noise I made, the snake let himself flow easily across the sand like the dying spray of a fountain, and, in no apparent hurry, disappeared, with a light metallic sound, among the stones.", "zh": "但在我制造的噪音中，那条蛇像喷泉般垂死的喷泉一样，在沙地上轻松地流淌，不慌不忙地消失在石头之间，发出轻微的金属声响。", "t": [17625, 29337]}]}, {"id": "ch26p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I reached the wall just in time to catch my little man in my arms; his face was white as snow.", "zh": "我及时赶到，将他小小的身躯紧紧抱在怀中，他的脸庞白得如雪。", "t": [138, 5562]}]}, {"id": "ch26p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What does this mean?\" I demanded.", "zh": "我追问：“这是什么意思？”", "t": [138, 2988]}, {"en": "\"Why are you talking with snakes?\"", "zh": "你为何与蛇交谈？", "t": [2988, 4724]}]}, {"id": "ch26p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I had loosened the golden muffler that he always wore.", "zh": "我解开了他始终佩戴的金色围巾。", "t": [138, 3538]}, {"en": "I had moistened his temples, and had given him some water to drink.", "zh": "我湿润了他的太阳穴，并给他喝了一些水。", "t": [3538, 7838]}, {"en": "And now I did not dare ask him any more questions.", "zh": "我再也不敢问他更多问题了。", "t": [7838, 11238]}, {"en": "He looked at me very gravely, and put his arms around my neck.", "zh": "他严肃地望着我，将双臂环抱住我的脖子。", "t": [11238, 15338]}, {"en": "I felt his heart beating like the heart of a dying bird, shot with someone's rifle...", "zh": "他的心跳如中枪濒死的小鸟般急促。", "t": [15338, 20125]}]}, {"id": "ch26p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am glad that you have found what was the matter with your engine,\" he said.", "zh": "他高兴地说：“你找到了飞机的问题，我很欣慰。”", "t": [138, 4512]}, {"en": "\"Now you can go back home--\"", "zh": "现在你可以回家了——", "t": [4512, 6000]}]}, {"id": "ch26p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"How do you know about that?\"", "zh": "你怎会知道那事？", "t": [125, 1550]}]}, {"id": "ch26p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I was just coming to tell him that my work had been successful, beyond anything that I had dared to hope.", "zh": "我正要告诉他，我的工作已经成功，超出了我敢想象的任何程度。", "t": [138, 5750]}]}, {"id": "ch26p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He made no answer to my question, but he added: \"I, too, am going back home today...\"", "zh": "他未对我的问题作答，却补充道：“我也要回家去了……”", "t": [125, 5463]}]}, {"id": "ch26p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then, sadly-- \"It is much farther...", "zh": "那时，他黯然神伤地说：“那还要远得多……”", "t": [100, 2538]}, {"en": "it is much more difficult...\"", "zh": "这还更加艰难……", "t": [2538, 3976]}]}, {"id": "ch26p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I realised clearly that something extraordinary was happening.", "zh": "我明白，这绝非寻常之事。", "t": [138, 3988]}, {"en": "I was holding him close in my arms as if he were a little child; and yet it seemed to me that he was rushing headlong toward an abyss from which I could do nothing to restrain him...", "zh": "我紧紧地抱住他，如同抱住一个小孩；然而，我感觉他正一头冲向深渊，而我却无法阻止他……", "t": [3988, 12850]}]}, {"id": "ch26p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "His look was very serious, like some one lost far away.", "zh": "他的目光非常严肃，仿佛迷失在遥远之地。", "t": [138, 3687]}]}, {"id": "ch26p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have your sheep.", "zh": "我有你的绵羊。", "t": [125, 1588]}, {"en": "And I have the sheep's box.", "zh": "我有羊的箱子。", "t": [1588, 3575]}, {"en": "And I have the muzzle...\"", "zh": "我还有它的口罩……", "t": [3575, 4824]}]}, {"id": "ch26p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he gave me a sad smile.", "zh": "他凄然一笑。", "t": [138, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch26p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I waited a long time.", "zh": "我等待了许久。", "t": [138, 1925]}, {"en": "I could see that he was reviving little by little.", "zh": "他渐渐恢复了生机。", "t": [1925, 4725]}]}, {"id": "ch26p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Dear little man,\" I said to him, \"you are afraid...\"", "zh": "亲爱的孩子，我说道，“你害怕了……”", "t": [112, 3237]}]}, {"id": "ch26p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was afraid, there was no doubt about that.", "zh": "他害怕，这毫无疑问。", "t": [138, 3212]}, {"en": "But he laughed lightly.", "zh": "他轻轻地笑了。", "t": [3212, 4487]}]}, {"id": "ch26p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall be much more afraid this evening...\"", "zh": "今夜我会更加害怕……", "t": [138, 2350]}]}, {"id": "ch26p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Once again I felt myself frozen by the sense of something irreparable.", "zh": "我又一次被那无法挽回的感觉冻结了。", "t": [138, 4638]}, {"en": "And I knew that I could not bear the thought of never hearing that laughter any more.", "zh": "我无法忍受再想永远听不到那笑声。", "t": [4638, 9038]}, {"en": "For me, it was like a spring of fresh water in the desert.", "zh": "沙漠中的一股清泉。", "t": [9038, 12450]}]}, {"id": "ch26p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Little man,\" I said, \"I want to hear you laugh again.\"", "zh": "小家伙，我想再听到你的笑声。", "t": [138, 3288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he said to me:", "zh": "他对我说：", "t": [100, 1162]}]}, {"id": "ch26p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Tonight, it will be a year...", "zh": "今夜，它将是一周年……", "t": [100, 2000]}, {"en": "my star, then, can be found right above the place where I came to the Earth, a year ago...\"", "zh": "我的星星，现在就在我一年前降落到地球的那个地方上方……", "t": [2000, 7076]}]}, {"id": "ch26p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Little man,\" I said, \"tell me that it is only a bad dream-- this affair of the snake, and the meeting-place, and the star...\"", "zh": "小家伙，告诉我，这关于蛇、约会和星星的事，只是一场噩梦……", "t": [112, 6875]}]}, {"id": "ch26p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he did not answer my plea.", "zh": "但他并未回应我的哀求。", "t": [100, 2238]}, {"en": "He said to me, instead:", "zh": "他转而对我说：", "t": [2238, 3950]}]}, {"id": "ch26p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The thing that is important is the thing that is not seen...\"", "zh": "那重要的东西，是肉眼无法看见的……", "t": [138, 3287]}]}, {"id": "ch26p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, I know...\"", "zh": "是的，我知道……", "t": [100, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is just as it is with the flower.", "zh": "它对花儿来说也是如此。", "t": [138, 2625]}, {"en": "If you love a flower that lives on a star, it is sweet to look at the sky at night.", "zh": "若你爱上了一朵生长在星星上的花，那么在夜晚仰望星空便显得格外甜蜜。", "t": [2625, 7438]}, {"en": "All the stars are a-bloom with flowers...\"", "zh": "繁星似锦，花开满空", "t": [7438, 9862]}]}, {"id": "ch26p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, I know...\"", "zh": "是的，我知道……", "t": [100, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is just as it is with the water.", "zh": "水亦如此。", "t": [138, 2575]}, {"en": "Because of the pulley, and the rope, what you gave me to drink was like music.", "zh": "因为那辘轳和绳子，你给我的水，如同音乐。", "t": [2575, 7325]}, {"en": "You remember-- how good it was.\"", "zh": "你记得——那时多么美好。", "t": [7325, 8987]}]}, {"id": "ch26p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, I know...\"", "zh": "是的，我知道……", "t": [100, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And at night you will look up at the stars.", "zh": "在夜晚，你会仰望星空。", "t": [138, 2725]}, {"en": "Where I live everything is so small that I cannot show you where my star is to be found.", "zh": "我住的地方一切都很小，无法向你指出我的星星所在之处。", "t": [2725, 7800]}, {"en": "It is better, like that.", "zh": "如此更佳。", "t": [7800, 9912]}, {"en": "My star will just be one of the stars, for you.", "zh": "我的星星只是万千星辰之一，对你而言。", "t": [9912, 13325]}, {"en": "And so you will love to watch all the stars in the heavens...", "zh": "因此，你将喜欢观看天空中所有的星星……", "t": [13325, 16475]}, {"en": "they will all be your friends.", "zh": "它们都将成为你的朋友。", "t": [16475, 18238]}, {"en": "And, besides, I am going to make you a present...\"", "zh": "此外，我还要送你一份礼物……", "t": [18238, 21388]}]}, {"id": "ch26p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He laughed again.", "zh": "他又笑了。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah, little prince, dear little prince!", "zh": "啊，小王子，我亲爱的王子！", "t": [138, 3225]}, {"en": "I love to hear that laughter!\"", "zh": "我喜欢听你的笑声！", "t": [3225, 4763]}]}, {"id": "ch26p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is my present.", "zh": "这是我的礼物。", "t": [138, 1788]}, {"en": "Just that.", "zh": "仅此而已。", "t": [1788, 3025]}, {"en": "It will be as it was when we drank the water...\"", "zh": "它将如同我们共饮那水时一般。", "t": [3025, 5625]}]}, {"id": "ch26p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What are you trying to say?\"", "zh": "你究竟想表达什么？", "t": [125, 1550]}]}, {"id": "ch26p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"All men have the stars,\" he answered, \"but they are not the same things for different people.", "zh": "每个人心中都有星星，但对不同的人来说，它们的意义各不相同。", "t": [138, 5362]}, {"en": "For some, who are travellers, the stars are guides.", "zh": "对某些旅人来说，星星是向导。", "t": [5362, 8988]}, {"en": "For others they are no more than little lights in the sky.", "zh": "对其他人而言，它们不过是天空中微小的灯火。", "t": [8988, 12400]}, {"en": "For others, who are scholars, they are problems.", "zh": "对学者来说，它们是问题。", "t": [12400, 15838]}, {"en": "For my businessman they were wealth.", "zh": "对那位商人来说，它们是财富。", "t": [15838, 18125]}, {"en": "But all these stars are silent.", "zh": "但这些星星都沉默着。", "t": [18125, 20488]}, {"en": "You-- you alone-- will have the stars as no one else has them--\"", "zh": "你——只有你——将拥有别人无法拥有的星星——", "t": [20488, 23688]}]}, {"id": "ch26p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What are you trying to say?\"", "zh": "你究竟想表达什么？", "t": [125, 1550]}]}, {"id": "ch26p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"In one of the stars I shall be living.", "zh": "在某一颗星星上，我将居住。", "t": [138, 2662]}, {"en": "In one of them I shall be laughing.", "zh": "在那颗星星上，我会笑着。", "t": [2662, 4912]}, {"en": "And so it will be as if all the stars were laughing, when you look at the sky at night...", "zh": "当你在夜晚仰望星空时，仿佛所有的星星都在欢笑。", "t": [4912, 9588]}, {"en": "you-- only you-- will have stars that can laugh!\" And he laughed again.", "zh": "你——只有你——将拥有会笑的星星！他再次笑了。", "t": [9588, 13150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p48", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And when your sorrow is comforted (time soothes all sorrows) you will be content that you have known me.", "zh": "当你的悲伤得到慰藉（时间抚平所有悲伤）时，你将满足于曾认识我。", "t": [138, 6075]}, {"en": "You will always be my friend.", "zh": "你永远是我的朋友。", "t": [6075, 8200]}, {"en": "You will want to laugh with me.", "zh": "你愿与我同笑。", "t": [8200, 10100]}, {"en": "And you will sometimes open your window, so, for that pleasure...", "zh": "有时，你也会打开窗子，为了那份快乐……", "t": [10100, 13825]}, {"en": "and your friends will be properly astonished to see you laughing as you look up at the sky!", "zh": "你的朋友们会惊讶地看到你仰望星空时竟在欢笑！", "t": [13825, 18312]}, {"en": "Then you will say to them, 'Yes, the stars always make me laugh!' And they will think you are crazy.", "zh": "是的，星星总是让我笑！他们会以为你疯了。", "t": [18312, 24450]}, {"en": "It will be a very shabby trick that I shall have played on you...\"", "zh": "这将是我在你身上玩的一个非常拙劣的把戏……", "t": [24450, 27688]}]}, {"id": "ch26p49", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he laughed again.", "zh": "他又笑了。", "t": [138, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p50", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It will be as if, in place of the stars, I had given you a great number of little bells that knew how to laugh...\"", "zh": "仿佛我给了你无数会笑的小铃铛……", "t": [138, 6337]}]}, {"id": "ch26p51", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he laughed again.", "zh": "他又笑了。", "t": [138, 1688]}, {"en": "Then he quickly became serious:", "zh": "他很快变得严肃起来：", "t": [1688, 3700]}]}, {"id": "ch26p52", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Tonight-- you know...", "zh": "今夜——你知道……", "t": [100, 1338]}, {"en": "do not come,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“别来了，”小王子说。", "t": [1338, 3563]}]}, {"id": "ch26p53", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall not leave you,\" I said.", "zh": "我不会离开你。", "t": [138, 2063]}]}, {"id": "ch26p54", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall look as if I were suffering.", "zh": "我将显得像是在受苦。", "t": [138, 2438]}, {"en": "I shall look a little as if I were dying.", "zh": "我将显得像是即将离世。", "t": [2438, 5100]}, {"en": "It is like that.", "zh": "它就是这样。", "t": [5100, 6562]}, {"en": "Do not come to see that.", "zh": "别来看那场戏。", "t": [6562, 8450]}, {"en": "It is not worth the trouble...\"", "zh": "不值得费这个劲……", "t": [8450, 10013]}]}, {"id": "ch26p55", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall not leave you.\"", "zh": "我不会离开你。", "t": [138, 1376]}]}, {"id": "ch26p56", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he was worried.", "zh": "但他忧心忡忡。", "t": [112, 1250]}]}, {"id": "ch26p57", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I tell you-- it is also because of the snake.", "zh": "这同样是因为那条蛇。", "t": [138, 3050]}, {"en": "He must not bite you.", "zh": "它不能咬你。", "t": [3050, 4750]}, {"en": "Snakes-- they are malicious creatures.", "zh": "蛇——它们是恶毒的生物。", "t": [4750, 7188]}, {"en": "This one might bite you just for fun...\"", "zh": "这蛇说不定会故意咬你取乐呢……", "t": [7188, 9275]}]}, {"id": "ch26p58", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall not leave you.\"", "zh": "我不会离开你。", "t": [138, 1376]}]}, {"id": "ch26p59", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But a thought came to reassure him:", "zh": "但一个念头让他得到了安慰：", "t": [100, 2126]}]}, {"id": "ch26p60", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is true that they have no more poison for a second bite.\"", "zh": "蛇咬的第二口不再有毒液。", "t": [138, 3388]}]}, {"id": "ch26p61", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "That night I did not see him set out on his way.", "zh": "那晚，我没有看到他踏上归途。", "t": [138, 3375]}, {"en": "He got away from me without making a sound.", "zh": "他悄无声息地从我身边溜走。", "t": [3375, 6288]}, {"en": "When I succeeded in catching up with him he was walking along with a quick and resolute step.", "zh": "他追上他时，他正迈着迅速而坚定的步伐前行。", "t": [6288, 11662]}, {"en": "He said to me merely:", "zh": "他只对我说了这么一句：", "t": [11662, 12875]}]}, {"id": "ch26p62", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "啊！", "t": [100, 825]}, {"en": "You are there...\"", "zh": "你就在那里……", "t": [825, 1612]}]}, {"id": "ch26p63", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he took me by the hand.", "zh": "他握住了我的手。", "t": [138, 2012]}, {"en": "But he was still worrying.", "zh": "他依旧忧心忡忡。", "t": [2012, 3438]}]}, {"id": "ch26p64", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It was wrong of you to come.", "zh": "你来得不对。", "t": [138, 1988]}, {"en": "You will suffer.", "zh": "你将受苦。", "t": [1988, 3388]}, {"en": "I shall look as if I were dead; and that will not be true...\"", "zh": "我将看起来像是死了；其实并非如此……", "t": [3388, 6676]}]}, {"id": "ch26p65", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I said nothing.", "zh": "我无言以对。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p66", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You understand...", "zh": "你懂得……", "t": [138, 1388]}, {"en": "it is too far.", "zh": "路途太过遥远。", "t": [1388, 2725]}, {"en": "I cannot carry this body with me.", "zh": "我无法带着这具身体离去。", "t": [2725, 5038]}, {"en": "It is too heavy.\"", "zh": "这太沉重了。", "t": [5038, 6163]}]}, {"id": "ch26p67", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I said nothing.", "zh": "我无言以对。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p68", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But it will be like an old abandoned shell.", "zh": "却如同褪去的旧壳。", "t": [112, 2738]}, {"en": "There is nothing sad about old shells...\"", "zh": "旧壳并无悲凉之处……", "t": [2738, 4988]}]}, {"id": "ch26p69", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I said nothing.", "zh": "我无言以对。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p70", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was a little discouraged.", "zh": "他有些气馁。", "t": [138, 2162]}, {"en": "But he made one more effort:", "zh": "但他又试了一次：", "t": [2162, 3876]}]}, {"id": "ch26p71", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know, it will be very nice.", "zh": "你懂得，这会非常美好。", "t": [138, 2500]}, {"en": "I, too, shall look at the stars.", "zh": "我也会仰望星空。", "t": [2500, 5200]}, {"en": "All the stars will be wells with a rusty pulley.", "zh": "繁星如井，辘轳生锈。", "t": [5200, 8325]}, {"en": "All the stars will pour out fresh water for me to drink...\"", "zh": "繁星将为我涌出清泉解渴。", "t": [8325, 11713]}]}, {"id": "ch26p72", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I said nothing.", "zh": "无言以对。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p73", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That will be so amusing!", "zh": "那将非常有趣！", "t": [112, 2000]}, {"en": "You will have five hundred million little bells, and I shall have five hundred million springs of fresh water...\"", "zh": "你将拥有五亿个小铃铛，而我将拥有五亿股清泉……", "t": [2000, 7774]}]}, {"id": "ch26p74", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he too said nothing more, because he was crying...", "zh": "他默默无言，只因泪水盈眶。", "t": [112, 3025]}]}, {"id": "ch26p75", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Here it is.", "zh": "这里就是了。", "t": [138, 1325]}, {"en": "Let me go on by myself.\"", "zh": "让我自己继续吧。", "t": [1325, 3062]}]}, {"id": "ch26p76", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he sat down, because he was afraid.", "zh": "他坐下来，因为他害怕了。", "t": [138, 3025]}, {"en": "Then he said, again:", "zh": "他又说道：", "t": [3025, 4512]}]}, {"id": "ch26p77", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know-- my flower...", "zh": "你可知——我的花儿……", "t": [138, 1712]}, {"en": "I am responsible for her.", "zh": "我为她负责。", "t": [1712, 3712]}, {"en": "And she is so weak!", "zh": "她如此脆弱！", "t": [3712, 5262]}, {"en": "She is so naïve!", "zh": "她如此天真！", "t": [5262, 6938]}, {"en": "She has four thorns, of no use at all, to protect herself against all the world...\"", "zh": "她仅有四根刺，毫无用处，却用来抵御整个世界的侵害。", "t": [6938, 11900]}]}, {"id": "ch26p78", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I too sat down, because I was not able to stand up any longer.", "zh": "我也坐了下来，因为我已无法再站立。", "t": [138, 3900]}]}, {"id": "ch26p79", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"There now-- that is all...\"", "zh": "那便足够了……", "t": [125, 1388]}]}, {"id": "ch26p80", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He still hesitated a little; then he got up.", "zh": "他犹疑片刻，然后站起身来。", "t": [138, 3462]}, {"en": "He took one step.", "zh": "他迈出一步。", "t": [3462, 5075]}, {"en": "I could not move.", "zh": "我动弹不得。", "t": [5075, 6162]}]}, {"id": "ch26p81", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "There was nothing but a flash of yellow close to his ankle.", "zh": "踝边，一抹黄光掠过。", "t": [138, 3600]}, {"en": "He remained motionless for an instant.", "zh": "他瞬间僵立不动。", "t": [3600, 6262]}, {"en": "He did not cry out.", "zh": "他没有呼喊。", "t": [6262, 7975]}, {"en": "He fell as gently as a tree falls.", "zh": "他如树般轻轻倒下。", "t": [7975, 10588]}, {"en": "There was not even any sound, because of the sand.", "zh": "连沙沙声也没有，因为沙子的缘故。", "t": [10588, 13587]}]}]}, {"id": "ch27", "title_en": "Chapter XXVII", "title_zh": "第 27 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch27p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And now six years have already gone by...", "zh": "六载光阴，已然逝去……", "t": [112, 2462]}]}, {"id": "ch27p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I have never yet told this story.", "zh": "这故事，我从未对人提起。", "t": [138, 2462]}, {"en": "The companions who met me on my return were well content to see me alive.", "zh": "重逢的伙伴们见到我安然无恙，心中皆感欣慰。", "t": [2462, 7000]}, {"en": "I was sad, but I told them: \"I am tired.\"", "zh": "我心情沉重，却对他们说：“我累得要命。”", "t": [7000, 9963]}]}, {"id": "ch27p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Now my sorrow is comforted a little.", "zh": "我的哀愁得以稍慰。", "t": [112, 2712]}, {"en": "That is to say-- not entirely.", "zh": "这也就是说——并未完全。", "t": [2712, 4838]}, {"en": "But I know that he did go back to his planet, because I did not find his body at daybreak.", "zh": "但我深知他已返回自己的星球，因为天亮时我没有找到他的遗体。", "t": [4838, 10188]}, {"en": "It was not such a heavy body...", "zh": "他的遗体并不沉重……", "t": [10188, 12138]}, {"en": "and at night I love to listen to the stars.", "zh": "夜幕降临，我偏爱聆听星辰的低语。", "t": [12138, 14712]}, {"en": "It is like five hundred million little bells...", "zh": "它们宛如五亿个小铃铛……", "t": [14712, 17413]}]}, {"id": "ch27p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But there is one extraordinary thing...", "zh": "然而，有一件不同寻常的事……", "t": [100, 2225]}, {"en": "when I drew the muzzle for the little prince, I forgot to add the leather strap to it.", "zh": "为小王子画了口罩，却忘了添上皮带。", "t": [2225, 6800]}, {"en": "He will never have been able to fasten it on his sheep.", "zh": "他永远无法将它系在绵羊的脖子上。", "t": [6800, 10012]}, {"en": "So now I keep wondering: what is happening on his planet?", "zh": "我始终在思索：他的星球上究竟发生了什么？", "t": [10012, 13812]}, {"en": "Perhaps the sheep has eaten the flower...", "zh": "或许绵羊已经吃掉了那朵花……", "t": [13812, 16013]}]}, {"id": "ch27p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "At one time I say to myself: \"Surely not!", "zh": "当然，不会吧！", "t": [138, 3450]}, {"en": "The little prince shuts his flower under her glass globe every night, and he watches over his sheep very carefully...\" Then I am happy.", "zh": "小王子每晚都将他的花儿藏进玻璃球中，他精心照看着他的绵羊……于是，我便安心了。", "t": [3450, 11425]}, {"en": "And there is sweetness in the laughter of all the stars.", "zh": "星光笑意中，自有甜蜜。", "t": [11425, 14337]}]}, {"id": "ch27p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But at another time I say to myself: \"At some moment or other one is absent-minded, and that is enough!", "zh": "然而，有时我会对自己说：人难免会疏忽大意，这就足够了！", "t": [100, 6562]}, {"en": "On some one evening he forgot the glass globe, or the sheep got out, without making any noise, in the night...\" And then the little bells are changed to tears...", "zh": "那天晚上，他忘了玻璃球，或者绵羊悄无声息地溜出了，然后那些小铃铛就变成了泪水……", "t": [6562, 15775]}]}, {"id": "ch27p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Here, then, is a great mystery.", "zh": "这是一桩不解之谜。", "t": [138, 2775]}, {"en": "For you who also love the little prince, and for me, nothing in the universe can be the same if somewhere, we do not know where, a sheep that we never saw has-- yes or no?-- eaten a rose...", "zh": "对于你们这些也喜爱小王子的人，还有我，若在宇宙的某个角落，有一只我们从未见过的绵羊——真的吗？——吃掉了一朵玫瑰，那么，宇宙间的一切都将不再相同……", "t": [2775, 13050]}]}, {"id": "ch27p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Look up at the sky.", "zh": "仰望星空。", "t": [112, 1712]}, {"en": "Ask yourselves: is it yes or no?", "zh": "请自问：是，还是否？", "t": [1712, 4500]}, {"en": "Has the sheep eaten the flower?", "zh": "绵羊是否吞食了那朵花？", "t": [4500, 6575]}, {"en": "And you will see how everything changes...", "zh": "你们便会察觉万物如何变幻。", "t": [6575, 8912]}]}, {"id": "ch27p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And no grown-up will ever understand that this is a matter of so much importance!", "zh": "大人永远无法明白，这个问题有多么重要！", "t": [138, 4562]}]}, {"id": "ch27p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "This is, to me, the loveliest and saddest landscape in the world.", "zh": "这，于我而言，是世上最美丽又最悲伤的风光。", "t": [125, 4638]}, {"en": "It is the same as that on the preceding page, but I have drawn it again to impress it on your memory.", "zh": "与前页相同，但我再次绘制它，是为了加深你们的印象。", "t": [4638, 10388]}, {"en": "It is here that the little prince appeared on Earth, and disappeared.", "zh": "小王子便是在此地降临地球，又在此地消失。", "t": [10388, 14037]}]}, {"id": "ch27p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Look at it carefully so that you will be sure to recognise it in case you travel some day to the African desert.", "zh": "仔细端详，以便有朝一日你在非洲沙漠旅行时能认出它。", "t": [100, 6325]}, {"en": "And, if you should come upon this spot, please do not hurry on.", "zh": "若你途经此地，请勿匆匆赶路。", "t": [6325, 10375]}, {"en": "Wait for a time, exactly under the star.", "zh": "在星光下稍作等待。", "t": [10375, 13400]}, {"en": "Then, if a little man appears who laughs, who has golden hair and who refuses to answer questions, you will know who he is.", "zh": "若有个孩童笑逐颜开，金发披肩，对问话不答，你便识得他是谁了。", "t": [13400, 20825]}, {"en": "If this should happen, please comfort me.", "zh": "若此成真，请安慰我。", "t": [20825, 23525]}, {"en": "Send me word that he has come back.", "zh": "请告知我他已归来。", "t": [23525, 25687]}]}, {"id": "ch27p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Saint-Exupéry: A Short Biography", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里：简传", "t": [100, 2688]}]}, {"id": "ch27p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "His friends called him Saint-Ex.", "zh": "他的朋友们称他为圣埃克苏佩里。", "t": [138, 2538]}, {"en": "In reality, he was named Antoine de Saint-Exupéry.", "zh": "实际上，他名叫安东尼·德·圣埃克苏佩里。", "t": [2538, 6425]}, {"en": "He is one of the greatest French writers.", "zh": "他是法国最伟大的作家之一。", "t": [6425, 9150]}, {"en": "He is also one of the pioneers of aviation.", "zh": "他也是航空业的先驱之一。", "t": [9150, 12362]}, {"en": "Here is his story.", "zh": "这是他的故事。", "t": [12362, 13550]}]}, {"id": "ch27p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Saint-Exupéry was born in Lyon in 1900.", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里于1900年出生于里昂。", "t": [125, 3875]}, {"en": "At an early age, he dreamt of adventure.", "zh": "早年，他梦想着冒险。", "t": [3875, 6862]}, {"en": "His greatest ambition was to be an officer in the Navy.", "zh": "他最大的愿望是成为一名海军军官。", "t": [6862, 10462]}, {"en": "In order to become a Naval officer, one had to pass a very difficult exam.", "zh": "为了成为一名海军军官，必须通过一场极其艰难的考试。", "t": [10462, 15250]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry took the exam and failed...", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里应试未果...", "t": [15250, 18025]}, {"en": "there was, fortunately, another solution-- aviation.", "zh": "幸而，还有另一种解决办法——航空。", "t": [18025, 21588]}, {"en": "At this time, aviation was extremely dangerous.", "zh": "那时，航空极为危险。", "t": [21588, 25225]}, {"en": "Danger, risk-- this is precisely for what Saint-Exupéry wished.", "zh": "危险，风险——这正是圣埃克苏佩里所渴望的。", "t": [25225, 29512]}, {"en": "During his military service, he learned to pilot airplanes.", "zh": "在服役期间，他学会了驾驶飞机。", "t": [29512, 33475]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry had only one idea in his head: to fly.", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里心中只有一个念头：飞翔。", "t": [33475, 37200]}]}, {"id": "ch27p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After his military service, he presented himself to the director of an airline company and expressed to him his desire to become a pilot.", "zh": "服役结束后，他向一家航空公司经理表达了自己想成为一名飞行员的愿望。", "t": [138, 7975]}, {"en": "The director told him, \"Do like everyone else.", "zh": "导演对他说：“就像别人一样做吧。”", "t": [7975, 11238]}, {"en": "First, you must become a mechanic.\"", "zh": "首先，你得学会做一名机械师。", "t": [11238, 13562]}]}, {"id": "ch27p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Saint-Exupéry worked to become a mechanic.", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里努力成为一名机械师。", "t": [112, 3162]}, {"en": "In 1927, he finally reached his goal.", "zh": "1927年，他终于实现了目标。", "t": [3162, 6762]}, {"en": "He was the pilot of a formation.", "zh": "他是编队中的飞行员。", "t": [6762, 9150]}, {"en": "He completed dangerous missions over the Mediterranean, over the Sahara.", "zh": "他在地中海、撒哈拉上空完成了危险的飞行任务。", "t": [9150, 13888]}, {"en": "He had many accidents over the middle of the desert.", "zh": "他在沙漠中央遭遇了许多事故。", "t": [13888, 17100]}, {"en": "Later, he was named the director of his own aviation company in South America.", "zh": "后来，他成为南美自己航空公司的总监。", "t": [17100, 22338]}, {"en": "There also, he accomplished many dangerous missions over the Andes.", "zh": "在那儿，他也在安第斯山脉上空完成了许多危险的任务。", "t": [22338, 26438]}]}, {"id": "ch27p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For Saint-Exupéry, flying wasn't just piloting an airplane.", "zh": "对圣埃克苏佩里而言，飞行不仅仅是驾驶飞机。", "t": [125, 4312]}, {"en": "It was also meditating, reflecting.", "zh": "也在沉思，在反思。", "t": [4312, 7325]}, {"en": "During his missions, Saint-Exupéry thought deeply about solitude, friendship, the meaning of life, the human condition, and liberty.", "zh": "在执行任务期间，圣埃克苏佩里深刻思考着孤独、友谊、生命的意义、人的境遇和自由。", "t": [7325, 15925]}, {"en": "He published his reflections.", "zh": "他发表了反思。", "t": [15925, 18150]}, {"en": "His books had immediate success.", "zh": "他的书籍立刻大获成功。", "t": [18150, 20200]}]}, {"id": "ch27p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Unfortunately, the aviation company for which Saint-Exupéry worked was having serious financial problems.", "zh": "不幸的是，圣埃克苏佩里供职的航空公司正面临严重的财务困境。", "t": [112, 6812]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry had to quit the company.", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里不得不离开公司。", "t": [6812, 9500]}, {"en": "He became a journalist.", "zh": "他成为一名记者。", "t": [9500, 11412]}, {"en": "He went to Spain, Russia, and Germany.", "zh": "他游历过西班牙、俄罗斯和德国。", "t": [11412, 14488]}, {"en": "He flew when he could.", "zh": "他一有机会就飞行。", "t": [14488, 15774]}]}, {"id": "ch27p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In 1939, France went to war with Germany.", "zh": "1939年，法国与德国开战。", "t": [138, 3938]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry enlisted immediately in the army.", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里立刻应征入伍。", "t": [3938, 7312]}, {"en": "Defeat came soon.", "zh": "败局随之而至。", "t": [7312, 9050]}, {"en": "France was occupied by Hitler's troops.", "zh": "法国沦陷于希特勒的军队之手。", "t": [9050, 11587]}]}, {"id": "ch27p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Saint-Exupéry didn't accept the defeat.", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里不接受失败。", "t": [112, 3062]}, {"en": "He decided to leave France.", "zh": "他决定离开法国。", "t": [3062, 5275]}, {"en": "He settled in the United States, where he continued to write.", "zh": "他在美国定居，继续写作。", "t": [5275, 9275]}, {"en": "It was in New York that he published The Little Prince, one of his most celebrated books.", "zh": "在纽约，他出版了《小王子》，这是他最著名的作品之一。", "t": [9275, 14324]}]}, {"id": "ch27p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In 1942, American troops landed in North Africa.", "zh": "1942年，美军在北非登陆。", "t": [112, 4550]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry decided to join the American army.", "zh": "圣埃克苏佩里决定加入美国军队。", "t": [4550, 8000]}, {"en": "At age 42, he volunteered to be a pilot.", "zh": "四十二岁时，他志愿成为了一名飞行员。", "t": [8000, 11575]}, {"en": "He was told that he was too old.", "zh": "他被告知自己年纪太大。", "t": [11575, 13962]}, {"en": "He persisted.", "zh": "他坚持不懈。", "t": [13962, 15338]}, {"en": "Finally he obtained satisfaction.", "zh": "终于，他得到了满足。", "t": [15338, 18025]}, {"en": "He was given an airplane.", "zh": "他得到了一架飞机。", "t": [18025, 19888]}, {"en": "He accomplished many missions over occupied France.", "zh": "他在被占领的法国上空完成了许多任务。", "t": [19888, 23126]}]}, {"id": "ch27p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On the 31st of July, 1944, Saint-Exupéry left for his last mission.", "zh": "1944年7月31日，圣埃克苏佩里踏上他最后的使命。", "t": [138, 6138]}, {"en": "His airplane was destroyed by Germans over the Mediterranean.", "zh": "他的飞机在地中海上空被德国人摧毁。", "t": [6138, 10188]}, {"en": "On that day, Saint-Exupéry didn't return...", "zh": "那天，圣埃克苏佩里未能归来……", "t": [10188, 13100]}, {"en": "in the open sky, he found risk, death, and glory.", "zh": "在辽阔的天际，他觅得风险、死亡与荣耀。", "t": [13100, 16712]}]}]}]}